R23C)","description":"Compilateurs, bibliothèques et fichiers d'en-tête permettant de générer des applications qui accèdent aux appareils Android de façon native.","category":"SDK, bibliothèques et frameworks","keywords":["Android","ndk","r23c"]},{"language":"it-it","title":"Android NDK (R23C)","description":"Compilatori, librerie e file di intestazione per compilare app che accedono a dispositivi Android in modalità nativa.","category":"SDK, librerie e framework","keywords":["Android","ndk","r23c"]},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Android NDK (R23C)","description":"Android デバイスへのネイティブ アクセスを行うアプリをビルドするためのコンパイラ、ライブラリ、ヘッダー ファイル。","category":"SDK、ライブラリ、およびフレームワーク","keywords":["Android","ndk","r23c"]},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Android NDK(R23C)","description":"기본적으로 Android 디바이스에 액세스하는 앱을 빌드하기 위한 컴파일러, 라이브러리 및 헤더 파일입니다.","category":"SDK, 라이브러리 및 프레임워크","keywords":["Android","ndk","r23c"]},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Zestaw Android NDK (R23C)","description":"Kompilatory, biblioteki i pliki nagłówkowe potrzebne do kompilowania aplikacji z natywnym dostępem do urządzeń z systemem Android.","category":"Zestawy SDK, biblioteki i struktury","keywords":["Android","ndk","r23c"]},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Android NDK (R23C)","description":"Compiladores, bibliotecas e arquivos de cabeçalho para compilar aplicativos que acessam os dispositivos Android nativamente.","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas","keywords":["Android","ndk","r23c"]},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Android NDK (R23C)","description":"Компиляторы, библиотеки и файлы заголовков для создания приложений, у которых есть собственный доступ к устройствам Android.","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы","keywords":["Android","ndk","r23c"]},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Android NDK (R23C)","description":"Android cihazlara yerel olarak erişen uygulamalar oluşturmak için derleyiciler, kitaplıklar ve üst bilgi dosyaları.","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler","keywords":["Android","ndk","r23c"]}]},{"id":"Component.Android.SDK.MAUI","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkID=627227","dependencies":{"AndroidTools_Xamarin":"5.0","AndroidPlatformTools_Xamarin":"31.0.3","AndroidBuildTools_Xamarin":"30.0.3","AndroidPlatformMAUI":"1.0.1","AndroidPlatformMAUI2":"1.0.0"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Android SDK setup","description":"The Google Android SDK tools used to build Xamarin and MAUI Android apps. They are installed into the global Android SDK folder.","category":"SDKs, libraries, and frameworks","keywords":["Android","APK","Mobile","SDK","setup","Xamarin","Xamarin Android","MAUI"]},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"Android SDK 设置","description":"Google Android SDK 工具用于生成 Xamarin 和 MAUI Android 应用。它们将安装到全局 Android SDK 文件夹中。","category":"SDK、库和框架","keywords":["Android","APK","移动","SDK","设置","Xamarin","Xamarin Android","MAUI"]},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Android SDK 設定","description":"用來建置 Xamarin 及 MAUI Android 應用程式的 Google Android SDK 工具。它們已安裝至全域 Android SDK 資料夾中。","category":"SDK、程式庫和架構","keywords":["Android","APK","行動裝置","SDK","setup","Xamarin","Xamarin Android","MAUI"]},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Instalace Android SDK","description":"Nástroje Google Android SDK Tools se používají k vytváření aplikací Xamarin a MAUI pro Android. Nainstalují se do globální složky Android SDK.","category":"Sady SDK, knihovny a architektury","keywords":["Android","APK","Mobilní","Sada SDK","instalace","Xamarin","Xamarin Android","MAUI"]},{"language":"de-de","title":"Android SDK-Setup","description":"Die Google Android SDK-Tools werden zum Erstellen von Xamarin- und MAUI Android-Apps verwendet. Sie werden im globalen Android SDK-Ordner installiert.","category":"SDKs, Bibliotheken und Frameworks","keywords":["Android","APK","Mobil","SDK","Setup","Xamarin","Xamarin Android","MAUI"]},{"language":"es-es","title":"configuración de Android SDK","description":"Las herramientas de Android SDK de Google se utilizan para crear aplicaciones de Android de Xamarin y MAUI. Se instalan en la carpeta global Android SDK.","category":"SDK, bibliotecas y marcos","keywords":["Android","APK","Móvil","SDK","configuración","Xamarin","Xamarin Android","MAUI"]},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Configuration de Android SDK","description":"Les outils Google Android SDK utilisés pour générer des applications Android Xamarin et MAUI. Ils sont installés dans le dossier Android SDK global.","category":"SDK, bibliothèques et frameworks","keywords":["Android","APK","Mobile","SDK","installation","Xamarin","Xamarin Android","MAUI"]},{"language":"it-it","title":"Configurazione Android SDK","description":"Android SDK Tools di Google utilizzati per creare app Android di Xamarin e MAUI. Vengono installati nella cartella globale Android SDK.","category":"SDK, librerie e framework","keywords":["Android","APK","Dispositivi mobili","SDK","configurazione","Xamarin","Xamarin Android","MAUI"]},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Android SDK のセットアップ","description":"Google Android SDK ツールは、Xamarin と MAUI Android アプリをビルドするために使用されます。グローバル Android SDK フォルダーにインストールされます。","category":"SDK、ライブラリ、およびフレームワーク","keywords":["Android","APK","モバイル","SDK","セットアップ","Xamarin","Xamarin Android","MAUI"]},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Android SDK 설정","description":"Xamarin 및 MAUI Android 앱을 빌드하는 데 사용되는 Google Android SDK 도구입니다. 글로벌 Android SDK 폴더에 설치됩니다.","category":"SDK, 라이브러리 및 프레임워크","keywords":["Android","APK","모바일","SDK","설치","Xamarin","Xamarin Android","MAUI"]},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Konfiguracja zestawu Android SDK","description":"Narzędzia zestawu Google Android SDK służące do tworzenia aplikacji Xamarin i MAUI dla systemu Android. Są one instalowane w globalnym folderze zestawu Android SDK.","category":"Zestawy SDK, biblioteki i struktury","keywords":["Android","APK","Mobilne","SDK","konfiguracja","Xamarin","Xamarin Android","MAUI"]},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Configuração do SDK do Android","description":"As ferramentas de SDK do Android do Google usadas para criar aplicativos Android Xamarin e MAUI. São instaladas na pasta global do SDK do Android.","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas","keywords":["Android","APK","Celular","SDK","instalação","Xamarin","Xamarin Android","MAUI"]},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Настройка пакета SDK для Android","description":"Google Android SDK Tools используются для создания приложений Android Xamarin и MAUI. Они устанавливаются в глобальную папку пакета SDK для Android.","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы","keywords":["Android","APK","Мобильный","SDK","настройка","Xamarin","Xamarin Android","MAUI"]},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Android SDK Kurulumu","description":"Google Android SDK araçları, Xamarin ve MAUI Android uygulamalarını derlemek için kullanılır. Bu araçlar, genel Android SDK klasörüne yüklenmiştir.","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler","keywords":["Android","APK","Mobil","SDK","kurulum","Xamarin","Xamarin Android","MAUI"]}]},{"id":"Component.Cocos","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkID=832025&clcid=0x409","dependencies":{"Cocos2DV1":"1.5.2"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Cocos","description":"Installs Cocos Creator, a game development toolkit based on Cocos2d-x for building cross-platform games.","category":"Games and Graphics","keywords":["Game","graphics","Cocos"]},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"Cocos","description":"安装 Cocos Creator，基于 Cocos2d-x，用于构建跨平台游戏的游戏开发工具包。","category":"游戏和图形","keywords":["游戏","图形","Cocos"]},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Cocos","description":"安裝 Cocos Creator，此遊戲開發工具套件採用 Cocos2d-x，可用於建置跨平台遊戲。","category":"遊戲開發套件","keywords":["遊戲","graphics","Cocos"]},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Cocos","description":"Nainstaluje Cocos Creator, sadu nástrojů na vývoj her pro více platforem vycházející z modulu Cocos2d-x.","category":"Hry a grafika","keywords":["Hra","grafika","Cocos"]},{"language":"de-de","title":"Cocos","description":"Installiert Cocos Creator, ein auf Cocos2d-x basierendes Spieleentwicklungstoolkit zum Erstellen plattformübergreifender Spiele.","category":"Spiele und Grafiken","keywords":["Spiel","Grafiken","Cocos"]},{"language":"es-es","title":"Cocos","description":"Instala Cocos Creator, un kit de herramientas para el desarrollo de juegos basado en Cocos2d-x para la creación de juegos multiplataforma.","category":"Juegos y gráficos","keywords":["Juego","gráficos","Cocos"]},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Cocos","description":"Installe Cocos Creator, un kit de ressources de développement de jeux basé sur Cocos2d-x pour la génération de jeux multiplateformes.","category":"Jeux et graphismes","keywords":["Jeu","graphismes","Cocos"]},{"language":"it-it","title":"Cocos","description":"Installa Cocos Creator, un toolkit per lo sviluppo di giochi basato su Cocos2d-x che consente di creare giochi multipiattaforma.","category":"Giochi e grafica","keywords":["Gioco","grafica","Cocos"]},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Cocos","description":"Cocos Creator をインストールします。クロスプラットフォーム ゲーム作成用の Cocos2d-x に基づくゲーム開発ツールキットです。","category":"ゲーム開発スイート","keywords":["ゲーム","グラフィックス","Cocos"]},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Cocos","description":"플랫폼 간 게임 개발에 사용되는 Cocos2d-x 기반 게임 개발 도구 키트인 Cocos Creator를 설치합니다.","category":"개임 개발 도구 모음","keywords":["게임","그래픽","Cocos"]},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Cocos","description":"Instaluje program Cocos Creator, zestaw narzędzi do tworzenia gier oparty na platformie Cocos2d-x umożliwiającej tworzenie gier dla wielu platform.","category":"Gry i grafika","keywords":["Gra","grafika","Cocos"]},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Cocos","description":"Inclui o Cocos Creator, um kit de ferramentas para desenvolvimento de jogos baseado em Cocos2d-x para compilar jogos de multiplataforma.","category":"Jogos e Elementos Gráficos","keywords":["Jogo","gráficos","Cocos"]},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Cocos","description":"Установка CocosStudio, набора инструментов для создания кроссплатформенных игр на основе Cocos2d-x.","category":"Наборы для разработки игр","keywords":["Игра","графика","Cocos"]},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Cocos","description":"Çoklu platform oyunları oluşturmak amacıyla Cocos2d-x temel alınarak tasarlanmış bir oyun geliştirme araç seti olan Cocos Creator'u yükler.","category":"Oyunlar ve Grafikler","keywords":["Oyun","grafikler","Cocos"]}]},{"id":"Component.CPython39.x64","version":"3.9.13.1","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"outOfSupport":true,"license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkID=2180154","dependencies":{"CPython39.Exe.x64":"","Microsoft.Windows.UniversalCRT.Msu.7":{"version":"[10.0,18.0)","behaviors":"IgnoreApplicabilityFailures"},"Microsoft.Windows.UniversalCRT.Msu.8":{"version":"[10.0,18.0)","behaviors":"IgnoreApplicabilityFailures"},"Microsoft.Windows.UniversalCRT.Msu.81":{"version":"[10.0,18.0)","behaviors":"IgnoreApplicabilityFailures"}},"requirements":{"functors":{"architecture":"x64"}},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Python 3 64-bit (3.9.13) (out of support)","description":"CPython runtime and library. This will install the latest version of the language.","category":"Compilers, build tools, and runtimes"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"Python 3 64 位(3.9.13) (终止支持)","description":"CPython 运行时和库。这将安装该语言的最新版本。","category":"编译器、生成工具和运行时"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Python 3 64-位元 (3.9.13) (支援終止)","description":"CPython 執行階段與程式庫。這會安裝語言的最新版本。","category":"編譯器、建置工具和執行階段"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Python 3, 64bitová verze (3.9.13) (již nepodporováno)","description":"Modul runtime a knihovna CPython. Tímto se nainstaluje nejnovější verze jazyka.","category":"Kompilátory, nástroje pro sestavování buildů a moduly runtime"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Python 3 64 Bit (3.9.13) (nicht mehr unterstützt)","description":"CPython-Runtime und -Bibliothek. Hiermit wird die neueste Version der Sprache installiert.","category":"Compiler, Buildtools und Laufzeiten"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Python 3 64 bits (3.9.13) (fuera de soporte técnico)","description":"Biblioteca y runtime de CPython. Esto instalará la versión más reciente del lenguaje.","category":"Compiladores, herramientas de compilación y entornos de ejecución"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Python 3 64 bits (3.9.13) (non pris en charge)","description":"Runtime et bibliothèque CPython. Cela permet d'installer la dernière version du langage.","category":"Compilateurs, outils de génération et runtimes"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Python 3 a 64 bit (3.9.13) (supporto non più disponibile)","description":"Libreria e runtime CPython. Verrà installata l'ultima versione del linguaggio.","category":"Compilatori, strumenti di compilazione e runtime"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Python 3 64 ビット (3.9.13) (サポート外)","description":"CPython ランタイムおよびライブラリ。この言語の最新バージョンがインストールされます。","category":"コンパイラ、ビルド ツール、およびランタイム"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Python 3 64비트(3.9.13)(지원되지 않음)","description":"CPython 런타임 및 라이브러리입니다. 최신 버전의 언어를 설치합니다.","category":"컴파일러, 빌드 도구 및 런타임"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Język Python 3 w wersji 64-bitowej (3.9.13) (brak pomocy technicznej)","description":"Środowisko uruchomieniowe i biblioteka CPython. Spowoduje to zainstalowanie najnowszej wersji języka.","category":"Kompilatory, narzędzia do kompilacji i środowiska uruchomieniowe"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Python 3 de 64 bits (3.9.13) (sem suporte)","description":"Runtime e biblioteca do CPython. Isso instalará a versão mais recente do idioma.","category":"Compiladores, ferramentas de build e tempos de execução"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"64-разрядный Python 3 (3.9.13) (не поддерживается)","description":"Среда выполнения и библиотека CPython. Будет установлена последняя версия языка.","category":"Компиляторы, средства сборки и среды выполнения"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Python 3 64 bit (3.9.13) (destek kapsamı dışında)","description":"CPython çalışma zamanı ve kitaplığı. Bu, dilin en son sürümünü yükler.","category":"Derleyiciler, derleme araçları ve çalışma zamanları"}]},{"id":"Component.Dotfuscator","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"PreEmptive.Solutions.Dotfuscator.CE":"[6.0,7.0.0.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"PreEmptive Protection - Dotfuscator","description":".NET application obfuscation, runtime protection, and instrumentation injection from PreEmptive Solutions.","category":"Code tools"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"PreEmptive Protection - Dotfuscator","description":"来自 PreEmptive Solutions 的 .NET 应用程序混淆、运行时保护和检测注入。","category":"代码工具"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"PreEmptive Protection - Dotfuscator","description":"PreEmptive Solutions 提供的 .NET 應用程式混淆、執行階段保護及檢測設備導入。","category":"程式碼工具"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"PreEmptive Protection - Dotfuscator","description":"Obfuskace aplikací .NET, ochrana za běhu a injektáž instrumentace od PreEmptive Solutions","category":"Nástroje pro kód"},{"language":"de-de","title":"PreEmptive Protection - Dotfuscator","description":".NET-Anwendungsobfuskation, Laufzeitschutz und Instrumentierungsinjektion von PreEmptive-Lösungen.","category":"Codetools"},{"language":"es-es","title":"PreEmptive Protection - Dotfuscator","description":"Ofuscación de aplicaciones .NET, protección en tiempo de ejecución e inserción de instrumentaciones de PreEmptive Solutions.","category":"Herramientas de código"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"PreEmptive Protection - Dotfuscator","description":"Obfuscation d'application .NET, protection du runtime et injection d'instrumentation à partir de PreEmptive Solutions.","category":"Outils de code"},{"language":"it-it","title":"PreEmptive Protection - Dotfuscator","description":"Strumento per l'offuscamento delle applicazioni .NET, la protezione del runtime e l'injection della strumentazione offerto da PreEmptive Solutions.","category":"Strumenti per il codice"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"PreEmptive Protection - Dotfuscator","description":"PreEmptive Solutions による .NET アプリケーションの難読化、実行時の保護、インストルメンテーション インジェクション。","category":"コード ツール"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"PreEmptive Protection - Dotfuscator","description":"PreEmptive Solutions에서 제공하는 .NET 애플리케이션 난독 처리, 런타임 보호 및 계측 삽입입니다.","category":"코드 도구"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"PreEmptive Protection - Dotfuscator","description":"Iniekcja instrumentacji, ochrona środowiska uruchomieniowego i zaciemnianie kodu aplikacji platformy .NET od firmy PreEmptive Solutions.","category":"Narzędzia do kodowania"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"PreEmptive Protection - Dotfuscator","description":"Ofuscação para aplicativos .NET, proteção de tempo de execução e injeção de instrumentação da PreEmptive Solutions.","category":"Ferramentas de código"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"PreEmptive Protection - Dotfuscator","description":"Обфускация приложений .NET, защита среды выполнения и вставка инструментария от компании PreEmptive Solutions.","category":"Средства для работы с кодом"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"PreEmptive Protection - Dotfuscator","description":"PreEmptive Solutions'dan .NET uygulama kodu karartma, çalışma zamanı koruması ve izleme ekleme özellikleri.","category":"Kod araçları"}]},{"id":"Component.Incredibuild","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkID=691682","dependencies":{"Incredibuild":"[7.31,11.0)","Component.IncredibuildMenu":"1.0"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Incredibuild - Build Acceleration","description":"Accelerate your C, C++, and C# builds, compilations, testing, and other development processes. Shorten your development time. Visualize your builds to identify errors and bottlenecks.","category":"Compilers, build tools, and runtimes","keywords":["IncrediBuild","build"]},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"IncrediBuild - 生成加速","description":"加快 C、C++ 和 C# 生成、编译、测试和其他开发过程。缩短开发时间。通过对生成进行可视化来识别错误和瓶颈。","category":"编译器、生成工具和运行时","keywords":["IncrediBuild","生成"]},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Incredibuild - 建置加速","description":"加快您建置、編譯、測試 C、C++、C# 與其他開發程序的速度。縮短您的開發時間。視覺化您的建置過程，從而找出錯誤與瓶頸。","category":"編譯器、建置工具和執行階段","keywords":["IncrediBuild","build"]},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"IncrediBuild – urychlení sestavení","description":"Zrychlete své sestavování, kompilace, testování a další procesy vývoje v C, C++ a C#. Zkraťte dobu vývoje. Vizualizujte buildy a identifikujte chyby a nedostatky.","category":"Kompilátory, nástroje pro sestavování buildů a moduly runtime","keywords":["IncrediBuild","sestavení"]},{"language":"de-de","title":"Incredibuild – Buildbeschleunigung","description":"Beschleunigen Sie Ihre C#-, C++- und C#-Builds, -Kompilierungen und -Tests sowie weitere Entwicklungsprozesse. Verkürzen Sie die Entwicklungszeit. Visualisieren Sie Ihre Builds, um Fehler und Engpässe zu identifizieren.","category":"Compiler, Buildtools und Runtimes","keywords":["IncrediBuild","Build"]},{"language":"es-es","title":"Incredibuild: Aceleración de compilación","description":"Acelere las compilaciones, pruebas y demás procesos de desarrollo en C, C++ y C#. Reduzca el tiempo de desarrollo. Visualice las compilaciones para identificar errores y cuellos de botella.","category":"Compiladores, herramientas de compilación y entornos de ejecución","keywords":["IncrediBuild","compilación"]},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Incredibuild - Accélération de build","description":"Accélérez vos builds, compilations, tests et autres processus de développement en C, C++ et C#. Réduisez votre temps de développement. Visualisez vos builds pour identifier les erreurs et les goulots d'étranglement.","category":"Compilateurs, outils de génération et runtime","keywords":["IncrediBuild","build"]},{"language":"it-it","title":"IncrediBuild - Accelerazione della compilazione","description":"Consente di accelerare le compilazioni, il testing e altri processi di sviluppo per C, C++ e C#, nonché di ridurre i tempi di sviluppo e di visualizzare le compilazioni per identificare errori e colli di bottiglia.","category":"Compilatori, strumenti di compilazione e runtime","keywords":["IncrediBuild","compilazione"]},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Incredibuild - ビルドのアクセラレーション","description":"C、C++、C# のビルド、コンパイル、テスト、その他の開発プロセスを加速させます。開発時間を短くします。ビルドを視覚化して、エラーとボトルネックを識別します。","category":"コンパイラ、ビルド ツール、およびランタイム","keywords":["IncrediBuild","ビルド"]},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Incredibuild - 빌드 가속","description":"C, C++ 및 C# 빌드, 컴파일, 테스트 및 기타 개발 프로세스의 속도를 높이고 개발 시간을 단축하세요. 빌드를 시각화하여 오류와 병목을 식별하세요.","category":"컴파일러, 빌드 도구 및 런타임","keywords":["IncrediBuild","빌드"]},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Incredibuild — przyspieszanie kompilacji","description":"Przyspiesz tworzenie, kompilacje, testowanie i inne procesy programowania kodu w językach C, C++ i C#. Skróć czas programowania. Wizualizuj kompilacje w celu zidentyfikowania błędów i wąskich gardeł.","category":"Kompilatory, narzędzia do kompilacji i środowiska uruchomieniowe","keywords":["IncrediBuild","kompilacja"]},{"language":"pt-br","title":"IncrediBuild – Aceleração de Build","description":"Acelere testes, compilações e builds de C, C++ e C# e outros processos de desenvolvimento. Reduza seu tempo de desenvolvimento. Visualize seus builds para identificar erros e gargalos.","category":"Compiladores, ferramentas de build e tempos de execução","keywords":["IncrediBuild","build"]},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Incredibuild — ускорение сборки","description":"Ускорьте сборку, компиляцию, тестирование и другие процессы разработки на C, C++ и C#. Сократите время разработки. Визуализируйте сборки, чтобы найти ошибки и узкие места.","category":"Компиляторы, средства сборки и среды выполнения","keywords":["IncrediBuild","сборка"]},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Incredibuild - Derleme Hızlandırma","description":"C, C++ ve C# derlemelerinizi, testlerinizi ve diğer geliştirme işlemlerinizi hızlandırın. Geliştirme sürenizi kısaltın. Hata ve performans sorunlarını belirlemek için derlemelerinizi görselleştirin.","category":"Derleyiciler, derleme araçları ve çalışma zamanları","keywords":["IncrediBuild","derleme"]}]},{"id":"Component.IncredibuildMenu","version":"1.6.0.7","type":"Component","isUiGroup":true,"automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkID=691682","dependencies":{"IncredibuildMenu2022":"1.0"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"IncredibuildMenu","description":"Accelerate your C, C++, and C# builds, compilations, testing, and other development processes. Shorten your development time. Visualize your builds to identify errors and bottlenecks.","category":"Compilers, build tools, and runtimes","keywords":["IncrediBuildMenu","build"]},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"IncrediBuildMenu","description":"加快 C、C++ 和 C# 生成、编译、测试和其他开发过程。缩短开发时间。通过对生成进行可视化来识别错误和瓶颈。","category":"编译器、生成工具和运行时","keywords":["IncrediBuildMenu","生成"]},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"IncredibuildMenu","description":"加快您建置、編譯、測試 C、C++、C# 與其他開發程序的速度。縮短您的開發時間。視覺化您的建置過程，從而找出錯誤與瓶頸。","category":"編譯器、建置工具和執行階段","keywords":["IncrediBuildMenu","build"]},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"IncrediBuildMenu","description":"Zrychlete své sestavování, kompilace, testování a další procesy vývoje v C, C++ a C#. Zkraťte dobu vývoje. Vizualizujte buildy a identifikujte chyby a nedostatky.","category":"Kompilátory, nástroje pro sestavování buildů a moduly runtime","keywords":["IncrediBuildMenu","sestavení"]},{"language":"de-de","title":"IncredibuildMenu","description":"Beschleunigen Sie Ihre C#-, C++- und C#-Builds, -Kompilierungen und -Tests sowie weitere Entwicklungsprozesse. Verkürzen Sie die Entwicklungszeit. Visualisieren Sie Ihre Builds, um Fehler und Engpässe zu identifizieren.","category":"Compiler, Buildtools und Laufzeiten","keywords":["IncrediBuildMenu","Build"]},{"language":"es-es","title":"IncredibuildMenu","description":