e builds de C, C++ e C# e outros processos de desenvolvimento. Reduza seu tempo de desenvolvimento. Visualize seus builds para identificar erros e gargalos.","category":"Compiladores, ferramentas de build e tempos de execução","keywords":["IncrediBuildMenu","build"]},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"IncredibuildMenu","description":"Ускорьте сборку, компиляцию, тестирование и другие процессы разработки на C, C++ и C#. Сократите время разработки. Визуализируйте сборки, чтобы найти ошибки и узкие места.","category":"Компиляторы, средства сборки и среды выполнения","keywords":["IncrediBuildMenu","сборка"]},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"IncredibuildMenu","description":"C, C++ ve C# derlemelerinizi, testlerinizi ve diğer geliştirme işlemlerinizi hızlandırın. Geliştirme sürenizi kısaltın. Hata ve performans sorunlarını belirlemek için derlemelerinizi görselleştirin.","category":"Derleyiciler, derleme araçları ve çalışma zamanları","keywords":["IncrediBuildMenu","derleme"]}]},{"id":"Component.Linux.CMake","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.ExternalBuildFramework":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.CMake.Project":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.CMake":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.WebToolsExtensions":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.VC.CoreIDE.Reduced":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.Linux.CMake":"[17.0,18.0)","Component.MDD.Linux":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Package.NodeJs":"1.0"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ CMake tools for Linux","description":"Visual C++ tools support for CMake and Linux and Dev Containers.","category":"Development activities"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"适用于 Linux 的 C++ CMake 工具","description":"Visual C++ 工具支持 CMake、Linux 和开发容器。","category":"开发活动"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 Linux 的 C++ CMake 工具","description":"適用於 CMake 與 Linux 及開發人員容器的 Visual C++ 工具支援。","category":"開發活動"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Nástroje C++ CMake pro Linux","description":"podpora nástrojů Visual C++ pro CMake a Linux a Dev Containers.","category":"Vývojové aktivity"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++-CMake-Tools für Linux","description":"Visual C++ Tools werden für CMake- und Linux- und Dev-Container unterstützt.","category":"Entwicklungsaktivitäten"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Herramientas de CMake en C++ para Linux","description":"Compatibilidad de Visual C++ con herramientas para CMake y Linux y contenedores de desarrollo.","category":"Actividades de desarrollo"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Outils C++ CMake pour Linux","description":"Prise en charge des outils Visual C++ pour CMake et Linux et Conteneurs de développement","category":"Activités de développement"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Strumenti CMake C++ per Linux","description":"Supporto degli strumenti di Visual C++ per CMake, Linux e Dev Container.","category":"Attività di sviluppo"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Linux 用 C++ CMake ツール","description":"CMake および Linux および Dev Containers のVisual C++ ツールのサポート。","category":"開発作業"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Linux용 C++ CMake 도구","description":"Visual C++ 도구는 CMake 및 Linux 및 Dev 컨테이너를 지원합니다.","category":"개발 작업"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Narzędzia CMake języka C++ dla systemu Linux","description":"Obsługa narzędzi Visual C++ w przypadku narzędzi CMake i systemu Linux oraz kontenerów deweloperskich.","category":"Działania programistyczne"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Ferramentas do CMake do C++ para Linux","description":"Suporte de ferramentas Visual C++ para CMake e Linux e Contêineres de Desenvolvimento.","category":"Atividades de desenvolvimento"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Средства CMake C++ для Linux","description":"Средства Visual C++ поддерживают CMake, Linux и контейнеры разработки.","category":"Действия разработки"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Linux için C++ CMake araçları","description":"CMake, Linux ve Geliştirme Kapsayıcıları için Visual C++ araçları desteği.","category":"Geliştirme etkinlikleri"}]},{"id":"Component.Linux.RemoteFileExplorer","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.VC.CoreIDE.Reduced":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.Linux.RemoteFileExplorer":"[17.0,18.0)","Component.MDD.Linux":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Remote File Explorer for Linux","description":"Visual C++ tools support for browsing remote Linux filesystems.","category":"Development activities"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"适用于 Linux 的远程文件资源管理器","description":"Visual C++工具支持浏览远程 Linux 文件系统。","category":"开发活动"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 Linux 的遠端檔案總管","description":"適用於瀏覽遠端 Linux 檔案系統的 Visual C++ 工具支援。","category":"開發活動"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Vzdálený průzkumník souborů pro Linux","description":"Podpora nástrojů Visual C++ pro procházení vzdálených systémů souborů Linuxu.","category":"Vývojové aktivity"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Remote-Explorer für Linux","description":"Visual C++-Tools unterstützen das Durchsuchen von Linux-Remotedateisystemen.","category":"Entwicklungsaktivitäten"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Explorador de archivos remoto para Linux","description":"Las herramientas de Visual C++ permiten explorar sistemas de archivos Linux remotos.","category":"Actividades de desarrollo"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Explorateur de fichiers distant pour Linux","description":"Prise en charge par les outils Visual C++ de la navigation dans les systèmes de fichiers Linux distants.","category":"Activités de développement"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Esplora file remoto per Linux","description":"supporto degli strumenti di Visual C++ per l'esplorazione di file system Linux remoti.","category":"Attività di sviluppo"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Linux 用 リモート ファイル エクスプローラー","description":"リモート Linux ファイルシステムを参照するためのVisual C++ ツールのサポート。","category":"開発作業"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Linux용 원격 파일 탐색기","description":"원격 Linux 파일 시스템 검색을 위한 Visual C++ 도구 지원","category":"개발 작업"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Zdalny eksplorator plików dla systemu Linux","description":"Obsługa narzędzi środowiska Visual C++ na potrzeby przeglądania zdalnych systemów plików systemu Linux.","category":"Działania programistyczne"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Explorador de Arquivos remoto para Linux","description":"Suporte a ferramentas Visual C++ para navegação de sistemas de arquivos remotos do Linux.","category":"Atividades de desenvolvimento"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Удаленный проводник для Linux","description":"Инструменты Visual C++ с поддержкой просмотра удаленных файловых систем Linux.","category":"Действия разработки"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Linux Dosya Gezgini Uzaktan Erişim","description":"Visual C++ Linux dosya sistemlerine göz atma için yeni araçlar desteği.","category":"Geliştirme etkinlikleri"}]},{"id":"Component.LinuxBuildTools","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.Linux.ConnectionManagerAndMsBuild":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ Tools for Linux Development","description":"Visual Studio Build Tools for C++ Linux development, works for servers, desktops and devices like the Raspberry Pi.","category":"Development activities"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"面向 Linux 开发的 C++工具","description":"面向 C++ 开发的 Visual Studio 生成工具适用于服务器、桌面和设备(如 Raspberry Pi)。","category":"开发活动"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 Linux 開發的 C++ 工具","description":"用於 C++ Linux 開發的 Visual Studio Build Tools，適用於伺服器、桌面與 Raspberry Pi 等裝置。","category":"開發活動"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Nástroje C++ pro vývoj pro Linux","description":"Visual Studio Build Tools pro vývoj v C++ pro Linux funguje pro servery, stolní počítače a zařízení, jako je Raspberry Pi.","category":"Vývojové aktivity"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++-Tools für die Linux-Entwicklung","description":"Visual Studio Build Tools für die C++-Linux-Entwicklung funktioniert für Server, Desktops und Geräte wie Raspberry Pi.","category":"Entwicklungsaktivitäten"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Herramientas de C++ para el desarrollo de Linux","description":"Visual Studio Build Tools para el desarrollo de Linux en C++, funciona para servidores, escritorios y dispositivos como Raspberry Pi.","category":"Actividades de desarrollo"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Outils C++ pour le développement Linux","description":"Visual Studio Build Tools pour le développement Linux C++, fonctionne pour les serveurs, les ordinateurs de bureau et les appareils tels que Raspberry Pi.","category":"Activités de développement"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Strumenti C++ per lo sviluppo di applicazioni Linux","description":"L'estensione di Visual Studio Build Tools per lo sviluppo di applicazioni Linux con C++ funziona con server, desktop e dispositivi come Raspberry Pi.","category":"Attività di sviluppo"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"C++ Tools for Linux Development","description":"Visual Studio Build Tools for C++ Linux Development。サーバー、デスクトップ、Raspberry Pi などのデバイスで動作します。","category":"開発作業"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Linux 개발을 위한 C++ 도구","description":"C++ Linux 개발용 Visual Studio Build Tools는 서버, 데스크톱 및 Raspberry Pi 같은 디바이스에 대해 작동합니다.","category":"개발 작업"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Narzędzia języka C++ do programowania w systemie Linux","description":"Pakiet Visual Studio Build Tools na potrzeby programowania w języku C++ w systemie Linux działa na serwerach, komputerach stacjonarnych i urządzeniach, takich jak Raspberry Pi.","category":"Działania programistyczne"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Ferramentas do C++ para Desenvolvimento em Linux","description":"As Ferramentas de Build do Visual Studio para desenvolvimento em C++ para Linux, funciona para servidores, áreas de trabalho e dispositivos como o Raspberry PI.","category":"Atividades de desenvolvimento"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Инструменты C++ для разработки приложений Linux","description":"Visual Studio Build Tools для разработки приложений Linux на языке C++ предназначено для серверов, настольных компьютеров и устройств, например Raspberry Pi.","category":"Действия разработки"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Linux Geliştirme için C++ Araçları","description":"C++ Linux geliştirme için Visual Studio Derleme Araçları; sunucular, masaüstü bilgisayarlar ve Raspberry Pi gibi cihazlarda çalışır.","category":"Geliştirme etkinlikleri"}]},{"id":"Component.MDD.Android","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.Android":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MDD":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.Community":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ Android development tools","description":"The core tools needed for creating and developing Android applications inside Visual Studio.","category":"Development activities","keywords":["Android","C++","mobile"]},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"C++ Android 开发工具","description":"在 Visual Studio 中创建和开发 Android 应用程序所需的核心工具。","category":"开发活动","keywords":["Android","C++","移动"]},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"C++ Android 開發工具","description":"用於在 Visual Studio 中建立及開發 Android 應用程式的必要核心工具。","category":"開發活動","keywords":["Android","C++","mobile"]},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Vývojové nástroje C++ pro Android","description":"Základní nástroje potřebné pro vytváření a vývoj aplikací pro Android v sadě Visual Studio","category":"Vývojové aktivity","keywords":["Android","C++","mobilní"]},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++ Android-Entwicklungstools","description":"Die grundlegenden Tools für die Erstellung und Entwicklung von Android-Anwendungen in Visual Studio.","category":"Entwicklungsaktivitäten","keywords":["Android","C++","mobil"]},{"language":"es-es","title":"Herramien