, banco de dados e servidor"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Средства работы с веб-заданиями Azure","description":"Средства создания веб-заданий Azure.","category":"Облако, база данных и сервер"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Azure Web İşleri Araçları","description":"Azure Web İşleri oluşturmak için araçlar.","category":"Bulut, veritabanı ve sunucu"}]},{"id":"Component.Microsoft.Web.LibraryManager","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","isUiGroup":true,"automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.WebToolsExtensions":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Web.LibraryManager":"[1.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Library Manager","description":"Library Manager provides a mechanism for managing static library files in your projects.","category":"Development activities"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"库管理器","description":"库管理器提供用于管理项目中的静态库文件的机制。","category":"开发活动"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"程式庫管理員","description":"程式庫管理員提供管理您專案中靜態程式庫檔案的機制。","category":"開發活動"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Správce knihovny","description":"Správce knihovny poskytuje mechanismus pro správu souborů statických knihoven v projektech.","category":"Vývojové aktivity"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Bibliotheks-Manager","description":"Der Bibliotheks-Manager stellt einen Mechanismus für die Verwaltung statischer Bibliotheksdateien in Projekten bereit.","category":"Entwicklungsaktivitäten"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Administrador de bibliotecas","description":"El Administrador de bibliotecas proporciona un mecanismo para administrar los archivos de biblioteca estática en sus proyectos.","category":"Actividades de desarrollo"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Gestionnaire de bibliothèques","description":"Le Gestionnaire de bibliothèques fournit un mécanisme de gestion des fichiers bibliothèques statiques présents dans vos projets.","category":"Activités de développement"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Gestione librerie","description":"Gestione librerie offre un meccanismo per gestire file di libreria statica nei progetti.","category":"Attività di sviluppo"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"ライブラリ マネージャー","description":"ライブラリ マネージャーは、プロジェクトでスタティック ライブラリ ファイルを管理するためのメカニズムを提供します。","category":"開発作業"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"라이브러리 관리자","description":"라이브러리 관리자는 프로젝트의 정적 라이브러리 파일을 관리하는 메커니즘을 제공합니다.","category":"개발 작업"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Menedżer biblioteki","description":"Menedżer biblioteki udostępnia mechanizm umożliwiający zarządzanie statycznymi plikami biblioteki w projektach.","category":"Działania programistyczne"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Gerenciador de Bibliotecas","description":"O Gerenciador de Bibliotecas fornece um mecanismo para gerenciar arquivos de biblioteca estática em seus projetos.","category":"Atividades de desenvolvimento"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Диспетчер библиотек","description":"Диспетчер библиотек предоставляет механизм управления файлами статической библиотеки в проекте.","category":"Действия разработки"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Kitaplık Yöneticisi","description":"Kitaplık Yöneticisi, projelerinizdeki statik kitaplık dosyalarını yönetmek için bir mekanizma sağlar.","category":"Geliştirme etkinlikleri"}]},{"id":"Component.Microsoft.WebTools.BrowserLink.WebLivePreview","version":"17.13.10.44860","type":"Component","isUiGroup":true,"automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.WebToolsExtensions":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.WebTools.BrowserLink.WebLivePreview":""},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Web Live Preview","description":"For ASP.NET Framework projects you can view the source code that generated the selected HTML element. After the source is modified, the web app will be updated automatically.","category":"Development activities"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"Web Live Preview","description":"对于 ASP.NET Framework 项目，你可以查看生成所选 HTML 元素的源代码。修改源后，将自动更新 web 应用。","category":"开发活动"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Web Live Preview","description":"對於 ASP.NET Framework 專案，您可以檢視產生所選 HTML 元素的原始程式碼。修改來源之後，Web 應用程式將會自動更新。","category":"開發活動"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Web Live Preview","description":"Pro projekty ASP.NET Framework si můžete zobrazit zdrojový kód, který vygeneroval vybraný element HTML. Až se zdroj upraví, webová aplikace se automaticky aktualizuje.","category":"Vývojové aktivity"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Web Live Preview","description":"Für ASP.NET Framework-Projekte können Sie den Quellcode anzeigen, der das ausgewählte HTML-Element generiert hat. Nachdem die Quelle geändert wurde, wird die Web-App aktualisiert.","category":"Entwicklungsaktivitäten"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Web Live Preview","description":"Para los proyectos de ASP.NET Framework, puede ver el código fuente que generó el elemento HTML seleccionado. Una vez que se modifique el origen, la aplicación web se actualizará de forma automática.","category":"Actividades de desarrollo"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Web Live Preview","description":"Pour les projets du framework ASP.NET, vous pouvez voir le code source qui a généré l'élément HTML sélectionné. Une fois la source modifiée, l'application web est mise à jour automatiquement.","category":"Activités de développement"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Web Live Preview","description":"Per i progetti Framework ASP.NET è possibile visualizzare il codice sorgente che ha generato l'elemento HTML selezionato. Dopo la modifica del codice sorgente, l'applicazione Web verrà aggiornata automaticamente.","category":"Attività di sviluppo"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Web Live Preview","description":"ASP.NET Framework プロジェクトでは、選択された HTML 要素を生成したソース コードを表示できます。ソースを変更すると、Web アプリは自動的に更新されます。","category":"開発作業"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Web Live Preview","description":"ASP.NET Framework 프로젝트의 경우 선택한 HTML 요소를 생성한 소스 코드를 볼 수 있습니다. 소스가 수정되면 웹앱이 자동으로 업데이트됩니다.","category":"개발 작업"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Web Live Preview","description":"W przypadku projektów platformy ASP.NET można wyświetlić kod źródłowy, który wygenerował wybrany element HTML. Po zmodyfikowaniu źródła aplikacja internetowa zostanie zaktualizowana automatycznie.","category":"Działania programistyczne"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Web Live Preview","description":"Para projetos do ASP.NET Framework, você pode exibir o código-fonte que gerou o elemento HTML selecionado. Após a modificação da origem, o aplicativo Web será atualizado automaticamente.","category":"Atividades de desenvolvimento"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Web Live Preview","description":"Для проектов ASP.NET Framework можно просмотреть исходный код для выбранного элемента HTML. После изменения исходного кода веб-приложение будет обновлено автоматически.","category":"Действия разработки"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Web Live Preview","description":"ASP.NET Framework projelerinde, seçili HTML öğesini oluşturan kaynak kodunu görüntüleyebilirsiniz. Web uygulaması, kaynak değiştirildikten sonra otomatik olarak güncelleştirilir.","category":"Geliştirme etkinlikleri"}]},{"id":"Component.Microsoft.Windows.DriverKit","version":"10.0.26100.12","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.Windows.DriverKit":"[10.0.0,11.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Windows Driver Kit","description":"A set of extensions that integrates Windows Driver development into Visual Studio.","category":"SDKs, libraries, and frameworks"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"Windows 驱动程序工具包(WDK)","description":"将 Windows 驱动程序开发集成到 Visual Studio 的一组扩展。","category":"SDK、库和框架"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Windows 驅動程式套件","description":"一組延伸模組，可將 Windows 驅動程式開發整合至 Visual Studio。","category":"SDK、程式庫和架構"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Sada WDK (Windows Driver Kit)","description":"Sada rozšíření, která integrují vývoj ovladačů systému Windows do Visual Studia.","category":"Sady SDK, knihovny a architektury"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Windows-Treiberkit","description":"Eine Reihe von Erweiterungen, die die Entwicklung von Windows-Treibern in Visual Studio integrieren.","category":"SDKs, Bibliotheken und Frameworks"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Kit para controladores de Windows","description":"Conjunto de extensiones que integra el desarrollo de controladores de Windows en Visual Studio.","category":"SDK, bibliotecas y marcos"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Windows Driver Kit","description":"Ensemble d’extensions qui intègre le développement de Windows Driver dans Visual Studio.","category":"SDK, bibliothèques et frameworks"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Windows Driver Kit","description":"Set di estensioni che integra lo sviluppo di Windows Driver in Visual Studio.","category":"SDK, librerie e framework"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Windows Driver Kit","description":"Windows ドライバーの開発を Visual Studio に統合する拡張機能のセット。","category":"SDK、ライブラリ、およびフレームワーク"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"WDK(Windows 드라이버 키트)","description":"Windows 드라이버 개발을 Visual Studio에 통합하는 확장 집합입니다.","category":"SDK, 라이브러리 및 프레임워크"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Zestaw sterowników systemu Windows","description":"Zestaw rozszerzeń, który integruje programowanie sterowników systemu Windows z programem Visual Studio.","category":"Zestawy SDK, biblioteki i struktury"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Kit de Driver do Windows (WDK)","description":"Um conjunto de extensões que integra o desenvolvimento do Driver do Windows no Visual Studio.","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Комплект разработки драйверов для Windows","description":"Набор расширений, который интегрирует разработку драйверов Windows в Visual Studio.","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Windows Sürücü Seti","description":"Windows Sürücü geliştirmeyi Visual Studio’yla tümleştiren uzantılar kümesi.","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler"}]},{"id":"Component.Microsoft.Windows.DriverKit.BuildTools","ver