 SDK, biblioteki i struktury"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Kit de Driver do Windows (WDK) ferramentas de build","description":"Ferramentas de build para desenvolvimento de Driver do Windows.","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"комплект разработки драйверов для Windows средства сборки","description":"Средства сборки для разработки драйверов Windows.","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Windows Sürücü Seti Derleme Araçları","description":"Windows Sürücü geliştirme için derleme araçları.","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler"}]},{"id":"Component.OpenJDK","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkID=733796","dependencies":{"OpenJDKv8":"8.0.302","OpenJDKv17":"17.0.8.0"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"OpenJDK (Microsoft distribution)","description":"Microsoft's distribution of OpenJDK for Android development","category":"SDKs, libraries, and frameworks"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"OpenJDK (Microsoft 分发)","description":"Microsoft 提供的用于 Android 开发的 OpenJDK 分发","category":"SDK、库和框架"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"OpenJDK (Microsoft 散發)","description":"OpenJDK for Android 開發的 Microsoft 散發","category":"SDK、程式庫和架構"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"OpenJDK (distribuce Microsoftu)","description":"Distribuce OpenJDK od Microsoftu pro vývoj pro Android","category":"Sady SDK, knihovny a architektury"},{"language":"de-de","title":"OpenJDK (Microsoft-Distribution)","description":"Microsoft-Distribution von OpenJDK zur Android-Entwicklung","category":"SDKs, Bibliotheken und Frameworks"},{"language":"es-es","title":"OpenJDK (distribución de Microsoft)","description":"Distribución de Microsoft de OpenJDK para desarrollo de Android","category":"SDK, bibliotecas y marcos"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"OpenJDK (distribution Microsoft)","description":"Distribution OpenJDK de Microsoft pour le développement Android","category":"SDK, bibliothèques et frameworks"},{"language":"it-it","title":"OpenJDK (distribuzione Microsoft)","description":"Distribuzione Microsoft di OpenJDK per lo sviluppo di app Android","category":"SDK, librerie e framework"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"OpenJDK (Microsoft ディストリビューション)","description":"Microsoft の Android 開発用 OpenJDK ディストリビューション","category":"SDK、ライブラリ、およびフレームワーク"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"OpenJDK(Microsoft 배포)","description":"Android 개발을 위한 Microsoft의 OpenJDK 배포","category":"SDK, 라이브러리 및 프레임워크"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Zestaw OpenJDK (dystrybucja firmy Microsoft)","description":"Dystrybucja firmy Microsoft zestawu OpenJDK do tworzenia aplikacji dla systemu Android","category":"Zestawy SDK, biblioteki i struktury"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"OpenJDK (distribuição da Microsoft)","description":"Distribuição da Microsoft do OpenJDK para desenvolvimento para Android","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"OpenJDK (версия, распространяемая Майкрософт)","description":"Версия OpenJDK для разработки приложений Android, предоставляемая корпорацией Майкрософт","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"OpenJDK (Microsoft dağıtımı)","description":"Microsoft'un Android geliştirme için OpenJDK dağıtımı","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler"}]},{"id":"Component.UnityEngine.x64","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkID=617016&clcid=0x409","dependencies":{"Unity3d.x64":"7.0"},"requirements":{"functors":{"architecture":"x64"}},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Unity Hub","description":"The Unity Hub is a standalone application that streamlines the way you find, download, and manage your Unity Projects and installations","category":"Games and Graphics","keywords":["Game","graphics","Unity"]},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"Unity Hub","description":"Unity Hub 是一个独立的应用程序，可以简化查找、下载和管理 Unity 项目和安装的方式","category":"游戏和图形","keywords":["游戏","图形","Unity"]},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Unity 中樞","description":"Unity 中樞是獨立應用程式，可簡化您尋找、下載與管理您 Unity 專案及安裝的方式","category":"遊戲開發套件","keywords":["遊戲","graphics","Unity"]},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Unity Hub","description":"Unity Hub je samostatná aplikace, která zjednodušuje způsob, jak vyhledávat, stahovat a spravovat projekty a instalace Unity.","category":"Hry a grafika","keywords":["Hra","grafika","Unity"]},{"language":"de-de","title":"Unity Hub","description":"Der Unity Hub ist eine eigenständige Anwendung, die das Auffinden, Herunterladen und Verwalten Ihrer Unity-Projekte und -Installationen optimiert.","category":"Spiele und Grafiken","keywords":["Spiel","Grafiken","Unity"]},{"language":"es-es","title":"Centro de conectividad de Unity","description":"El centro de conectividad de Unity es una aplicación independiente que racionaliza la manera de encontrar, descargar y administrar los proyectos e instalaciones de Unity.","category":"Juegos y gráficos","keywords":["Juego","gráficos","Unity"]},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Unity Hub","description":"Unity Hub est une application autonome qui simplifie la recherche, le téléchargement et la gestion de vos projets et installations Unity","category":"Jeux et graphismes","keywords":["Jeu","graphismes","Unity"]},{"language":"it-it","title":"Hub Unity","description":"Hub Unity è un'applicazione autonoma che consente di trovare, scaricare e gestire facilmente progetti e installazioni di Unity","category":"Giochi e grafica","keywords":["Gioco","grafica","Unity"]},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Unity Hub","description":"Unity Hub は、Unity のプロジェクトとインストールを検索、ダウンロード、管理する方法を合理化するスタンドアロン アプリケーションです","category":"ゲーム開発スイート","keywords":["ゲーム","グラフィックス","Unity"]},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Unity Hub","description":"Unity Hub는 Unity 프로젝트 및 설치를 검색, 다운로드 및 관리하는 방법을 간소화하는 독립 실행형 애플리케이션입니다.","category":"개임 개발 도구 모음","keywords":["게임","그래픽","Unity"]},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Unity Hub","description":"Unity Hub to autonomiczna aplikacja, która upraszcza wyszukiwanie i pobieranie projektów i instalacji aparatu Unity oraz zarządzanie nimi","category":"Gry i grafika","keywords":["Gra","grafika","Unity"]},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Unity Hub","description":"O Unity Hub é um aplicativo autônomo que simplifica a maneira como você localiza, baixa e gerencia os Projetos e instalações do Unity","category":"Jogos e Elementos Gráficos","keywords":["Jogo","gráficos","Unidade"]},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Unity Hub","description":"Unity Hub — это автономное приложение, которое упрощает поиск проектов и установленных систем Unity, а также их скачивание и управление ими.","category":"Наборы для разработки игр","keywords":["Игра","графика","Unity"]},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Unity Hub'ı","description":"Unity Hub'ı, Unity Projelerinizi ve yüklemelerinizi bulma, indirme ve yönetme şeklinizi kolaylaştıran bağımsız bir uygulamadır","category":"Oyunlar ve Grafikler","keywords":["Oyun","grafikler","Unity"]}]},{"id":"Component.Unreal","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=708610","dependencies":{"UnrealEngineV1":"1.0","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.Windows10SDK":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.CoreIDE":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.Tools.x86.x64":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Net.ComponentGroup.DevelopmentPrerequisites":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.Roslyn.LanguageServices":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Net.ComponentGroup.TargetingPacks.Common":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Net.Component.4.6.2.TargetingPack":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.NuGet.BuildTools":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Unreal Engine installer","description":"Includes the Epic Games Launcher for installing the Unreal Engine for building high-fidelity experiences for PC, console, mobile, VR, and the web.","category":"Games and Graphics","keywords":["Game","graphics","Unreal"]},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"Unreal Engine 安装程序","description":"包含用于安装 Unreal Engine 的 Epic Games Launcher，带来电脑、控制台、移动设备、VR 和 Web 的高保真体验。","category":"游戏和图形","keywords":["游戏","图形","Unreal"]},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Unreal Engine 安裝程式","description":"附有 Epic Games Launcher，可用於安裝 Unreal Engine，從而為電腦、主控台、行動裝置、VR 及網路打造逼真感十足的體驗。","category":"遊戲開發套件","keywords":["遊戲","graphics","Unreal"]},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Instalační program Unreal Engine","description":"Obsahuje Spouštěcí program pro Epic Games pro nainstalování Unreal Engine k vytváření velmi věrných prostředí pro osobní počítače, konzoly, mobilní zařízení, virtuální realitu a web.","category":"Hry a grafika","keywords":["Hra","grafika","Unreal"]},{"language":"de-de","title":"Unreal Engine-Installer","description":"Enthält den Epic Games Launcher zum Installieren von Unreal Engine. Verwenden Sie Unreal Engine zum Erstellen von High Fidelity-Anwendungen für PC, Konsole, mobile Geräte, VR und das Web.","category":"Spiele und Grafiken","keywords":["Spiel","Grafiken","Unreal"]},{"language":"es-es","title":"Cliente de instalación del motor Unreal","description":"Incluye el Selector de juegos Epic para instalar Unreal Engine a fin de compilar experiencias de alta fidelidad para PC, consola, móvil, VR y la Web.","category":"Juegos y gráficos","keywords":["Juego","gráficos","Unreal"]},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Programme d'installation Unreal Engine","description":"Inclut Epic Games Launcher pour l'installation d'Unreal Engine, qui permet de créer des expériences haute fidélité dans les domaines suivants : PC, consoles, mobiles, VR et web.","category":"Jeux et graphismes","keywords":["Jeu","graphismes","Unreal"]},{"language":"it-it","title":"Programma di installazione di Unreal Engine","description":"Include Epic Games Launcher per l'installazione di Unreal Engine che consente di creare esperienze ad alta fedeltà per PC, console, dispositivi mobili, realtà virtuale e Web.","category":"Giochi e grafica","keywords":["Gioco","grafica","Unreal"]},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Unreal Engine のインストーラー","description":"Unreal Engine をインストールして、PC、コンソール、モバイル、VR、Web 用の高度なエクスペリエンスを作成するための Epic Games Launcher が含まれます。","category":"ゲームおよびグラフィックス","keywords":["ゲーム","グラフィックス","Unreal"]},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Unreal Engine 설치 관리자","description":"PC, 콘솔, 모바일, VR 및 웹을 위한 고품질 환경을 만들기 위해 Unreal Engine 설치용 Epic Games 시작 관리자를 포함합니다.","category":"개임 및 그래픽","keywords":["게임","그래픽","Unreal"]},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Instalator aparatu Unreal Engine","description":"Obejmuje program Epic Games Launcher umożliwiający instalowanie aparatu Unreal Engine w celu tworzenia środowiska o wysokiej wierności dla komputerów, konsol, urządzeń przenośnych, rzeczywistości wirtualnej i sieci Web.","category":"Gry i grafika","keywords":["Gra","grafika","Unreal"]},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Instalador do Unreal Engine","description":"Inclui o Epic Games Launcher para instalar o Unreal Engine a fim de criar experiências de alta fidelidade para PC, console, dispositivos móveis, VR e a Web.","category":"Jogos e Elementos Gráficos","keywords":["Jogo","gráficos","Unreal"]},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Установщик Unreal Engine","description":"Содержит средство запуска Epic Games, устанавливающее систему Unreal Engine, позволяющую создавать высококачественные продукты для компьютеров, консолей, мобильных телефонов, устройств виртуальной реальности и браузеров.","category":"Наборы для разработки игр","keywords":["Игра","графика","Unreal"]},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Unreal Engine yükleyicisi","description":"PC, konsol, mobil, sanal gerçeklik ve Web için yüksek kaliteli deneyimler oluşturmak üzere Unreal Engine'i yüklemeyi sağlayan Epic Games Launcher'ı içerir.","category":"Oyunlar ve Grafikler","keywords":["Oyun","grafikler","Unreal"]}]},{"id":"Component.Unreal.Android","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=708610","dependencies":{"Component.Unreal":"[17.0,18.0)","Component.Android.SDK.MAUI":"[17.0,18.0)","Component.OpenJDK":"[17.0,18.0)","Component.MDD.Android":"[17.0,18.0)","Component.Android.NDK.R23C":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Android Visual Studio Tools for Unreal Engine","description":"Includes the Visual Studio Android components needed to build, deploy, and debug Unreal applications with Visual Studio.","category":"Games and Graphics","keywords":["Game","graphics","Unreal"]},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"Android Visual Studio Tools for Unreal Engine","description":"包括通过 Visual Studio 生成、部署和调试 Unreal 应用程序所需的 Visual Studio Android 组件。","category":"游戏和图形","keywords":["游戏","图形","Unreal"]},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Android Visual Studio Tools for Unreal Engine","description":"包含使用 Visual Studio 建置、部署 Unreal 應用程式及對其進行偵錯時所需的 Visual Studio Android 元件。","category":"遊戲開發套件","keywords":["遊戲","graphics","Unreal"]},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Android Visual Studio Tools pro Unreal Engine","description":"Zahrnuje součásti Visual Studio pro Android nutné pro sestavení, nasazení a ladění aplikací Unreal pomocí sady Visual Studio.","category":"Hry a grafika","keywords":["Hra","grafika","Unreal"]},{"language":"de-de","title":"Android Visual Studio-Tools für Unreal Engine","description":"Enthält die Visual Studio Android-Komponenten, die zum Erstellen, Bereitstellen und Debuggen von Unreal-Anwendungen mit Visual Studio erforderlich sind.","category":"Spiele und Grafiken","keywords":["Spiel","Grafiken","Unreal"]},{"language":"es-es","title":"Android Visual Studio Tools para Unreal Engine","description":"Incluye los componentes Android de Visual Studio necesarios para compilar, implementar y depurar aplicaciones Unreal con Visual Studio.","category":"Juegos y gráficos","keywords":["Juego","gráficos","Unreal"]},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Moteur Android Visual Studio Tools pour Unreal","description":"Comprend les composants Visual Studio Android nécessaires pour générer, déployer et déboguer des applications Unreal avec Visual Studio.","category":"Jeux et graphismes","keywords":["Jeu","graphismes","Unreal"]},{"language":"it-it","title":"Strumenti di Visual Studio Android per Unreal Engine","description":"Include i componenti di Visual Studio Android necessari per compilare, distribuire ed eseguire il debug di applicazioni Unreal con Visual Studio.","category":"Giochi e grafica","keywords":["Gioco","grafica","Unreal"]},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Unreal Engine 用 Android Visual Studio Tools","description":"Visual Studio で Unreal アプリケーションをビルド、展開、デバッグするために必要な Visual Studio Android コンポーネントが含まれています。","category":"ゲーム開発スイート","keywords":["ゲーム","グラフィックス","Unreal"]},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Unreal Engine용 Android Visual Studio Tools","description":"Visual Studio에서 Unreal 애플리케이션을 빌드, 배포 및 디버그하는 데 필요한 Visual Studio Android 구성 요소를 포함합니다.","category":"개임 개발 도구 모음","keywords":["게임","그래픽","Unreal"]},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Android Visual Studio Tools dla aparatu Unreal Engine","description":"Obejmuje składniki programu Visual Studio dla systemu Android potrzebne do kompilowania, wdrażania i debugowania aplikacji w technologii Unreal za pomocą programu Visual Studio.","category":"Gry i grafika","keywords":["Gra","grafika","Unreal"]},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Ferramentas do Visual Studio para Unreal Engine do Android","description":"Inclui os componentes do Visual Studio Android necessários para compilar, implantar e depurar aplicativos do Unreal com o Visual Studio.","category":"Jogos e Elementos Gráficos","keywords":["Jogo","gráficos","Unreal"]},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Инструменты Visual Studio (Android) для Unreal Engine","description":"Включает компоненты Visual Studio Android, необходимые для сборки, развертывания и отладки приложений Unreal в Visual Studio.","category":"Наборы для разработки игр","keywords":["Игра","графика","Unreal"]},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Unreal Engine için Android Visual Studio Araçları","description":"Visual Studio ile Unreal uygulamaları derlemek, dağıtmak ve bu uygulamalarda hata ayıklamak için gereken Visual Studio Android bileşenlerini içerir.","category":"Oyunlar ve Grafikler","keywords":["Oyun","grafikler","Unreal"]}]},{"id":"Component.Unreal.Debugger","version":"17.13.35729.101","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"license":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=708610","dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.UnrealEngineTools.BlueprintConcordExtension":"[17.0,18.0)","Component.Unreal.Ide":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Visual Studio debugger tools for Unreal Engine Blueprints (Preview)","description":"Includes the support for enhancing the Visual Studio debugger to display information about Unreal Engine Blueprints","category":"Games and Graphics","keywords":["Game","graphics","Unreal"]},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"用于预览) (Unreal Engine蓝图的Visual Studio调试器工具","description":"包括增强Visual Studio调试器以显示有关Unreal Engine蓝图的信息的支持","category":"游戏和图形","keywords":["游戏","图形","Unreal"]},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Visual Studio預覽) Unreal Engine 藍圖 (調試程式工具","description":"包含增強Visual Studio調試程序的支援，以顯示 Unreal Engine 藍圖的相關信息","category":"遊戲開發套件","keywords":["比賽","graphics","Unreal"]},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Visual Studio ladicí nástroje pro Unreal Engine podrobné plány (Preview)","description":"Zahrnuje podporu rozšíření ladicího programu Visual Studio tak, aby se zobrazovaly informace o Unreal Engine podrobných plánech.","category":"Hry a grafika","keywords":["Hra","grafika","Unreal"]},{"language":"de-de","title":"Visual Studio Debuggertools für Unreal Engine Blaupausen (Vorschau)","description":"Enthält die Unterstützung zum Verbessern des Visual Studio Debuggers, um Informationen zu Unreal Engine Blaupausen anzuzeigen.","category":"Spiele und Grafiken","keywords":["Spiel","grafik","Unwirklich"]},{"language":"es-es","title":"Herramientas del depurador de Visual Studio para Unreal Engine Blueprints (versión preliminar)","description":"Incluye compatibilidad para mejorar el depurador de Visual Studio para mostrar información acerca de Unreal Engine blueprints","category":"Juegos y gráficos","keywords":["Juego","gráficos","Unreal"]},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Outils de débogueur Visual Studio pour les Blueprints Unreal Engine (préversion)","description":"Inclut la prise en charge de l’amélioration du débogueur de Visual Studio pour afficher des informations sur les Blueprints Unreal Engine","category":"Jeux et graphismes","keywords":["Jeu","graphismes","Unreal"]},{"language":"it-it","title":"strumenti del debugger Visual Studio per progetti Unreal Engine (anteprima)","description":"Include il supporto per migliorare il debugger Visual Studio per visualizzare informazioni sui progetti Unreal Engine","category":"Giochi e grafica","keywords":["Gioco","grafica","Unreal"]},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Unreal Engine ブループリント用のVisual Studio デバッガー ツール (プレビュー)","description":"ブループリントに関する情報を表示するためのVisual Studio デバッガーの拡張Unreal Engineサポートが含まれます","category":"ゲームおよびグラフィックス","keywords":["ゲーム","グラフィックス","Unreal"]},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Unreal Engine 청사진용 디버거 도구 Visual Studio(미리 보기)","description":"Visual Studio 청사진에 대한 정보를 표시하기 위한 Unreal Engine Visual Studio 디버거 향상에 대한 지원을 포함합니다.","category":"개임 및 그래픽","keywords":["게임","그래픽","Unreal"]},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Visual Studio narzędzia debugera dla strategii Unreal Engine (wersja zapoznawcza)","description":"Obejmuje obsługę ulepszania debugera Visual Studio w celu wyświetlania informacji o strategiach Unreal Engine","category":"Gry i grafika","keywords":["Gra","grafika","Unreal"]},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Visual Studio do depurador para Unreal Engine Blueprints (Versão Prévia)","description":"Inclui o suporte para aprimorar o depurador Visual Studio para e