 Platformu uygulamalarını derlemek ve dağıtmak için bir ön derleme teknolojisi.","category":".NET"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.Component.PythonTools","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.PythonTools.Core.Vsix":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.PythonTools.Core.Templates.Vsix":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.Core":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.Debugger.Core":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.TestTools.Core":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.TestTools.CodeCoverage_1779377902":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.TestTools.CodeCoverage","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.EnterpriseX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise"]},"Microsoft.PythonTools.Profiling.Vsix":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.PackageGroup.DiagnosticsHub.Platform":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.PackageGroup.Icecap.Core":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.InteractiveWindow":"[4.0,5.0.0.0)","Microsoft.Build":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.CookiecutterTools.Vsix":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Package.NodeJs":"1.0"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Python language support","description":"Support for writing Python scripts and web services, including IntelliSense, debugging, profiling, and templates.","category":"Development activities"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"Python 语言支持","description":"支持编写 Python 脚本和 web 服务，包括 IntelliSense、调试、分析和模板。","category":"开发活动"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Python 語言支援","description":"支援寫入 Python 指令碼及 Web 服務，包括 IntelliSense、偵錯、分析及範本。","category":"開發活動"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Podpora jazyka Python","description":"Podpora pro psaní skriptů Python a webových služeb, včetně IntelliSense, ladění, profilování a šablon.","category":"Vývojové aktivity"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Python-Sprachunterstützung","description":"Unterstützung für das Schreiben von Python-Skripten und Webdiensten, einschließlich IntelliSense, Debuggen, Profilerstellung und Vorlagen.","category":"Entwicklungsaktivitäten"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Compatibilidad con el lenguaje Python","description":"Compatibilidad con la escritura de scripts de Python y servicios web, incluidos IntelliSense, depuración, generación de perfiles y plantillas.","category":"Actividades de desarrollo"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Prise en charge du langage Python","description":"Prise en charge de la rédaction des scripts et des services web, notamment IntelliSense, le débogage, le profilage et les modèles.","category":"Activités de développement"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Supporto per il linguaggio Python","description":"Supporto per la scrittura di script Python e servizi Web, inclusi IntelliSense, debug, profilatura e modelli.","category":"Attività di sviluppo"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Python 言語サポート","description":"IntelliSense、デバッグ、プロファイル、テンプレートなどを含む Python スクリプトと web サービスの作成をサポートします。","category":"開発作業"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Python 언어 지원","description":"IntelliSense, 디버깅, 파일 및 템플릿을 비롯한 Python 스크립트 및 웹 서비스 작성을 지원합니다.","category":"개발 작업"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Obsługa języka Python","description":"Obsługa pisania skryptów w języku Python i usług sieci Web, w tym technologii IntelliSense, debugowania, profilowania i szablonów.","category":"Działania programistyczne"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Suporte à linguagem Python","description":"Suporte para escrever scripts Python e serviços da web, incluindo IntelliSense, depuração, criação de perfil e modelos.","category":"Atividades de desenvolvimento"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Поддержка языка Python","description":"Поддержка написания сценариев Python и веб-служб, включая IntelliSense, отладку, профилирование и шаблоны.","category":"Действия разработки"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Python dil desteği","description":"IntelliSense, hata ayıklama, profil oluşturma ve şablonlar gibi Python betiklerini ve Web hizmetlerini yazma desteği.","category":"Geliştirme etkinlikleri"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.Component.PythonTools.Web","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.Component.PythonTools":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.PythonTools.Django.Vsix":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.PythonTools.Django.Templates.Vsix":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.PythonTools.Web.Templates.Vsix":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.WebToolsExtensions":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.WebToolsExtensions.MSBuild":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Publish.Framework":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.JavaScript.TypeScript":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Web.Azure.Common":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Web.Azure":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.WebDeploy":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.Common.Azure.Tools":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.ConnectedServices":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Azure.Waverton_2097653671":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Azure.Waverton","version":"2.9","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.CommunityX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.EnterpriseX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.ProfessionalX86"]}},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Python web support","description":"Support for writing Python web sites using Django, Bottle, Flask, or a framework of your choice.","category":"Development activities"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"Python Web 支持","description":"支持使用 Django、Bottle、Flask 或你所选的框架写入 Python 网站。","category":"开发活动"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Python Web 支援","description":"支援使用 Django、Bottle、Flask 或您選擇的架構寫入 Python 網站。","category":"開發活動"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Podpora webů v jazyce Python","description":"Podpora pro psaní webů v jazyce Python pomocí nástrojů Django, Bottle, Flask nebo platformy podle vašeho výběru","category":"Vývojové aktivity"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Python-Webunterstützung","description":"Unterstützung zum Schreiben von Python-Websites mithilfe von Django, Bottle, Flask oder einem Framework Ihrer Wahl.","category":"Entwicklungsaktivitäten"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Compatibilidad web con Python","description":"Compatibilidad para escribir sitios web de Python con Django, Bottle, Flask o un marco de trabajo de su elección.","category":"Actividades de desarrollo"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Prise en charge de Python web","description":"Prise en charge de l'écriture de sites web Python à l'aide de Django, Bottle, Flask ou tout autre framework de votre choix.","category":"Activités de développement"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Supporto Web per Python","description":"Supporto per la scrittura di siti Web Python con Django, Bottle, Flask o un framework a scelta.","category":"Attività di sviluppo"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Python Web サポート","description":"Django、Bottle、Flask、または選択したいずれかのフレームワークを使用して Python Web サイトを作成するためのサポートを提供します。","category":"開発作業"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Python 웹 지원","description":"Django, Bottle, Flask 또는 원하는 프레임워크를 사용하여 Python 웹 사이트를 작성하는 것에 대한 지원입니다.","category":"개발 작업"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Obsługa zawartości sieci Web w środowisku Python","description":"Obsługa pisania witryn sieci Web języka Python przy użyciu rozwiązania Django, Bottle lub Flask albo innej wybranej platformy.","category":"Działania programistyczne"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Suporte na Web para Python","description":"Suporte para gravar sites do Python usando Django, Bottle, Flask ou uma estrutura de sua escolha.","category":"Atividades de desenvolvimento"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Веб-поддержка в Python","description":"Поддержка создания веб-сайтов Python с использованием Django, Bottle, Flask или платформы по вашему выбору.","category":"Действия разработки"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Python web desteği","description":"Django, Bottle, Flask veya seçtiğiniz bir çerçeveyi kullanarak Python web siteleri yazma desteği.","category":"Geliştirme etkinlikleri"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.Component.VC.Runtime.OSSupport","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.VC.Runtime.OSSupport.Downlevel":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","behaviors":"IgnoreApplicabilityFailures"},"Microsoft.Windows.UniversalCRT.HeadersLibsSources.Msi":"[10.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Windows.UniversalCRT.ExtensionSDK.Msi":"[10.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Windows.UniversalCRT.Tools.Msi":"[10.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ Universal Windows Platform runtime for v142 build tools","description":"UWP runtime for Visual C++.","category":"Compilers, build tools, and runtimes"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"用于 v142 生成工具的 C++ 通用 Windows 平台运行时","description":"用于 Visual C++ 的 UWP 运行时。","category":"编译器、生成工具和运行时"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 v142 建置工具的 C++ 通用 Windows 平台執行階段","description":"Visual C++ 的 UWP 執行階段。","category":"編譯器、建置工具和執行階段"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Modul runtime Univerzální platformy Windows pro C++ pro nástroje sestavení v142","description":"Modul runtime UPW pro Visual C++","category":"Kompilátory, nástroje pro sestavování buildů a moduly runtime"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++-UWP-Runtime (Universelle Windows-Plattform) für v142-Buildtools","description":"UWP-Runtime für Visual C++.","category":"Compiler, Buildtools und Runtimes"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Entorno de ejecución de la Plataforma universal de Windows de C++ para las herramientas de compilación de v142","description":"Entorno de ejecución de UWP para Visual C++.","category":"Compiladores, herramientas de compilación y entornos de ejecución"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Runtime de la plateforme Windows universelle en C++ pour Build Tools v142","description":"Runtime UWP pour Visual C++.","category":"Compilateurs, outils de génération et runtime"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Runtime della piattaforma UWP (Universal Windows Platf