Compilers, build tools, and runtimes"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"Windows 通用 CRT SDK","description":"旧版 Windows SDK 的通用 CRT SDK 支持","category":"编译器、生成工具和运行时"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Windows 通用 CRT SDK","description":"通用 CRT SDK 支援舊版 Windows SDK","category":"編譯器、建置工具和執行階段"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Windows Universal CRT SDK","description":"Podpora sady Universal CRT SDK u starších sad Windows SDK","category":"Kompilátory, nástroje pro sestavování buildů a moduly runtime"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Windows Universal CRT SDK","description":"Universal CRT SDK-Unterstützung für ältere Windows SDKs","category":"Compiler, Buildtools und Runtimes"},{"language":"es-es","title":"SDK de Windows Universal CRT","description":"Compatibilidad del SDK de Universal CRT con los SDK de Windows heredados","category":"Compiladores, herramientas de compilación y entornos de ejecución"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"SDK CRT (runtime C) universel pour Windows","description":"Prise en charge du SDK CRT (runtime C) universel pour les SDK Windows hérités","category":"Compilateurs, outils de génération et runtime"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Windows Universal CRT SDK","description":"Supporto Universal CRT SDK per Windows SDK legacy","category":"Compilatori, strumenti di compilazione e runtime"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Windows Universal CRT SDK","description":"以前の Windows SDK 用 Univeral CRT SDK サポート","category":"コンパイラ、ビルド ツール、およびランタイム"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Windows 유니버설 CRT SDK","description":"레거시 Windows SDK에 대한 유니버설 CRT SDK 지원","category":"컴파일러, 빌드 도구 및 런타임"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Uniwersalny zestaw SDK środowiska CRT dla systemu Windows","description":"Obsługa uniwersalnego zestawu SDK środowiska CRT dla starszych zestawów SDK systemu Windows","category":"Kompilatory, narzędzia do kompilacji i środowiska uruchomieniowe"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"SDK do CRT Universal do Windows","description":"Suporte a SDK do Universal CRT para SDKs do Windows herdados","category":"Compiladores, ferramentas de build e tempos de execução"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Пакет SDK для универсальной CRT для Windows","description":"Поддержка устаревших SDK для Windows в пакете SDK универсальной CRT","category":"Компиляторы, средства сборки и среды выполнения"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Windows Evrensel CRT SDK","description":"Eski Windows SDK'ları için Evrensel CRT SDK Desteği","category":"Derleyiciler, derleme araçları ve çalışma zamanları"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.ComponentGroup.Blend","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","isUiGroup":true,"automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Blend":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Blend.Resources":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Blend.Msi":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.Community":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Blend for Visual Studio","description":"Blend for Visual Studio is a collection of design tools for building beautiful user interfaces using XAML."},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"Blend for Visual Studio","description":"Blend for Visual Studio 是一个设计工具的集合，能够使用 XAML 生成漂亮的用户界面。"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Blend for Visual Studio","description":"Blend for Visual Studio 集結了各種設計工具，可讓您使用 XAML 建置美觀的使用者介面。"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Blend for Visual Studio","description":"Blend for Visual Studio je kolekce nástrojů na vytváření krásných uživatelských rozhraní v jazyce XAML."},{"language":"de-de","title":"Blend for Visual Studio","description":"Blend für Visual Studio ist eine Sammlung von Entwurfstools zum Erstellen ansprechender Benutzeroberflächen mithilfe von XAML."},{"language":"es-es","title":"Blend for Visual Studio","description":"Blend para Visual Studio es una colección de herramientas de diseño para la creación de hermosas interfaces de usuario mediante XAML."},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Blend for Visual Studio","description":"Blend pour Visual Studio est une collection d'outils de conception qui permet de générer de magnifiques interfaces utilisateur en XAML."},{"language":"it-it","title":"Blend for Visual Studio","description":"Blend per Visual Studio è una raccolta di strumenti di progettazione per creare interfacce utente d'impatto con XAML."},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Blend for Visual Studio","description":"Blend for Visual Studio は、XAML を使った美しいユーザー インターフェイスをビルドするためのデザイン ツールのコレクションです。"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Blend for Visual Studio","description":"Blend for Visual Studio는 XAML을 사용하여 멋진 사용자 인터페이스를 작성하기 위한 디자인 도구 모음입니다."},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Blend for Visual Studio","description":"Blend for Visual Studio to kolekcja narzędzi do projektowania umożliwiających kompilowanie atrakcyjnych interfejsów użytkownika przy użyciu języka XAML."},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Blend for Visual Studio","description":"O Blend para Visual Studio é uma coleção de ferramentas de design para compilar belas interfaces de usuário usando XAML."},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Blend for Visual Studio","description":"Blend для Visual Studio — это коллекция инструментов для проектирования привлекательных пользовательских интерфейсов с помощью XAML."},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Blend for Visual Studio","description":"Visual Studio için Blend, XAML ile göz alıcı kullanıcı arabirimleri oluşturmaya yönelik tasarım araçlarından oluşan bir koleksiyondur."}]},{"id":"Microsoft.ComponentGroup.ClickOnce.Publish","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","isUiGroup":true,"automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.ClickOnce.Publish":"1.0","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.ClickOnce.MSBuild":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"ClickOnce Publishing for .NET ","description":"Publish Windows-based .NET applications to a Web server or network file share for simplified installation.","category":"Code tools"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"适用于 .NET 的 ClickOnce 发布 ","description":"向 Web 服务器或网络文件共享发布基于 Windows 的 .NET 应用程序，以简化安装。","category":"代码工具"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 .NET 的 ClickOnce 發行 ","description":"將 Windows 式 .NET 應用程式發佈到網頁伺服器或網路檔案共用，以簡化安裝作業。","category":"程式碼工具"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Publikování ClickOnce pro .NET ","description":"Publikujte aplikace .NET založené na systému Windows na webový server nebo do sdílené síťové složky pro zjednodušení instalace.","category":"Nástroje pro kód"},{"language":"de-de","title":"ClickOnce-Veröffentlichung für .NET ","description":"Hiermit veröffentlichen Sie Windows-basierte .NET-Anwendungen auf einem Webserver oder in einer Netzwerkdateifreigabe, um die Installation zu vereinfachen.","category":"Codetools"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Publicación de ClickOnce para .NET ","description":"Para simplificar la instalación, publique aplicaciones .NET basadas en Windows en un recurso compartido de archivos de red o servidor web.","category":"Herramientas de código"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Publication ClickOnce pour .NET ","description":"Publiez des applications .NET Windows sur un serveur web ou un partage de fichiers réseau pour une installation simplifiée.","category":"Outils de code"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Pubblicazione ClickOnce per .NET ","description":"Pubblicare applicazioni .NET basate su Windows in un server Web o in una condivisione file di rete per semplificare l'installazione.","category":"Strumenti per il codice"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":".NET の ClickOnce 発行","description":"インストールの簡略化のために、Windows ベースの .NET アプリケーションを Web サーバーやネットワーク ファイル共有に公開します。","category":"コード ツール"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":".NET용 ClickOnce 게시 ","description":"Windows 기반 .NET 애플리케이션을 웹 서버 또는 네트워크 파일 공유에 게시하여 간단하게 설치합니다.","category":"코드 도구"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Publikowanie za pomocą technologii ClickOnce dla platformy .NET ","description":"Publikuj aplikacje .NET systemu Windows na serwerze internetowym lub sieciowym udziale pliku w celu uproszczenia instalacji.","category":"Narzędzia do kodowania"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Publicação do ClickOnce para .NET","description":"Publique aplicativos .NET baseados em Windows em um servidor Web ou um compartilhamento de arquivos na rede para uma instalação simplificada.","category":"Ferramentas de código"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Публикация ClickOnce для .NET ","description":"Публикация приложений NET на основе Windows на веб-сервере или в сетевой общей папке для упрощенной установки.","category":"Средства для работы с кодом"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":".NET Core için ClickOnce Yayımlama ","description":"Basitleştirilmiş kurulum için Windows tabanlı .NET uygulamalarını bir Web sunucusunda veya ağ dosya paylaşımında yayınlayın.","category":"Kod araçları"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.ComponentGroup.PythonTools.NativeDevelopment","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","isUiGroup":true,"automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.Component.PythonTools":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.CoreIDE":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.Windows10SDK":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.DiagnosticTools":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.Windows11SDK.22621":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.PythonTools.NativeDevelopment.Templates.Vsix":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.PythonTools.Debugger.VCLauncher.Vsix":"[16.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Python native development tools","description":"A recommended set of native tools for developing Python extensions. Select the Windows Desktop Development workload for full C++ support.","category":"Development activities"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"Python 本机开发工具","description":"一套建议的用于开发 Python 扩展的本机工具。选择 Windows 桌面开发工作负载以获取完整的 C++ 支持。","category":"开发活动"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Python 原生開發工具","description":"建議用於開發 Python 擴充功能的原生工具組。選取 [Windows 桌面開發] 工作負載可取得完整 C++ 支援。","category":"開發活動"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Nástroje pro nativní vývoj v Pythonu","description":"Doporučená sada nativních nástrojů pro vývoj rozšíření v Pythonu. Úplnou podporu C++ získáte, pokud vyberete úlohu Vývoj pro desktopy Windows.","category":"Vývojové aktivity"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Native Python-Entwicklungstools","description":"Eine empfohlene Sammlung nativer Tools für die Entwicklung von Python-Extensions. Wählen Sie zur vollständigen C++-Unterstützung die Workload für die Windows Desktop-Entwicklung aus.","category":"Entwicklungsaktivitäten"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Herramientas de desarrollo nativo Python","description":"Conjunto recomendado de herramientas nativas para desarrollar extensiones de Python. Seleccione la carga de trabajo de desarrollo para el escritorio de Windows para la compatibilidad total con C++.","category":"Actividades de desarrollo"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Outils de développement natifs Python","description":"Ensemble recommandé d'outils natifs pour le développement d'extensions Python. Sélectionnez la charge de travail de développement d'applications de bureau Windows pour une prise en charge intégrale de C++.","category":"Activités de développement"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Strumenti di sviluppo nativi Python","description":"Set consigliato di strumenti nativi per sviluppare estensioni Python. Per il supporto C++ completo, selezionare il carico di lavoro Sviluppo per Windows Desktop.","category":"Attività di sviluppo"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Python ネイティブ開発ツール","description":"Python 拡張機能を開発するためのネイティブ ツールの推奨セットです。C++ を完全にサポートするには、Windows デスクトップ開発ワークロードを選びます。","category":"開発作業"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Python 네이티브 개발 도구","description":"Python 확장을 개발하는 데 권장되는 네이티브 도구 집합입니다. 전체 C++ 지원을 받으려면 [Windows 데스크톱 개발] 작업을 선택하세요.","category":"개발 작업"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Natywne narzędzia programistyczne języka Python","description":"Zalecany zestaw natywnych narzędzi do programowania rozszerzeń Python. Wybierz obciążenie Programowanie aplikacji klasycznych systemu Windows, aby zapewnić pełne wsparcie dla języka C++.","category":"Działania programistyczne"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Ferramentas nativas de desenvolvimento em Python","description":"Um conjunto recomendado de ferramentas nativas para desenvolver extensões em Python. Selecione a carga de trabalho do Desenvolvimento do Windows Desktop para suporte completo em C++.","category":"Atividades de desenvolvimento"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Собственные средства разработки Python","description":"Рекомендуемый набор собственных средств для разработки расширений Python. Полная поддержка C++ доступна при выборе рабочей нагрузки ''Разработка классических приложений для Windows''.","category":"Действия разработки"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Python yerel geliştirme araçları","description":"Python uzantıları için önerilen yerel araçlar kümesi. Tam C++ desteği için Windows Masaüstü Geliştirme iş yükünü seçin.","category":"Geliştirme etkinlikleri"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.CookiecutterTools.Vsix","version":"17.0.25037.1","type":"Vsix","productArch":"neutral","payloads":[{"fileName":"Microsoft.CookiecutterTools.Vsix.vsix","sha256":"d522ae6475e2cd0e0cc60f612c32f99b9126f4ccc6d68a80c5f9e9690894386f","size":280745,"url":"https://download.visualstudio.microsoft.com/download/pr/0a907a7d-34a9-4fb3-8ece-01b773663478/d522ae6475e2cd0e0cc60f612c32f99b9126f4ccc6d68a80c5f9e9690894386f/Microsoft.CookiecutterTools.Vsix.vsix","signer":{"$ref":"1"}}],"installSizes":{"targetDrive":799867},"dependencies":{"Microsoft.CookiecutterTools.Vsix.Resources":"[17.0.25037.1,18.0)"}},{"id":"Microsoft.CookiecutterTools.Vsix.Resources","version":"17.0.25037.1","type":"Vsix","language":"cs-CZ","productArch":"neutral","payloads":[{"fileName":"Microsoft.CookiecutterTools.Vsix.Resources.CSY.vsix","sha256":"4b3d16a28e8d116ea89573f96f0089e2e5b97cea9dee6433b5bb7a4e8146eeee","size":87761,"url":"https://download.visualstudio.microsoft.com/download/pr/0a907a7d-34a9-4fb3-8ece-01b773663478/4b3d16a28e8d116ea89573f96f0089e2e5b97cea9dee6433b5b