.NET"},{"language":"de-de","title":".NET Framework 4.7.2 SDK","description":"Wenn alle Versionen von .NET Framework als Ziel verwendet werden sollen, empfehlen wir den Kunden die Verwendung von .NET Framework 4.8 SDK, um den höchsten Grad an Sicherheit und Zuverlässigkeit zu erhalten.","category":".NET"},{"language":"es-es","title":"SDK de .NET Framework 4.7.2","description":"Cuando el destino son todas las versiones de .NET Framework, se recomienda que los clientes usen el SDK de .NET Framework 4.8 para obtener el nivel más alto de seguridad y confiabilidad.","category":".NET"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Kit .NET Framework 4.7.2 SDK","description":"Nous recommandons aux clients qui ciblent toutes les versions du .NET Framework d'utiliser le kit SDK .NET Framework 4.8 pour bénéficier du plus haut niveau de sécurité et de fiabilité.","category":".NET"},{"language":"it-it","title":".NET Framework 4.7.2 SDK","description":"Quando la destinazione impostata corrisponde a tutte le versioni di .NET Framework, è consigliabile che i clienti usino .NET Framework 4.8 SDK per usufruire del livello più elevato in termini di sicurezza e affidabilità.","category":".NET"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":".NET Framework 4.7.2 SDK","description":".NET Framework のすべてのバージョンをターゲットとする場合、最高レベルのセキュリティと信頼性を確保できるよう、.NET Framework 4.8 SDK を使用することをお客様にお勧めします。","category":".NET"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":".NET Framework 4.7.2 SDK","description":".NET Framework의 모든 버전을 대상으로 하는 경우 고객은 최고 수준의 보안 및 안정성을 적용받기 위해 .NET Framework 4.8 SDK를 사용하는 것이 좋습니다.","category":".NET"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":".NET Framework 4.7.2 SDK","description":"Jeśli wszystkie wersje platformy .NET Framework są określone jako docelowe, zalecamy klientom użycie zestawu .NET Framework 4.8 SDK w celu uzyskania najwyższego poziomu zabezpieczeń i niezawodności.","category":".NET"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"SDK do .NET Framework 4.7.2","description":"Ao escolher todas as versões do .NET Framework como o destino, recomendamos que os clientes usem o SDK do .NET Framework 4.8 para receber o mais alto nível de segurança e confiabilidade.","category":".NET"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Пакет SDK для .NET Framework 4.7.2","description":"При разработке для всех версий .NET Framework клиентам рекомендуется использовать пакет SDK для .NET Framework 4.8, чтобы получить максимальный уровень надежности и безопасности.","category":".NET"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":".NET Framework 4.7.2 SDK","description":"Tüm .NET Framework sürümleri hedeflenirken, müşterilerin en yüksek güvenlik düzeyini ve güvenilirliğini elde etmek için .NET Framework 4.8 SDK'yı kullanmaları önerilir.","category":".NET"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.Net.Component.4.7.2.TargetingPack","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.Net.4.7.2.TargetingPack":"4.7.0.0"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":".NET Framework 4.7.2 targeting pack","description":"Reference assemblies to build applications that target the .NET Framework 4.7.2 .","category":".NET"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":".NET Framework 4.7.2 目标包","description":"要生成面向 .NET Framework 4.7.2 的应用程序的引用程序集。","category":".NET"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":".NET Framework 4.7.2 目標套件","description":"用於建置以 .NET Framework 4.7.2 為目標之應用程式的參考組件。","category":".NET"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":".NET Framework 4.7.2 Targeting Pack","description":"Referenční sestavení pro vytváření aplikací cílících na .NET Framework 4.7.2","category":".NET"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Paket zur Festlegung von Zielversionen von .NET Framework 4.7.2","description":"Referenzassemblys zum Entwickeln von Anwendungen für .NET Framework 4.7.2.","category":".NET"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Paquete de compatibilidad de .NET Framework 4.7.2","description":"Ensamblados de referencia para compilar aplicaciones destinadas a .NET Framework 4.7.2.","category":".NET"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Pack de ciblage .NET Framework 4.7.2","des