T 應用程式的最新 SDK 和工具。","category":".NET"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Sada .NET SDK","description":"Nejnovější SDK a nástroje pro vývoj aplikací .NET.","category":".NET"},{"language":"de-de","title":".NET SDK","description":"Neuestes SDK und Tools für die Entwicklung von .NET-Anwendungen.","category":".NET"},{"language":"es-es","title":"SDK de .NET","description":"Las herramientas y SDK más recientes para desarrollar aplicaciones de .NET.","category":".NET"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Kit SDK .NET","description":"Derniers outils et kits de développement logiciel (SDK) pour développer des applications .NET.","category":".NET"},{"language":"it-it","title":".NET SDK","description":"SDK e strumenti più recenti per lo sviluppo di applicazioni .NET.","category":".NET"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":".NET SDK","description":".NET アプリケーションを開発するための SDK およびツールです。","category":".NET"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":".NET SDK","description":".NET 애플리케이션을 개발하기 위한 최신 SDK 및 도구입니다.","category":".NET"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":".NET SDK","description":"Najnowsze zestawy SDK oraz narzędzia na potrzeby tworzenia aplikacji platformy .NET.","category":".NET"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"SDK do .NET","description":"SDK e ferramentas mais recentes para desenvolver aplicativos .NET.","category":".NET"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Пакет SDK для .NET","description":"Последние пакеты SDK и средства для разработки приложений .NET.","category":".NET"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":".NET SDK","description":".NET uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik en son SDK ve araçlar.","category":".NET"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.NetCore.Component.Web","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","isUiGroup":true,"automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.NetCore.Component.DevelopmentTools":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Templates.CS.ManagedWeb.Shared":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Templates.Bridge.NETCSharpVB":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.WebTools.DotNet.ItemTemplates":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.WebTools.DotNet.ProjectTemplates":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.FSharp.WebTemplates":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.DockerTools":"[16.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Web development tools for .NET","description":"Latest .NET development tools, .net standard and web templates, and docker tools for developing .NET web applications.","category":"Development activities"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"适用于 .NET 的 Web 开发工具","description":"用于开发 .NET Web 应用程序的最新 .NET 开发工具、.net 标准和 Web 模板以及 docker 工具。","category":"开发活动"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":".NET 的 Web 開發工具","description":"開發 .NET Web 應用程式的最新 .NET 開發工具、.NET 標準和 Web 範本，以及 Docker 工具。","category":"開發活動"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Nástroje pro vývoj webu pro .NET","description":"Nejnovější nástroje pro vývoj .NET, .net standard a šablony webu a dokovací nástroje pro vývoj webových aplikací .NET.","category":"Vývojové aktivity"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Webentwicklungstools für .NET","description":"Neueste .NET-Entwicklungstools, .NET Standard- und Webvorlagen sowie Docker-Tools zum Entwickeln von .NET-Webanwendungen.","category":"Entwicklungsaktivitäten"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Herramientas de desarrollo web para .NET","description":"Las herramientas de desarrollo de .NET, plantillas de .NET Standard y web, y herramientas de Docker más recientes para desarrollar aplicaciones web de .NET.","category":"Actividades de desarrollo"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Outils de développement Web pour .NET","description":"Les derniers outils de développement .NET, les modèles .NET Standard et Web et les outils Docker pour le développement d’applications Web .NET.","category":"Activités de développement"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Strumenti di sviluppo Web per .NET","description":"Strumenti di sviluppo .NET più recenti, .NET standard, modelli Web e strumenti Docker per lo sviluppo di applicazioni Web .NET.","category":"Attività di sviluppo"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":".NET の Web 開発","description":"最新の .NET 開発ツール、.NET Standard、および Web テンプレート、また .NET Web アプリケーション開発用の Docker ツールです。","category":"開発作業"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":".NET용 웹 개발 도구","description":".NET 웹 애플리케이션을 개발하기 위한 최신 .NET 개발 도구, .NET 표준 및 웹 템플릿 및 docker 도구입니다.","category":"개발 작업"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Narzędzia programistyczne sieci Web dla platformy .NET","description":"Najnowsze narzędzia programistyczne platformy .NET, .NET Standard oraz szablony sieci Web, a także narzędzia platformy Docker na potrzeby tworzenia aplikacji internetowych dla platformy .NET.","category":"Działania programistyczne"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Ferramentas de desenvolvimento para a Web do .NET","description":"Ferramentas de desenvolvimento mais recentes do .NET, modelos .Net Standard e Web e ferramentas do Docker para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos Web do .NET.","category":"Atividades de desenvolvimento"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Средства веб-разработки для .NET","description":"Последние средства разработки .NET, стандартные и веб-шаблоны .NET и средства Docker для разработки веб-приложений .NET.","category":"Действия разработки"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":".NET için web geliştirme araçları","description":".NET web uygulamaları geliştirmek için en son .NET geliştirme araçları, .NET Standard, web şablonları ve Docker araçları.","category":"Geliştirme etkinlikleri"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.NetCore.ComponentGroup.DevelopmentTools.2.1","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"outOfSupport":true,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.FSharp":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Net.Core.Component.SDK.2.1":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Templates.Bridge.NETFSharp":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Publish.Framework":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.DotNetCoreTemplates.CSharpVB":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.DotNetCoreDebugging":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.TestTools.TestPlatform.LocalFeed.msi":"[16.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Development Tools for .NET Core 2.1 (Out of support)","description":"Runtime and tools for developing .NET Core 2.1 applications. This version is no longer supported and will not receive security updates.","category":".NET"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"适用于 .NET Core 2.1 的开发工具(不受支持)","description":"适用于开发和 .NET Core 2.1 应用程序的运行时和工具。此版本不再受支持，并且不会接收安全更新。","category":".NET"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 .NET Core 2.1 的開發工具 (支援已到期)","description":"用於開發 .NET Core 2.1 應用程式的執行階段和工具。此版本已不受支援，所以不會取得安全性更新。","category":".NET"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Vývojové nástroje pro .NET Core 2.1 (bez podpory)","description":"Moduly runtime a šablony pro vývoj aplikací .NET Core 2.1. Tato verze se už nepodporuje a nebude dostávat aktualizace zabezpečení.","category":".NET"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Entwicklungstools für .NET Core 2.1 (nicht mehr unterstützt)","description":"Runtime und Tools für das Entwickeln von .NET Core 2.1-Anwendungen. Diese Version wird nicht mehr unterstützt, und es werden keine Sicherheitsupdates mehr bereitgestellt.","category":".NET"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Herramientas de desarrollo para .NET Core 2.1 (sin soporte)","description":"Runtime y herramientas para desarrollar aplicaciones de .NET Core 2.1. Esta versión ya no se admite y no recibirá actualizaciones de seguridad.","category":".NET"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Outils de développement pour .NET Core 2.1 (hors support)","description":"Moteur d'exécution et outils pour le développement d'applications .NET Core 2.1. Cette version n'est plus prise en charge et ne recevra pas de mises à jour de sécurité.","category":".NET"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Strumenti di sviluppo per .NET Core 2.1 (supporto non disponibile)","description":"Runtime e strumenti per lo supporto per lo sviluppo di applicazioni .NET Core 2.1. Questa versione non è più supportata e non riceverà più gli aggiornamenti per la sicurezza.","category":".NET"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":".NET Core 2.1 向け開発ツール (サポート対象外)","description":".NET Core 2.1 アプリケーションを開発するためのランタイムおよびツールです。このバージョンはサポートされなくなり、セキュリティ更新プログラムを受け取りません。","category":".NET"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":".NET Core 2.1용 개발 도구(지원 없음)","description":".NET Core 2.1 애플리케이션을 개발하기 위한 런타임 및 도구입니다. 이 버전은 더 이상 지원되지 않으며 보안 업데이트를 받지 않습니다.","category":".NET"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Narzędzia programistyczne dla platformy .NET Core 2.1 (brak pomocy technicznej)","description":"Obsługa tworzenia i uruchamiania aplikacji platformy .NET Core 2.1. W przypadku tej wersji nie jest już świadczona pomoc techniczna i nie będzie ona otrzymywać aktualizacji zabezpieczeń.","category":".NET"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Ferramentas de Desenvolvimento para .NET Core 2.1 (Sem suporte)","description":"Ferramentas e tempo de execução para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos .NET Core 2.1. Esta versão não é mais suportada e não receberá atualizações de segurança.","category":".NET"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Средства разработки для .NET Core 2.1 (не поддерживается)","description":"Среда выполнения и средства для разработки приложений .NET Core 2.1. Эта версия больше не поддерживается и не будет получать обновления для системы безопасности.","category":".NET"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":".NET Core 2.1 için Geliştirme Araçları (Destek kapsamı dışında)","description":".NET Core 2.1 uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik çalışma zamanı ve araçlar. Bu sürüm artık desteklenmediğinden güvenlik güncelleştirmelerini almayacak.","category":".NET"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.NetCore.ComponentGroup.Web.2.1","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"outOfSupport":true,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.NetCore.ComponentGroup.DevelopmentTools.2.1":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Templates.CS.ManagedWeb.Shared":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Templates.Bridge.NETCSharpVB":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.WebTools.DotNet.ItemTemplates":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.WebTools.DotNet.ProjectTemplates":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.FSharp.WebTemplates":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.DockerTools":"[16.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Web development tools for .NET Core 2.1 (Out of support)","description":".NET development tools, .net standard and web templates, and docker tools for developing .NET Core 2.1 web applications. This version is no longer supported and will not receive security updates.","category":".NET"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"适用于 .NET Core 2.1 的 Web 开发工具(不受支持)","description":"用于开发 .NET Core 2.1 Web 应用程序的 .NET 开发工具、.net Standard 和 Web 模板以及 docker 工具。此版本不再受支持，并且不会接收安全更新。","category":".NET"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 .NET Core 2.1 的網頁程式開發工具 (支援已到期)","description":".NET 開發工具、.NET Standard 和 Web 範本，以及用於開發 .Net Core 2.1 web 應用程式的 Docker 工具。不再支援此版本，其不會再收到安全性更新。","category":".NET"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Webové vývojářské nástroje pro .NET Core 2.1 (bez podpory)","description":"Vývojové nástroje pro platformu .NET, šablony .NET Standard, webové šablony a nástroje Docker pro vývoj webových aplikací .NET Core 2.1. Tato verze se už nepodporuje a nebude dostávat aktualizace zabezpečení.","category":".NET"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Webentwicklungstools mit .NET Core 2.1 (nicht mehr unterstützt)","description":".NET-Entwicklungstools, .NET Standard- und Webvorlagen sowie Docker-Tools für die Entwicklung von .NET Core 2.1-Webanwendungen. Diese Version wird nicht länger unterstützt und erhält keine Sicherheitsupdates mehr.","category":".NET"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Herramientas de desarrollo web para .NET Core 2.1 (sin soporte)","description":"Herramientas de desarrollo de .NET, plantillas .NET estándar y web, y herramientas de Docker para desarrollar aplicaciones web de .NET Core 2.1. Esta versión ya no se admite y no recibirá actualizaciones de seguridad.","category":".NET"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Outils de développement Web pour .NET Core 2.1 (hors support)","description":"Outils de développement .NET, .NET standard et modèles Web et outils de l’Ancrable pour le développement d’applications Web .NET Core 2,1. Cette version n’est plus prise en charge et ne recevra pas les mises à jour de sécurité.","category":".NET"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Strumenti di sviluppo Web per .NET Core 2.1 (supporto non disponibile)","description":"Strumenti di sviluppo .NET, modelli .NET standard e Web e strumenti Docker per lo sviluppo di applicazioni Web .NET Core 2.1. Questa versione non è più supportata e non riceverà gli aggiornamenti per la sicurezza.","category":".NET"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":".NET Core 2.1 向け Web 開発ツール (サポート対象外)","description":".NET 開発ツール、.NET Standard、および Web テンプレート、また .NET Core 2.1 Web アプリケーション開発用の Docker ツールです。このバージョンは、もうサポートされていないため、セキュリティ更新プログラムを受け取ることはありません。","category":".NET"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":".NET Core 2.1용 웹 개발 도구(지원되지 않음)","description":".NET 개발 도구, .net 표준 및 웹 템플릿, .NET Core 2.1 웹 애플리케이션 개발을 위한 Docker 도구입니다. 이 버전은 더 이상 지원되지 않으며 보안 업데이트를 받지 않습니다.","category":".NET"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Narzędzia programistyczne sieci Web dla platformy .NET Core 2.1 (brak pomocy technicznej)","description":"Narzędzia programistyczne platformy .NET, szablony standardowe i internetowe platformy .net oraz narzędzia platformy Docker do tworzenia aplikacji internetowych platformy .NET Core 2.1. Ta wersja nie jest już obsługiwana i nie będzie otrzymywać aktualizacji zabezpieczeń.","category":".NET"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Ferramentas de desenvolvimento da Web para .NET Core 2.1 (fora de suporte)","description":"Ferramentas de desenvolvimento .NET, padrão .NET e modelos da Web e ferramentas do Docker para desenvolvimento de aplicativos Web .NET Core 2.1. Esta versão não é mais suportada e não receberá atualizações de segurança.","category":".NET"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Средства веб-разработки для .NET Core 2.1 (не поддерживается)","description":"Средства разработки .NET, стандартные и веб-шаблоны .NET и средства Docker для разработки веб-приложений .NET Core 2.1. Эта версия больше не поддерживается и не будет получать обновления системы безопасности.","category":".NET"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":".NET Core 2.1 için web geliştirme araçları (Destek kapsamı dışında)","description":".NET Core 2.1 web uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik .NET geliştirme araçları, .NET Standard ve web şablonları, Docker araçları. Bu sürüm artık desteklenmediğinden güvenlik güncelleştirmelerini almayacak.","category":".NET"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.NetCore.HostFXR.9.0.4","version":"17.13.35931.197","type":"Msi","machineArch":"arm64","payloads":[{"fileName":"dotnet-hostfxr-9.0.4-win-arm64.msi","sha256":"bec83af4fb9c0969be4fb34da82416d636706b37916dccd49ed80e22aff68f8c","size":802816,"url":"https://download.visualstudio.microsoft.com/download/pr/4c506842-f378-483b-b01d-6b3bcefb0a8a/bec83af4fb9c0969be4fb34da82416d636706b37916dccd49ed80e22aff68f8c/dotnet-hostfxr-9.0.4-win-arm64.msi","signer":{"$ref":"2"}}],"msiProperties":{"ALLOWMSIINSTALL":"True"},"productCode":"{087818DC-EB72-470E-B15E-7D4621C123FA}","upgradeCode":"{7B49927B-59CB-7F8E-D238-372EBC1DA6F6}","productVersion":"72.16.31125","productLanguage":1033,"providerKey":"Dotnet_CLI_HostFxr_72.16.31125_arm64","installSizes":{"systemDrive":700134},"logFiles":[{"pattern":"dd_setup*Microsoft.NetCore.HostFXR.arm64*.log"}],"license":"https://github.com/dotnet/core-setup","dependencies":{"Microsoft.NetCore.HostFXR.9.0.4":{"version":"","machineArch":"x64"}}},{"id":"Microsoft.NetCore.HostFXR.9.0.4","version":"17.13.35931.197","type":"Msi","machineArch":"x64","payloads":[{"fileName":"dotnet-hostfxr-9.0.4-win-x64.msi","sha256":"63e77fe0a89c2c95cd4fbf45e935ced29e146067fbe8ed589a0e88ce9e22744f","size":794624,"url":"https://download.visualstudio.microsoft.com/download/pr/4c506842-f378-483b-b01d-6b3bcefb0a8a/63e77fe0a89c2c95cd4fbf45e935ced29e146067fbe8ed589a0e88ce9e22744f/dotnet-hostfxr-9.0.