的物理结构及其关系。","category":"代码工具"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"類別設計工具","description":"了解類型的實體結構及其關聯性。","category":"程式碼工具"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Návrhář tříd","description":"Informace o fyzické struktuře typů a jejich vztazích","category":"Nástroje pro kód"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Klassen-Designer","description":"Informationen zum Verständnis der physischen Struktur von Typen und ihren Beziehungen.","category":"Codetools"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Diseñador de clases","description":"Información sobre la estructura física de los tipos y sus relaciones.","category":"Herramientas de código"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Concepteur de classes","description":"Découvrez la structure physique des types et leurs relations.","category":"Outils de code"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Progettazione classi","description":"Consente di comprendere la struttura fisica dei tipi e le rispettive relazioni.","category":"Strumenti per il codice"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"クラス デザイナー","description":"型の物理構造とそれらの関係について説明します。","category":"コード ツール"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"클래스 디자이너","description":"형식 및 관계의 물리적 구조를 이해합니다.","category":"코드 도구"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Projektant klas","description":"Poznaj fizyczną strukturę typów i ich relacji","category":"Narzędzia do kodowania"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Designer de Classe","description":"Entender a estrutura física dos tipos e seus relacionamentos.","category":"Ferramentas de código"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Конструктор классов","description":"Анализ физической структуры типов и отношений между ними.","category":"Средства для работы с кодом"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Sınıf Tasarımcısı","description":"Türlerin fiziksel yapısını ve ilişkilerini anlayın.","category":"Kod araçları"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.CodeClone","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.CodeClone":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources"