:"Éditeur de base de Visual Studio","description":"Composant d'éditeur de base Microsoft Visual Studio."},{"language":"it-it","title":"Editor principale di Visual Studio","description":"Componente Editor principale di Microsoft Visual Studio."},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Visual Studio のコア エディター","description":"Microsoft Visual Studio コア エディター コンポーネント。"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Visual Studio 핵심 편집기","description":"Microsoft Visual Studio 핵심 편집기 구성 요소입니다."},{"language":"pl-pl","title":" Visual Studio Core Editor","description":"Składnik Microsoft Visual Studio Core Editor"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Editor de núcleo do Visual Studio","description":"Componente Editor de Núcleo do Microsoft Visual Studio."},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Основной редактор Visual Studio","description":"Основной компонент редактора Microsoft Visual Studio."},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Visual Studio temel düzenleyicisi","description":"Microsoft Visual Studio Temel Düzenleyici Bileşeni."}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.CppBuildInsights","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","ui":{"isAdvertisedPackage":true},"automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.CppBuildInsights":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.DiagnosticTools":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.Windows11Sdk.WindowsPerformanceToolkit":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"}},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ Build Insights","description":"C++ Build Insights is a collection of tools that provides increased visibility into the Microsoft Visual C++ (MSVC) tool chain to help optimize the build performance.","category":"Compilers, build tools, and runtimes"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"C++ Build Insights","description":"C++ Build Insights 是一系列工具，可提高 Microsoft Visual C++ (MSVC) 工具链的可见性，以帮助优化生成性能。","category":"编译器、生成工具和运行时"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"C++ Build Insights","description":"C++ Build Insights 是一組工具，可提升 Microsoft Visual C++ (MSVC) 工具鏈的可見度，以協助將組建效能最佳化。","category":"編譯器、建置工具和執行階段"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Build Insights C++","description":"Build Insights C++ jsou kolekce nástrojů, které poskytují lepší přehled o sadě nástrojů Microsoft Visual C++ (MSVC) a pomáhají optimalizovat výkon sestavení.","category":"Kompilátory, nástroje pro sestavování buildů a moduly runtime"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++ Build Insights","description":"C++ Build Insights ist eine Sammlung von Tools, die einen besseren Einblick in die Toolkette von Microsoft Visual C++ (MSVC) bietet, um eine Optimierung der Buildleistung zu ermöglichen.","category":"Compiler, Buildtools und Laufzeiten"},{"language":"es-es","title":"C++ Build Insights","description":"C++ Build Insights es una colección de herramientas que proporciona una mayor visibilidad de la cadena de herramientas de Microsoft Visual C++ (MSVC) para ayudar a optimizar el rendimiento de la compilación.","category":"Compiladores, herramientas de compilación y entornos de ejecución"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"C++ Build Insights","description":"C++ Build Insights est une collection d’outils qui offre une meilleure visibilité de la chaîne d’outils Microsoft Visual C++ (MSVC) afin d'optimiser les performances de la build.","category":"Compilateurs, outils de génération et runtimes"},{"language":"it-it","title":"C++ Build Insights","description":"C++ Build Insights è una raccolta di strumenti che offre maggiore visibilità sulla catena di strumenti Microsoft Visual C++ (MSVC) per aiutare a ottimizzare le prestazioni di compilazione.","category":"Compilatori, strumenti di compilazione e runtime"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"C++ Build Insights","description":"C++ Build Insights は、Microsoft Visual C++ (MSVC) ツール チェーンに対する可視性を向上させる、ビルド パフォーマンスの最適化に役立つツールのコレクションです。","category":"コンパイラ、ビルド ツール、およびランタイム"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"C++ Build Insights","description":"C++ Build Insights는 빌드 성능을 최적화하는 데 도움이 되도록 MSVC(Microsoft Visual C++) 도구 체인에 대한 향상된 가시성을 제공하는 도구 모음입니다.","category":"컴파일러, 빌드 도구 및 런타임"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Build Insights C++","description":"Pakiet narzędzi C++ Build Insights zapewnia zwiększony wgląd w łańcuch narzędzi oprogramowania Microsoft Visual C++ (MSVC), pomagając zoptymalizować wydajność kompilacji.","category":"Kompilatory, narzędzia do kompilacji i środowiska uruchomieniowe"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Build Insights do C++","description":"O C++ Build Insights é uma coleção de ferramentas que proporciona maior visibilidade na cadeia de ferramentas do Microsoft Visual C++ (MSVC) para ajudar a otimizar o desempenho da compilação.","category":"Compiladores, ferramentas de build e tempos de execução"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"C++ Build Insights","description":"C++ Build Insights — это набор инструментов, которые позволяют получать более подробные сведения о цепочке инструментов Microsoft Visual C++ (MSVC) для оптимизации производительности сборки.","category":"Компиляторы, средства сборки и среды выполнения"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"C++ Build Insights","description":"C++ Build Insights, Microsoft Visual C++ (MSVC) derleme performansını iyileştirmeye yardımcı olmak için araç zincirinde daha fazla görünürlük sağlayan bir araçlar koleksiyonudur.","category":"Derleyiciler, derleme araçları ve çalışma zamanları"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.Debugger.Arm64RemoteDebugger","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.Debugger.Core":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Debugger.Remote.Arm64":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","machineArch":"arm64"}},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"ARM64 Remote Debugger","description":"ARM64 version of the Remote Debugger which can be copied to an ARM64 Windows computer for remote debugging ARM64 processes.","category":"Debugging and testing"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"ARM64 远程调试器","description":"可复制到 ARM64 Windows 计算机用于远程调试 ARM64 进程的远程调试器的 ARM64 版本。","category":"调试和测试"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"ARM64 遠端偵錯工具","description":"遠端偵錯程式的 ARM64 版本可複製到 ARM64 Windows 電腦，以進行遠端偵錯 ARM64 程序。","category":"偵錯和測試"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Vzdálený ladicí program ARM64","description":"Verze ARM64 vzdáleného ladicího programu, kterou je možné zkopírovat do počítače ARM64 s Windows za účelem vzdáleného ladění procesů ARM64.","category":"Ladění a testování"},{"language":"de-de","title":"ARM64 Remotedebugger","description":"ARM64-Version des Remotedebuggers, die zum Remotedebuggen von ARM64-Prozessen auf einen ARM64-Windows-Computer kopiert werden kann.","category":"Debuggen und Testen"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Depurador remoto ARM64","description":"Versión arm64 del depurador remoto que se puede copiar en un equipo Windows ARM64 para la depuración remota de procesos ARM64.","category":"Depuración y pruebas"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Débogueur distant ARM64","description":"Version ARM64 du débogueur distant qui peut être copié sur un ordinateur Windows ARM64 pour des processus ARM64 de débogueur distant.","category":"Débogage et tests"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Debugger remoto ARM64","description":"Versione ARM64 del debugger remoto che può essere copiata su un computer ARM64 Windows per il debug remoto dei processi ARM64.","category":"Debug e test"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"ARM64 リモート デバッガー","description":"リモート デバッガーの ARM64 バージョンです。ARM64 のプロセスをリモート デバッグするために ARM64 Windows コンピューターにコピーできます。","category":"デバッグとテスト"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"ARM64 원격 디버거","description":"ARM64 원격 디버깅 프로세스를 위해 ARM64 Windows 컴퓨터에 복사할 수 있는 원격 디버거의 ARM64 버전입니다.","category":"디버깅 및 테스트"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Zdalny debuger ARM64","description":"Wersja ARM64 debugera zdalnego, którą można skopiować na komputer z systemem Windows ARM64 na potrzeby zdalnego debugowania procesów ARM64.","category":"Debugowanie i testowanie"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Depurador Remoto ARM64","description":"Versão ARM64 do Depurador Remoto que pode ser copiada para um computador Windows ARM64 para depuração remota de processos ARM64.","category":"Depuração e testes"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Удаленный отладчик ARM64","description":"Версия ARM64 удаленного отладчика, которую можно скопировать на компьютер с Windows ARM64 для удаленной отладки процессов ARM64.","category":"Отладка и тестирование"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"ARM64 Uzaktan Hata Ayıklayıcısı","description":"Uzaktan hata ayıklama ARM64 işlemleri için ARM64 Windows bilgisayarına kopyalanabilen Uzaktan Hata Ayıklayıcı'nın ARM64 sürümü.","category":"Hata ayıklama ve test"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.Debugger.JustInTime","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.Debugger.Core":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Debugger.JustInTime":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Debugger.ImmersiveActivateHelper.Msi":"[17.0,18.0]"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Just-In-Time debugger","description":"Debug applications with an unhandled exception just in time before it terminates.","category":"Debugging and testing"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"实时调试器","description":"在其终止前，实时调试含有未经处理的异常的应用程序。","category":"调试和测试"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Just-in-Time 偵錯工具","description":"在應用程式發生未處理的例外狀況而終止前，及時對其偵錯。","category":"偵錯和測試"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Ladicí program pro ladění za běhu","description":"Umožňuje ladit aplikace s neošetřenou výjimkou v potřebný okamžik, ještě než se ukončí.","category":"Ladění a testování"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Just-in-Time-Debugger","description":"Debuggen Sie Anwendungen mit einem Ausnahmefehler rechtzeitig, bevor sie beendet werden.","category":"Debuggen und Testen"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Depurador Just-In-Time","description":"Depure las aplicaciones que presenten una excepción no controlada justo a tiempo antes de que terminen.","category":"Depuración y pruebas"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Débogueur juste-à-temps","description":"Effectuez un débogage juste-à-temps des applications avec une exception non prise en charge avant qu'elle ne se termine.","category":"Débogage et tests"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Debugger JIT","description":"Esegue il debug delle applicazioni con un'eccezione non gestita appena prima che termini.","category":"Debug e test"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Just-In-Time デバッガー","description":"ハンドルされない例外が生じたアプリケーションが終了する直前にそのアプリケーションをデバッグします。","category":"デバッグとテスト"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Just-In-Time 디버거","description":"처리되지 않은 예외가 있는 애플리케이션이 종료되기 전에 이러한 애플리케이션을 적시에 디버그합니다.","category":"디버깅 및 테스트"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Debuger just in time","description":"Stosuj w aplikacjach z nieobsługiwanymi wyjątkami debugowanie just in time przed zakończeniem działania aplikacji.","category":"Debugowanie i testowanie"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Depurador Just-In-Time","description":"Depure aplicativos com uma exceção sem tratamento antes de ela ser encerrada.","category":"Depuração e testes"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"JIT-отладчик","description":"Своевременно отлаживайте необработанные исключения в приложениях, пока их работа не завершилась.","category":"Отладка и тестирование"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Anında Hata Ayıklayıcı","description":"Yakalanamayan özel durum oluşan uygulamalarda, sonlandırılmadan önce tam zamanında hata ayıklayın.","category":"Hata ayıklama ve test"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.Debugger.Snapshot","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Azure.Waverton":"2.9","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.Debugger.Core":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Debugger.Snapshot_1779377902":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Debugger.Snapshot","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.EnterpriseX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise"]},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Azure.SnapshotViewer":"3.1","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.Debugger.TimeTravel.Replay_1779377902":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.Debugger.TimeTravel.Replay","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.EnterpriseX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise"]}},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Snapshot Debugger","description":"Enables debugging for in-production apps in Azure (App Service, Virtual Machines, Virtual Machine Scale Sets, and Kubernetes Service) with minimal impact.","category":"Debugging and testing"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"Snapshot Debugger","description":"在 Azure (应用服务、虚拟机、虚拟机规模集和 Kubernetes 服务)中对生产中的应用启用调试并将影响降至最低。","category":"调试和测试"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"快照偵錯工具","description":"可在最低影響程度下，於 Azure 中偵錯生產環境內的應用程式 (App Service、虛擬機器、虛擬機器擴展集及 Kubernetes Service)。","category":"偵錯和測試"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Snapshot Debugger","description":"Povolí ladění pro produkční aplikace v Azure (služby App Service, Virtual Machines, Virtual Machine Scale Sets a Kubernetes) s minimálním dopadem.","category":"Ladění a testování"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Momentaufnahmedebugger","description":"Hiermit wird das Debuggen für in der Produktion eingesetzte Apps in Azure (App Service, Virtual Machines, Virtual Machine Scale Sets und Kubernetes Service) mit minimalen Auswirkungen aktiviert.","category":"Debuggen und Testen"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Snapshot Debugger","description":"Habilita la depuración de las aplicaciones en producción para Azure (App Service, Virtual Machines, Virtual Machine Scale Sets y Kubernetes Service) con un impacto mínimo.","category":"Depuración y pruebas"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Débogueur de capture instantanée","description":"Active le débogage pour les applications en production dans Azure (App Service, Virtual Machines, Virtual Machine Scale Sets et Kubernetes Service) avec un impact minimal.","category":"Débogage et tests"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Snapshot Debugger","description":"Abilita il debug per le app usate in produzione in Azure (Servizio app, Macchine virtuali, Set di scalabilità di macchine virtuali e Servizio Kubernetes) con impatto minimo.","category":"Debug e test"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"スナップショット デバッガー","description":"Azure の実稼働アプリ (App Service、Virtual Machines、Virtual Machine Scale Sets、Kubernetes Service) への影響を最小限に抑えたデバッグを有効にします。","category":"デバッグとテスト"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"스냅샷 디버거","description":"Azure(App Service, Virtual Machines, Virtual Machine Scale Sets 및 Kubernetes Service)에서 미치는 영향을 최소화하고 프로덕션 상태의 앱을 디버그할 수 있도록 지원합니다.","category":"디버깅 및 테스트"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Snapshot Debugger","description":"Włącza debugowanie dla aplikacji w środowisku produkcyjnym na platformie Azure (usługi App Service, Virtual Machines, Virtual Machine Scale Sets i Kubernetes Service) przy minimalnym wpływie.","category":"Debugowanie i testowanie"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Depurador de Instantâneos","description":"Habilita a depuração de aplicativos em produção no Azure (Serviço de Aplicativo, Máquinas Virtuais, Conjuntos de Dimensionamento de Máquinas Virtuais e Serviço de Kubernetes) com impacto mínimo.","category":"Depuração e testes"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Snapshot Debugger","description":"Включает отладку для приложений в рабочей среде в Azure (Служба приложений, виртуальные машины, масштабируемые наборы виртуальных машин и служба Kubernetes) с минимальным влиянием.","category":"Отладка и тестирование"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Snapshot Debugger","description":"Azure'da üretim aşamasında olan uygulamalar (App Service, Sanal Makineler, Sanal Makine Ölçek Kümeleri ve Kubernetes Service) için minimum etkiyle hata ayıklamayı etkinleştirir.","category":"Hata ayıklama ve test"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.DependencyValidation.Community","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Layer":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.DslRuntime":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Dependency Validation","description":"View architectural dependency diagrams (.layerdiagram) and validate code conformity.","category":"Code tools"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"依赖项验证","description":"查看体系结构依赖关系图(.layerdiagram)并验证代码是否符合。","category":"代码工具"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"相依性驗證","description":"檢視架構相依性圖表 (.layerdiagram) 及驗證程式碼符合性。","category":"程式碼工具"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Ověřování závislostí","description":"Zobrazuje diagramy závislosti architektury (.layerdiagram) a ověřuje shodu kódu.","category":"Nástroje pro kód"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Abhängigkeitsüberprüfung","description":"Zeigt Diagramme zu Architekturabhängigkeiten (.layerdiagram) an und überprüft die Codekonformität.","category":"Codetools"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Validación de dependencia","description":"Vea diagramas de dependencias de arquitectura (.layerdiagram) y valide la conformidad del código.","category":"Herramientas de código"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Validation de dépendance","description":"Affichez les diagrammes de dépendance architecturale (.layerdiagram), et validez la conformité du code.","category":"Outils de code"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Convalida delle dipendenze","description":"Consente di visualizzare i diagrammi delle dipendenze dell'architettura (.layerdiagram) e di convalidare la conformità del codice.","category":"Strumenti per il codice"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"依存関係の検証","description":"アーキテクチャの依存関係図 (.layerdiagram) を表示して、コードの適合性を検証します。","category":"コード ツール"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"종속성 유효성 검사","description":"아키텍처 종속성 다이어그램(.layerdiagram)을 보고 코드 적합성의 유효성을 검사합니다.","category":"코드 도구"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Weryfikacja zależności","description":"Wyświetl diagram zależności architektury (layerdiagram) i weryfikuj zgodność kodu.","category":"Narzędzia do kodowania"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Validação de Dependência","description":"Exibir diagramas de dependências arquitetônicas (.layerdiagram) e validar conformidade de código.","category":"Ferramentas de código"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Проверка зависимостей","description":"Просмотр архитектурных схем зависимостей (LAYERDIAGRAM) и проверка соответствия кода правилам.","category":"Средства для работы с кодом"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Bağımlılık Doğrulaması","description":"Mimari bağımlılık diyagramlarını (.layerdiagram) görüntüleyin ve kod uyumluluklarını doğrulayın.","category":"Kod araçları"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.DependencyValidation.Enterprise","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Layer":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.DslRuntime":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.DependencyValidation.Enterprise.Auto":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Live Dependency Validation","description":"Define architecture dependencies and validate code conformity both at build time and live as you type.","category":"Code tools"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"实时依赖项验证","description":"在生成时和键入时实时定义体系结构依赖关系并验证代码是否达标。","category":"代码工具"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"即時相依性驗證","description":"在建置時同時定義架構相依性圖表及驗證程式碼符合性，並在您鍵入即時進行。","category":"程式碼工具"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Ověřování závislostí v reálném čase","description":"Definuje závislosti architektury a ověřuje shodu kódu jak v čase sestavení, tak v reálném čase při psaní.","category":"Nástroje pro kód"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Live-Abhängigkeitsüberprüfung","description":"Definiert Architekturabhängigkeiten und überprüft die Codekonformität sowohl zur Buildzeit als auch live während der Eingabe.","category":"Codetools"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Validación de dependencias en vivo","description":"Defina dependencias de arquitectura y valide la conformidad del código tanto en tiempo de compilación como en vivo mientras escribe.","category":"Herramientas de código"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Validation de dépendances dynamique","description":"Définissez les dépendances des architectures, et validez la conformité du code au moment de la génération et de manière dynamique pendant la saisie.","category":"Outils de code"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Convalida delle dipendenze in tempo reale","description":"Consente di definire le dipendenze dell'architettura e di convalidare la conformità del codice sia in fase di compilazione che in tempo reale durante la digitazione.","category":"Strumenti per il codice"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"ライブ依存関係検証","description":"ビルド時とリアルタイムの両方でアーキテクチャの依存関係を定義して、コードの適合性を検証します。","category":"コード ツール"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"실시간 종속성 유효성 검사","description":"빌드 시와 입력 시 모두 아키텍처 종속성을 정의하고 코드 접합성의 유효성을 검사합니다.","category":"코드 도구"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Walidacja aktywnych zależności","description":"Definiuj zależności architektury i waliduj zgodność kodu podczas kompilowania oraz aktywności w trakcie wpisywania.","category":"Narzędzia do kodowania"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Validação de Dependência Dinâmica","description":"Defina dependências arquitetônicas e valide conformidade de código no momento do build e enquanto você digita.","category":"Ferramentas de código"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Динамическая проверка зависимостей","description":"Определение архитектурных зависимостей и проверка соответствия кода правилам во время сборки и в режиме реального времени во время ввода данных.","category":"Средства для работы с кодом"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Canlı Bağımlılık Doğrulama","description":"Mimari bağımlılıkları tanımlayın ve hem derleme zamanında hem de yazarken canlı olarak kod uyumluluğunu doğrulayın.","category":"Kod araçları"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.DependencyValidation.Enterprise.Auto","version":"17.13.35716.53","type":"Vsi