{"language":"zh-cn","title":"用于 DirectX 的图形调试器和 GPU 探查器","description":"用于诊断 DirectX 应用程序的图形调试器和 GPU 探查器。适用于 DirectX 12、DirectX 11 和 DirectX 10。","category":"游戏和图形","keywords":["调试","DirectX","游戏","gpu","图形","性能","配置文件","呈现","着色器"]},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 DirectX GPU 的圖形偵錯工具與 GPU 分析工具","description":"圖形偵錯工具與 GPU 分析工具可用於診斷 DirectX 應用程式。適用對象包括 DirectX 12、 DirectX 11 與 DirectX 10。","category":"遊戲開發套件","keywords":["偵錯","DirectX","遊戲","gpu","graphics","效能","profile","render","shader"]},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Ladicí program grafiky a profiler GPU pro DirectX","description":"Ladicí program grafiky a profiler GPU pro diagnostiku aplikací DirectX. Funguje s DirectX 12, DirectX 11 a DirectX 10.","category":"Hry a grafika","keywords":["ladit","DirectX","Hra","gpu","grafika","výkon","profil","vykreslit","shader"]},{"language":"de-de","title":"Grafikdebugger und GPU-Profiler für DirectX","description":"Grafikdebugger und GPU-Profiler für die Diagnose von DirectX-Anwendungen. Arbeitet mit DirectX 12, DirectX 11 und DirectX 10 zusammen.","category":"Spiele und Grafiken","keywords":["Debuggen","DirectX","Spiel","GPU","Grafiken","Leistung","Profil","Rendern","Shader"]},{"language":"es-es","title":"Depurador de gráficos y creador de perfiles GPU para DirectX","description":"Depurador de gráficos y creador de perfiles GPU para el diagnóstico de aplicaciones DirectX. Funciona con DirectX 12, DirectX 11 y DirectX 10.","category":"Juegos y gráficos","keywords":["depurar","DirectX","Juego","gpu","gráficos","rendimiento","perfil","representar","sombreador"]},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Débogueur graphique et profileur GPU pour DirectX","description":"Débogueur graphique et profileur GPU pour le diagnostic des applications DirectX. Fonctionne avec DirectX 12, DirectX 11 et DirectX 10.","category":"Jeux et graphismes","keywords":["déboguer","DirectX","Jeu","gpu","graphismes","performances","profil","afficher","nuanceur"]},{"language":"it-it","title":"Debugger grafica e profiler GPU per DirectX","description":"Debugger grafica e profiler GPU per la diagnosi di problemi relativi alle applicazioni DirectX. Funziona con DirectX 12, DirectX 11 e DirectX 10.","category":"Giochi e grafica","keywords":["debug","DirectX","Gioco","gpu","grafica","prestazioni","profilo","rendering","shader"]},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"DirectX 用グラフィックス デバッガーおよび GPU プロファイラー","description":"DirectX アプリケーションを診断するためのグラフィックス デバッガーおよび GPU プロファイラーです。DirectX 12、DirectX 11、および DirectX 10 で機能します。","category":"ゲーム開発スイート","keywords":["デバッグ","DirectX","ゲーム","gpu","グラフィックス","パフォーマンス","プロファイル","レンダー","シェーダー"]},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"DirectX용 그래픽 디버거 및 GPU 프로파일러","description":"DirectX 애플리케이션의 진단용 그래픽 디버거 및 GPU 프로파일러입니다. DirectX 12, DirectX 11 및 DirectX 10에서 작동합니다.","category":"개임 개발 도구 모음","keywords":["디버그","DirectX","게임","GPU","그래픽","성능","프로필","렌더링","셰이더"]},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Debuger grafiki i profiler procesora GPU dla technologii DirectX","description":"Debuger grafiki i profiler procesora GPU umożliwiający diagnozowanie aplikacji opartych na technologii DirectX. Działa z wersjami 12, 11 i 10 technologii DirectX.","category":"Gry i grafika","keywords":["debuguj","DirectX","Gra","gpu","grafika","wydajność","profil","renderowanie","program do cieniowania"]},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Depurador de elementos gráficos e criador de perfil GPU para o DirectX","description":"Depurador de elementos gráficos e criador de perfil GPU para diagnosticar aplicativos do DirectX. Funciona com DirectX 12, DirectX 11 e DirectX 10.","category":"Jogos e Elementos Gráficos","keywords":["depurar","DirectX","Jogo","gpu","gráficos","desempenho","perfil","renderizar","sombreador"]},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Отладчик графики и профилировщик GPU для DirectX","description":"Отладчик графики и профилировщик GPU для диагностики приложений DirectX. Работает в DirectX 12, DirectX 11 и DirectX 10.","category":"Наборы для разработки игр","keywords":["отладка","DirectX","Игра","gpu","графика","производительность","профиль","отрисовка","шейдер"]},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"DirectX için grafik hata ayıklayıcı ve GPU profili oluşturucu","description":"DirectX uygulamalarını tanılamaya yönelik grafik hata ayıklayıcı ve GPU profili oluşturucu. DirectX 12, DirectX 11 ve DirectX 10 ile çalışır.","category":"Oyunlar ve Grafikler","keywords":["hata ayıklama","DirectX","Oyun","gpu","grafikler","performans","profil","oluşturma","gölgelendirici"]}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.HLSL","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.HLSL":"[0.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"HLSL Tools","description":"Enhanced support for editing HLSL","category":"Development activities"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"HLSL 工具","description":"增强了对编辑 HLSL 的支持","category":"开发活动"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"HLSL 工具","description":"編輯 HLSL 的增強支援","category":"開發活動"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Nástroje HLSL","description":"Rozšířená podpora pro úpravy HLSL","category":"Vývojové aktivity"},{"language":"de-de","title":"HLSL-Tools","description":"Erweiterte Unterstützung für das Bearbeiten von HLSL","category":"Entwicklungsaktivitäten"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Herramientas HLSL","description":"Compatibilidad mejorada para editar HLSL","category":"Actividades de desarrollo"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Outils HLSL","description":"Prise en charge améliorée de l'édition HLSL","category":"Activités de développement"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Strumenti HLSL","description":"Supporto avanzato per la modifica di HLSL","category":"Attività di sviluppo"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"HLSL ツール","description":"HLSL の編集のサポートの強化","category":"開発作業"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"HLSL 도구","description":"HLSL 편집에 대한 향상된 지원","category":"개발 작업"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Narzędzia HLSL","description":"Rozszerzona obsługa edytowania protokołu HLSL","category":"Działania programistyczne"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Ferramentas HLSL","description":"Suporte aprimorado para edição de HLSL","category":"Atividades de desenvolvimento"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Инструменты HLSL","description":"Расширенная поддержка редактирования HLSL","category":"Действия разработки"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"HLSL Araçları","description":"HLSL'yi düzenlemek için gelişmiş destek","category":"Geliştirme etkinlikleri"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.IISExpress","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.IISExpress.Msi":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.Community":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"IIS Express ","description":"A streamlined and self-contained version of the IIS web server that is optimized for developers.","category":"Cloud, database, and server"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"IIS Express ","description":"为开发人员优化的 IIS Web 服务器简化和独立版本。","category":"云、数据库和服务器"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"IIS Express ","description":"精簡且獨立的 IIS 網頁伺服器版本，最適合供開發人員使用。","category":"雲端、資料庫和伺服器"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"IIS Express ","description":"Zjednodušená a samostatná verze webového serveru IIS, která je optimalizovaná pro vývojáře","category":"Cloud, databáze a server"},{"language":"de-de","title":"IIS Express ","description":"Eine optimierte und eigenständige Version des IIS-Webservers, die für Entwickler optimiert ist.","category":"Cloud, Datenbank und Server"},{"language":"es-es","title":"IIS Express ","description":"Una versión autocontenida y mejorada del servidor web de IIS optimizada para los desarrolladores.","category":"Nube, base de datos y servidor"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"IIS Express ","description":"Version simplifiée et autonome du serveur web IIS optimisé pour les développeurs.","category":"Cloud, base de données et serveur"},{"language":"it-it","title":"IIS Express ","description":"Versione semplificata e indipendente del server Web IIS, ottimizzata per gli sviluppatori.","category":"Cloud, database e server"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"IIS Express ","description":"開発者向けに最適化されている、簡素化された自己完結型バージョンの IIS Web サーバー。","category":"クラウド、データベース、およびサーバー"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"IIS Express","description":"개발자용으로 최적화된 자체 포함 버전의 간소화된 IIS 웹 서버입니다.","category":"클라우드, 데이터베이스 및 서버"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"IIS Express ","description":"Usprawniona i niezależna wersja serwera sieci web usług IIS, którą zoptymalizowano dla deweloperów.","category":"Chmura, baza danych i serwer"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"IIS Express ","description":"Uma versão simplificada e independente do servidor da Web IIS otimizada para desenvolvedores.","category":"Nuvem, banco de dados e servidor"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"IIS Express ","description":"Упрощенная и автономная версия веб-сервера IIS, оптимизированная для разработчиков.","category":"Облако, база данных и сервер"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"IIS Express ","description":"IIS web sunucusunun geliştiriciler için iyileştirilmiş, kolaylaştırılmış ve bağımsız çalışan bir sürümü.","category":"Bulut, veritabanı ve sunucu"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.IntelliCode","version":"17.13.35828.75","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.IntelliCode":"","Microsoft.VisualStudio.IntelliCode.CSharp":""},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"IntelliCode","description":"AI-assisted development","category":"Development activities"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"IntelliCode","description":"AI 辅助开发","category":"开发活动"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"IntelliCode","description":"AI 輔助開發","category":"開發活動"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"IntelliCode","description":"Vývoj s pomocí umělé inteligence","category":"Vývojové aktivity"},{"language":"de-de","title":"IntelliCode","description":"KI-gestützte Entwicklung","category":"Entwicklungsaktivitäten"},{"language":"es-es","title":"IntelliCode","description":"Desarrollo asistido por IA","category":"Actividades de desarrollo"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"IntelliCode","description":"Développement assisté par IA","category":"Activités de développement"},{"language":"it-it","title":"IntelliCode","description":"Sviluppo con supporto per intelligenza artificiale","category":"Attività di sviluppo"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"IntelliCode","description":"AI 支援開発","category":"開発作業"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"IntelliCode","description":"AI 지원 개발","category":"개발 작업"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"IntelliCode","description":"Programowanie wspomagane przez sztuczną inteligencję","category":"Działania programistyczne"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"IntelliCode","description":"Desenvolvimento assistido por IA","category":"Atividades de desenvolvimento"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"IntelliCode","description":"Разработка с помощью искусственного интеллекта","category":"Действия разработки"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"IntelliCode","description":"Yapay zeka destekli geliştirme","category":"Geliştirme etkinlikleri"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.IntelliTrace.FrontEnd","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Enterprise":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.PackageGroup.DiagnosticsHub.Platform":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.IntelliTrace.FrontEnd":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.IntelliTrace.Debugger":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.IntelliTrace.Debugger.Targeted":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.IntelliTrace.Debugger.Targeted.ARM64":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.IntelliTrace.Core":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.IntelliTrace.DiagnosticsHub":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.Core":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.IntelliTrace.DiagnosticsHubAgent.Targeted":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"IntelliTrace","description":"Historical debugging for managed projects, the ability to load and interact with .itrace files, and step back for both managed and native projects.","category":"Debugging and testing"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"IntelliTrace","description":"对托管项目的历史调试，加载 .itrace 文件和与其交互的能力，以及针对托管项目和原生项目后退。","category":"调试和测试"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"IntelliTrace","description":"受控專案的歷程偵錯、載入 .itrace 檔案並與其互動的能力，以及針對受控和原生專案返回逐步執行。","category":"偵錯和測試"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"IntelliTrace","description":"Historické ladění pro spravované projekty, možnost načítat a pracovat se soubory .itrace a krok zpět pro spravované i nativní projekty","category":"Ladění a testování"},{"language":"de-de","title":"IntelliTrace","description":"Verlaufsbezogenes Debuggen für verwaltete Projekte, die Möglichkeit zum Laden und Interagieren mit ITRACE-Dateien sowie Schritt-zurück-Funktion für verwaltete wie auch native Projekte.","category":"Debuggen und Testen"},{"language":"es-es","title":"IntelliTrace","description":"Depuración histórica para los proyectos administrados: capacidad para cargar e interactuar con archivos .itrace y retroceder en proyectos administrados y nativos.","category":"Depuración y pruebas"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"IntelliTrace","description":"Débogage historique des projets managés, chargement des fichiers .itrace et interaction avec ces derniers, retour en arrière pour les projets managés et natifs.","category":"Débogage et tests"},{"language":"it-it","title":"IntelliTrace","description":"Debug cronologico per i progetti gestiti, possibilità di caricare file con estensione itrace e interagirvi, nonché ritorno all'istruzione precedente per progetti gestiti e nativi.","category":"Debug e test"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"IntelliTrace","description":"マネージド プロジェクトのデバッグ履歴、.itrace ファイルの読み込みと対話を行う機能、マネージド プロジェクトとネイティブ プロジェクトの両方に対するステップ バック。","category":"デバッグとテスト"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"IntelliTrace","description":"관리형 프로젝트에 대한 기록 디버깅, .itrace 파일을 로드하고 조작할 수 있는 기능 및 관리형 프로젝트와 네이티브 프로젝트 모두에 대한 뒤로 이동입니다.","category":"디버깅 및 테스트"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"IntelliTrace","description":"Debugowanie historyczne dla projektów zarządzanych, możliwość ładowania plików itrace i interakcji z nimi oraz cofanie kroku dla projektów zarządzanych i natywnych.","category":"Debugowanie i testowanie"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"IntelliTrace","description":"A depuração histórica de projetos gerenciados, a capacidade de carregar e interagir com os arquivos .itrace e a opção de retroceder para projetos nativos e gerenciados.","category":"Depuração e testes"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"IntelliTrace","description":"Историческая отладка для управляемых проектов, возможность загружать и использовать ITRACE-файлы, а также поддержка перехода на шаг назад для управляемых и платформенных проектов.","category":"Отладка и тестирование"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"IntelliTrace","description":"Yönetilen projeler için geçmişe yönelik hata ayıklama, .itrace dosyalarını yükleyip bunlarla etkileşim kurma olanağı ve hem yönetilen hem yerel projeler için geri adım atma.","category":"Hata ayıklama ve test"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.JavaScript.Diagnostics","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Web.PerformanceTools":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Web.PerformanceTools.Resources":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.CommunityCore":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Package.NodeJs":"1.0","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Debugger.VSCodeDebuggerHost":"[16.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"JavaScript diagnostics","description":"Tools for JavaScript diagnostics.","category":"Debugging and testing"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"JavaScript 诊断","description":"用于 JavaScript 诊断的工具。","category":"调试和测试"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"JavaScript 診斷","description":"工具，用於 JavaScript 診斷。","category":"偵錯和測試"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Diagnostika jazyka JavaScript","description":"Nástroje pro diagnostiku jazyka JavaScript","category":"Ladění a testování"},{"language":"de-de","title":"JavaScript-Diagnose","description":"Tools für die JavaScript-Diagnose.","category":"Debuggen und Testen"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Diagnóstico de JavaScript","description":"Herramientas para diagnóstico de JavaScript.","category":"Depuración y pruebas"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Diagnostics JavaScript","description":"Outils pour les diagnostics JavaScript.","category":"Débogage et tests"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Diagnostica di JavaScript","description":"Strumenti per la diagnostica di JavaScript.","category":"Debug e test"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"JavaScript 診断","description":"JavaScript 診断用のツール。","category":"デバッグとテスト"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"JavaScript 진단","description":"JavaScript 진단용 도구입니다.","category":"디버깅 및 테스트"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Diagnostyka JavaScript","description":"Narzędzia do diagnostyki JavaScript.","category":"Debugowanie i testowanie"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Diagnósticos de JavaScript","description":"Ferramentas para diagnósticos de JavaScript.","category":"Depuração e testes"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Диагностика JavaScript","description":"Средства для диагностики JavaScript.","category":"Отладка и тестирование"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"JavaScript tanılamaları","description":"JavaScript tanılama araçları.","category":"Hata ayıklama ve test"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.JavaScript.TypeScript","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.JavaScript.Language":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.TypeScript.TSServer":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.Debugger.Script":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.WebToolsExtensions":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.JavaScript.ProjectSystem":"1.0","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.CommunityCore":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.Community":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"JavaScript and TypeScript language support","description":"Full support and tooling for JavaScript and TypeScript.","category":"Development activities"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"JavaScript 和 TypeScript 语言支持","description":"针对 JavaScript 和 TypeScript 的完全支持和工具。","category":"开发活动"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"JavaScript 與 TypeScript 語言支援","description":"對 JavaScript 與 TypeScript 的完整支援與工具。","category":"開發活動"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Podpora jazyků JavaScript a TypeScript","description":"Kompletní podpora a nástroje pro JavaScript a TypeScript","category":"Vývojové aktivity"},{"language":"de-de","title":"JavaScript- und TypeScript-Sprachunterstützung","description":"Vollständige Unterstützung und Tools für JavaScript und TypeScript.","category":"Entwicklungsaktivitäten"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Compatibilidad con los lenguajes JavaScript y TypeScript","description":"Compatibilidad completa y herramientas para JavaScript y TypeScript.","category":"Actividades de desarrollo"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Prise en charge du langage JavaScript et TypeScript","description":"Prise en charge complète et outils nécessaires pour JavaScript et TypeScript.","category":"Activités de développement"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Supporto per linguaggi JavaScript e TypeScript","description":"Supporto completo e strumenti per JavaScript e TypeScript.","category":"Attività di sviluppo"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"JavaScript および TypeScript の言語サポート","description":"JavaScript および TypeScript のフル サポートとツール。","category":"開発作業"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"JavaScript 및 TypeScript 언어 지원","description":"JavaScript 및 TypeScript에 대한 전체 지원 및 도구입니다.","category":"개발 작업"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Obsługa języków JavaScript i TypeScript","description":"Pełna obsługa języków JavaScript i TypeScript oraz narzędzia dla nich.","category":"Działania programistyczne"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Suporte às linguagens JavaScript e TypeScript","description":"Suporte completo e ferramentas para JavaScript e TypeScript.","category":"Atividades de desenvolvimento"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Поддержка языков JavaScript и TypeScript","description":"Полная поддержка и инструменты для JavaScript и TypeScript.","category":"Действия разработки"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"JavaScript ve TypeScript dil desteği","description":"JavaScript ve TypeScript için tam destek ve araçlar.","category":"Geliştirme etkinlikleri"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.LinqToSql","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.LinqToSql":"15.0.0.0","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.TextTemplating":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.Core":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.DslRuntime":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.ProTools":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"LINQ to SQL tools","description":"Visual design surface for authoring models that map .NET objects to data in SQL Server databases using LINQ to SQL.","category":"Code tools"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"LINQ to SQL 工具","description":"用于创作模型的可视化设计图面，这些模型可使用 LINQ to SQL 将 .NET 对象映射到 SQL Server 数据库中的数据。","category":"代码工具"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"LINQ to SQL 工具","description":"此視覺化設計介面可讓您使用 LINQ to SQL 撰寫將 .NET 物件對應到 SQL Server 資料庫資料的模型。","category":"程式碼工具"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Nástroje LINQ to SQL","description":"Vizuální návrhová plocha pro vytváření modelů, které mapují objekty .NET na data v databázích SQL Serveru, pomocí LINQ to SQL","category":"Nástroje pro kód"},{"language":"de-de","title":"LINQ to SQL-Tools","description":"Visuelle Entwurfsoberfläche zum Erstellen von Modellen, die .NET-Objekte Daten in SQL Server-Datenbanken mithilfe von LINQ to SQL zuordnen.","category":"Codetools"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Herramientas de LINQ to SQL","description":"Superficie de diseño visual para la creación de modelos que asignan objetos .NET a datos de bases de datos SQL Server mediante LINQ to SQL.","category":"Herramientas de código"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Outils LINQ to SQL","description":"Aire de conception visuelle pour la création de modèles qui mappent des objets .NET à des données de bases de données SQL Server via LINQ to SQL.","category":"Outils de code"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Strumenti di LINQ to SQL","description":"Area di progettazione visiva per la creazione di modelli che associano oggetti .NET ai dati in database SQL Server usando LINQ to SQL.","category":"Strumenti per il codice"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"LINQ to SQL ツール","description":"LINQ to SQL を使用して .NET オブジェクトを SQL Server データベース内のデータにマップするモデルを作成するためのビジュアル デザイン領域。","category":"コード ツール"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"LINQ to SQL 도구","description":"LINQ to SQL를 사용하여 .NET 개체를 SQL Server 데이터베이스에 매핑하기 위한 모델을 제작하는 데 사용되는 시각적인 디자인 화면입니다.","category":"코드 도구"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"LINQ to SQL Tools","description":"Powierzchnia projektowania wizualnego służąca do tworzenia modeli mapujących obiekty .NET na dane w bazach danych SQL Server przy użyciu technologii LINQ to SQL.","category":"Narzędzia do kodowania"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Ferramentas do LINQ to SQL","description":"Área de design visual para criar modelos que mapeiem objetos .NET com os dados em bancos de dados do SQL Server usando LINQ to SQL.","category":"Ferramentas de código"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Инструменты LINQ to SQL","description":"Рабочая область визуального конструирования для создания моделей, которые сопоставляют объекты .NET с данными в базах данных SQL Server с помощью LINQ to SQL.","category":"Средства для работы с кодом"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"LINQ to SQL araçları","description":"LINQ to SQL aracılığıyla .NET nesnelerini SQL Server veritabanlarındaki verilere eşleyen yazma modelleri için görsel tasarım yüze