title":"Mono デバッガー","description":"Mono アプリケーションをデバッグするためのサポート。","category":"デバッグとテスト"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Mono 디버거","description":"Mono 애플리케이션 디버그 지원","category":"디버깅 및 테스트"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Debuger środowiska Mono","description":"Obsługa debugowania aplikacji środowiska Mono.","category":"Debugowanie i testowanie"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Depurador Mono","description":"Suporte para depuração de aplicativos Mono.","category":"Depuração e testes"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Отладчик Mono","description":"Поддержка отладки приложений на основе Mono.","category":"Отладка и тестирование"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Mono hata ayıklayıcısı","description":"Mono uygulamalarında hata ayıklama desteği.","category":"Hata ayıklama ve test"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.MSODBC.SQL","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"msodbcsql":"[16.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"SQL Server ODBC Driver","description":"Microsoft ODBC Driver for SQL Server is a single dynamic-link library (DLL) containing run-time support for applications using native-code APIs.","category":"Cloud, database, and server"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"SQL Server ODBC Driver","description":"Microsoft ODBC Driver for SQL Server 是单个动态链接库(DLL)，它包含对使用本机代码 API 的应用程序的运行时支持。","category":"云、数据库和服务器"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"SQL Server ODBC Driver","description":"Microsoft ODBC Driver for SQL Server 是單一動態連結程式庫 (DLL)，包含使用機器碼 API 之應用程式的執行階段支援。","category":"雲端、資料庫和伺服器"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Ovladač Microsoft SQL Server ODBC Driver","description":"Ovladač Microsoft ODBC pro SQL Server je jedna dynamická knihovna (DLL), která obsahuje podporu modulu runtime pro aplikace, které používají rozhraní API s nativním kódem.","category":"Cloud, databáze a server"},{"language":"de-de","title":"SQL Server-ODBC-Treiber","description":"Microsoft ODBC Driver for SQL Server ist eine einzelne DLL (Dynamic-Link Library), die Laufzeitunterstützung für Anwendungen bietet, die APIs mit nativem Code verwenden.","category":"Cloud, Datenbank und Server"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Controlador ODBC de SQL Server","description":"Microsoft ODBC Driver for SQL Server es una biblioteca de vínculos dinámicos (DLL) compatible con el entorno de ejecución para aplicaciones que usan API de código nativo.","category":"Nube, base de datos y servidor"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"SQL Server ODBC Driver","description":"Microsoft ODBC Driver for SQL Server est une bibliothèque de liens dynamiques (DLL) unique qui prend en charge l'exécution des applications utilisant les API en code natif.","category":"Cloud, base de données et serveur"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Driver ODBC SQL Server","description":"Microsoft ODBC Driver for SQL Server è una libreria di collegamento dinamico (DLL) contenente il supporto runtime per applicazioni che usano API di codice nativo.","category":"Cloud, database e server"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"SQL Server ODBC ドライバー","description":"Microsoft ODBC Driver for SQL Server は、ネイティブ コード API を使用するアプリケーションのランタイム サポートを含む単一ダイナミック リンク ライブラリ (DLL) です。","category":"クラウド、データベース、およびサーバー"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"SQL Server ODBC Driver","description":"Microsoft ODBC Driver for SQL Server는 네이티브 코드 API를 사용하는 애플리케이션에 대한 런타임 지원을 포함하는 단일 DLL(동적 연결 라이브러리)입니다.","category":"클라우드, 데이터베이스 및 서버"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Sterownik ODBC programu SQL Server","description":"Sterownik ODBC firmy Microsoft dla programu SQL Server to jedna biblioteka dołączana dynamicznie (DLL) zawierająca obsługę czasu wykonywania aplikacji, które używają interfejsów API kodu natywnego.","category":"Chmura, baza danych i serwer"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Driver ODBC do SQL Server","description":"O Microsoft ODBC Driver for SQL Server é uma DLL (biblioteca de vínculo dinâmico) única que contém suporte de tempo de execução para os aplicativos que usam APIs de código nativo.","category":"Nuvem, banco de dados e servidor"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"SQL Server ODBC Driver","description":"Microsoft ODBC Driver for SQL Server — это отдельная библиотека динамической компоновки (DLL), которая содержит поддержку времени выполнения для приложений, использующих API машинного кода.","category":"Облако, база данных и сервер"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"SQL Server ODBC Sürücüsü","description":"SQL Server için Microsoft ODBC Sürücüsü, yerel kod API'leri kullanan uygulamalar için çalışma zamanı desteği içeren tek bir dinamik bağlantı kitaplığıdır (DLL).","category":"Bulut, veritabanı ve sunucu"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.MSSQL.CMDLnUtils","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"mssqlcmdlnutils":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.MSODBC.SQL":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"SQL Server Command Line Utilities","description":"Connect to server, send Transact-SQL batches, and generate rowset information from SQL Server instances.","category":"Cloud, database, and server"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"SQL Server 命令行实用工具","description":"连接到服务器、发送 Transact-SQL 批处理并从 SQL Server 实例生成行集信息。","category":"云、数据库和服务器"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"SQL Server Command Line Utilities","description":"連接至伺服器、傳送 Transact-SQL 批次，並從 SQL Server 執行個體產生資料列集資訊。","category":"雲端、資料庫和伺服器"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Nástroje příkazového řádku SQL Serveru","description":"Umožňuje připojovat se k serveru, posílat dávky Transact-SQL a generovat informace o sadách řádků z instancí SQL Serveru.","category":"Cloud, databáze a server"},{"language":"de-de","title":"SQL Server-Befehlszeilenprogramme","description":"Herstellen einer Verbindung mit dem Server, Senden von Transact-SQL-Batches und Generieren von Rowsetinformationen aus SQL Server-Instanzen.","category":"Cloud, Datenbank und Server"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Utilidades de la línea de comandos de SQL Server","description":"Conéctese al servidor, envíe lotes Transact-SQL y genere información de conjunto de filas a partir de instancias de SQL Server.","category":"Nube, base de datos y servidor"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Utilitaires de ligne de commande SQL Server","description":"Connectez-vous à un serveur, envoyez des lots Transact-SQL et générez des informations relatives aux ensembles de lignes à partir d'instances SQL Server.","category":"Cloud, base de données et serveur"},{"language":"it-it","title":"SQL Server Command Line Utilities","description":"Consente di connettersi al server, nonché inviare batch Transact-SQL e visualizzare informazioni sui set di righe da istanze di SQL Server.","category":"Cloud, database e server"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"SQL Server コマンド ライン ユーティリティ","description":"サーバーに接続して Transact-SQL バッチを送信し、SQL Server インスタンスから行セット情報を生成します。","category":"クラウド、データベース、およびサーバー"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"SQL Server 명령줄 유틸리티","description":"서버에 연결하고, Transact-SQL 일괄 처리를 전송하며, SQL Server 인스턴스에서 행 집합 정보를 생성합니다.","category":"클라우드, 데이터베이스 및 서버"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Narzędzia wiersza polecenia programu SQL Server 2012","description":"Połącz z serwerem, wyślij zadania wsadowe Transact-SQL i wygeneruj informacje o zestawie wierszy z wystąpień programu SQL Server.","category":"Chmura, baza danych i serwer"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Utilitários de Linha de Comando do SQL Server","description":"Conecte-se ao servidor, envie lotes Transact-SQL e gere informações de conjuntos de linhas de instâncias do SQL Server.","category":"Nuvem, banco de dados e servidor"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Служебные программы командной строки SQL Server","description":"Подключитесь к серверу, отправьте пакет Transact-SQL и сформируйте сведения о наборе строк из экземпляров SQL Server.","category":"Облако, база данных и сервер"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"SQL Server Komut Satırı Yardımcı Programları","description":"Sunucuya bağlanın, Tran