e platforem pomocí nástrojů Unity a Visual Studio","category":"Hry a grafika","keywords":["Hra","grafika","Unity"]},{"language":"de-de","title":"Visual Studio-Tools für Unity","description":"Visual Studio-Erweiterung, die nativ von Unity unterstützt wird, um plattformübergreifende Spiele mit Unity und Visual Studio zu entwickeln.","category":"Spiele und Grafiken","keywords":["Spiel","Grafiken","Unity"]},{"language":"es-es","title":"Visual Studio Tools para Unity","description":"Extensión de Visual Studio admitida de forma nativa por Unity para desarrollar juegos multiplataforma con Unity y Visual Studio.","category":"Juegos y gráficos","keywords":["Juego","gráficos","Unity"]},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Visual Studio Tools pour Unity","description":"Extension Visual Studio prise en charge de façon native par Unity pour le développement de jeux multiplateformes avec Unity et Visual Studio.","category":"Jeux et graphismes","keywords":["Jeu","graphismes","Unity"]},{"language":"it-it","title":"Visual Studio Tools per Unity","description":"Estensione di Visual Studio supportata in modalità nativa da Unity per lo sviluppo di giochi multipiattaforma con Unity e Visual Studio.","category":"Giochi e grafica","keywords":["Gioco","grafica","Unity"]},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Visual Studio Tools for Unity","description":"Unity と Visual Studio でクロスプラットフォーム ゲームを開発するための、Unity によってネイティブにサポートされている Visual Studio 拡張機能。","category":"ゲーム開発スイート","keywords":["ゲーム","グラフィックス","Unity"]},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Visual Studio Tools for Unity","description":"Unity 및 Visual Studio를 사용하는 플랫폼 간 게임을 개발하기 위해 Unity에서 기본적으로 지원하는 Visual Studio 확장입니다.","category":"개임 개발 도구 모음","keywords":["게임","그래픽","Unity"]},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Visual Studio Tools for Unity","description":"Rozszerzenie programu Visual Studio obsługiwane natywnie w aparacie Unity na potrzeby opracowywania gier międzyplatformowych za pomocą aparatu Unity z wykorzystaniem programu Visual Studio.","category":"Gry i grafika","keywords":["Gra","grafika","Unity"]},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Ferramentas do Visual Studio para Unity","description":"Extensão do Visual Studio com suporte nativo do Unity para desenvolver jogos de multiplataforma com o Unity e com o Visual Studio.","category":"Jogos e Elementos Gráficos","keywords":["Jogo","gráficos","Unidade"]},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Инструменты Visual Studio для Unity","description":"Расширение Visual Studio, которое поддерживается Unity и позволяет разрабатывать кросс-платформенные игры с помощью Unity и Visual Studio.","category":"Наборы для разработки игр","keywords":["Игра","графика","Unity"]},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Unity için Visual Studio Araçları","description":"Unity ve Visual Studio ile çoklu platform oyunları geliştirmek için Unity tarafından yerel olarak desteklenen bir Visual Studio uzantısı.","category":"Oyunlar ve Grafikler","keywords":["Oyun","grafikler","Unity"]}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.Unreal.TestAdapter","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.Unreal.TestAdapter":"[17.0,18.0)","Component.Unreal.Ide":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.UnrealEngineToolsInterfaces":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Unreal Engine Test Adapter","description":"Enables Visual Studio's testing tools with unit tests for Unreal Engine. Originally by Rare Ltd.","category":"Games and Graphics"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"Unreal Engine 测试适配器","description":"使用 Unreal Engine 的单元测试启用 Visual Studio 的测试工具。最初由 Rare Ltd 提供。","category":"游戏和图形"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Unreal Engine 測試配接器","description":"使用 Unreal Engine 的單元測試啟用 Visual Studio 的測試工具。原本由 Rare Ltd. 提供。","category":"遊戲開發套件"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Adaptér testu Unreal Engine","description":"Povolí testovací nástroje Visual Studio s testy jednotek pro Unreal Engine. Původním autorem je Rare Ltd.","category":"Hry a grafika"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Unreal Engine-Testadapter","description":"Aktiviert die Testtools von Visual Studio mit Komponententests für die Unreal-Engine. Ursprünglich von Rare Ltd.","category":"Spiele und Grafiken"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Adaptador de prueba de Unreal Engine","description":"Habilita las herramientas de pruebas de Visual Studio con pruebas unitarias para Unreal Engine. Originalmente por Rare Ltd.","category":"Juegos y gráficos"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Adaptateur de test Unreal Engine","description":"Active les outils de test de Visual Studio avec des tests unitaires pour Unreal Engine. À l’origine par Rare Ltd.","category":"Jeux et graphismes"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Adattatore di test di Unreal Engine","description":"Abilita gli strumenti di test di Visual Studio con unit test per Unreal Engine. Originariamente da Rare Ltd.","category":"Giochi e grafica"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Unreal Engine テスト アダプター","description":"Unreal Engine の単体テストを使用して、Visual Studio のテスト ツールを有効にします。もともとは Rare Ltd. です。","category":"ゲームおよびグラフィックス"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Unreal Engine 테스트 어댑터","description":"Unreal Engine용 단위 테스트로 Visual Studio의 테스트 도구를 활성화합니다. 원래 Rare Ltd.에 의해 만들어 졌습니다.","category":"개임 및 그래픽"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Adapter testowy aparatu Unreal Engine","description":"Włącza narzędzia do testowania programu Visual Studio z testami jednostkowymi dla aparatu Unreal Engine. Pierwotnie autor: Rare Ltd.","category":"Gry i grafika"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Adaptador de Teste do Unreal Engine","description":"Habilita as ferramentas de teste do Visual Studio com testes de unidade para o Unreal Engine. Fornecidos originalmente pela Rare Ltd.","category":"Jogos e Elementos Gráficos"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Адаптер теста Unreal Engine","description":"Включает средства тестирования Visual Studio с модульными тестами для Unreal Engine. Изначально разработано компанией Rare Ltd.","category":"Игры и графика"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Unreal Engine Test Bağdaştırıcısı","description":"Unreal Engine için birim testlerini içeren Visual Studio test araçlarını etkinleştirir. İlk olarak Rare Ltd tarafından yayınlandı.","category":"Oyunlar ve Grafikler"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.UWP.VC.ARM64","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.UWP.VC.ARM64EC":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.Tools.ARM64":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.MSBuild.v170.ARM64.UWP":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.CRT.Appx.Desktop.ARM64.Msi":"","Microsoft.VisualCpp.CRT.arm64.OneCore.Desktop":"","Microsoft.VisualCpp.CRT.Appx.ARM64.Msi":""},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ Universal Windows Platform support for v143 build tools (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"Tools for building Universal Windows Platform applications using C++ targeting ARM64 architecture.","category":"Compilers, build tools, and runtimes","keywords":["ec","arm64ec"]},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"用于 v143 生成工具的 C++ 通用 Windows 平台支持(ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"用于使用面向 ARM64 体系结构的 C++ 来生成通用 Windows 平台应用程序的工具。","category":"编译器、生成工具和运行时","keywords":["ec","arm64ec"]},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 v143 建置工具 (ARM64/ARM64EC) 的 C++ 通用 Windows 平台支援","description":"適用於使用 C++ 以 ARM 64 架構為目標建置通用 Windows 平台應用程式的工具。","category":"編譯器、建置工具和執行階段","keywords":["EC","arm64ec"]},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Podpora Univerzální platformy Windows pro C++ pro nástroje sestavení v143 (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"Nástroje pro vytváření aplikací pro Univerzální platformu Windows pomocí C++ se zacílením na architekturu ARM64","category":"Kompilátory, nástroje pro sestavování buildů a moduly runtime","keywords":["ec","arm64ec"]},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++-Universelle Windows-Plattform-Unterstützung für v143-Buildtools (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"Tools zum Erstellen von Anwendungen mit ARM64-Architektur für die universelle Windows-Plattform mithilfe von C++.","category":"Compiler, Buildtools und Runtimes","keywords":["EC","ARM64EC"]},{"language":"es-es","title":"Compatibilidad con la Plataforma universal de Windows de C++ para las herramientas de compilación de v143 (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"Herramientas para compilar aplicaciones de la Plataforma universal de Windows con C++ destinadas a la arquitectura ARM64.","category":"Compiladores, herramientas de compilación y entornos de ejecución","keywords":["ec","arm64ec"]},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Prise en charge de la plateforme Windows universelle en C++ pour Build Tools v143 (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"Outils pour la génération d'applications de plateforme Windows universelle en C++ ciblant l'architecture ARM64.","category":"Compilateurs, outils de génération et runtime","keywords":["ec","arm64ec"]},{"language":"it-it","title":"Supporto della piattaforma UWP (Universal Windows Platform) C++ per gli strumenti della build v143 (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"Strumenti per compilare con C++ applicazioni della piattaforma UWP (Universal Windows Platform) destinate all'architettura ARM64.","category":"Compilatori, strumenti di compilazione e runtime","keywords":["EC","arm64ec"]},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"V143 ビルド ツールの C++ ユニバーサル Windows プラットフォームサポート (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"ARM64 アーキテクチャーを対象とするユニバーサル Windows プラットフォーム アプリケーションを C++ を使用して作成するためのツール。","category":"コンパイラ、ビルド ツール、およびランタイム","keywords":["ec","arm64ec"]},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"v143 빌드 도구용 C++ 유니버설 Windows 플랫폼 지원(ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"C++ 대상 ARM64 아키텍처를 사용하여 유니버설 Windows 플랫폼 애플리케이션을 빌드하는 데 사용되는 도구입니다.","category":"컴파일러, 빌드 도구 및 런타임","keywords":["ec","arm64ec"]},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Obsługa narzędzi kompilacji w wersji 143 dla platformy uniwersalnej systemu Windows w języku C++ (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"Narzędzia do kompilowania aplikacji platformy uniwersalnej systemu Windows w języku C++ przeznaczonych dla architektury ARM64.","category":"Kompilatory, narzędzia do kompilacji i środowiska uruchomieniowe","keywords":["EC","arm64ec"]},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Suporte à Plataforma Universal do Windows C++ para ferramentas de build v143 (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"Ferramentas para criar aplicativos da Plataforma Universal do Windows usando C++ direcionado à arquitetura ARM64.","category":"Compiladores, ferramentas de build e tempos de execução","keywords":["ec","arm64ec"]},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Поддержка универсальной платформы Windows C++ для инструментов сборки v143 (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"Средства для разработки приложений универсальной платформы Windows на языке C++ для архитектуры ARM64.","category":"Компиляторы, средства сборки и среды выполнения","keywords":["EC","arm64ec"]},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"v143 derleme araçları için C++ Evrensel Windows Platformu desteği (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"C++ kullanarak ARM64 mimarisini hedefleyen Evrensel Windows Platformu uygulamaları oluşturmak için araçlar.","category":"Derleyiciler, derleme araçları ve çalışma zamanları","keywords":["ec","arm64ec"]}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.UWP.VC.ARM64EC","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","isUiGroup":true,"automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.Tools.ARM64EC":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.MSBuild.v170.ARM64EC.UWP":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ Universal Windows Platform support for v143 build tools (ARM64EC)","description":"Tools for building Universal Windows Platform libraries using C++ targeting x64 emulation on ARM64 architecture.","category":"Compilers, build tools, and runtimes"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"用于 v143 生成工具的 C++ 通用 Windows 平台支持(ARM64EC)","description":"使用 C++ 针对 ARM64 体系结构上的 x64 模拟构建通用 Windows 平台库。","category":"编译器、生成工具和运行时"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 v143 建置工具 (ARM64EC) 的 C++ 通用 Windows 平台支援","description":"使用 C++ 在 ARM64 架構上以 x64 模擬為目標，建置通用 Windows 平台程式庫的工具。","category":"編譯器、建置工具和執行階段"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Podpora Univerzální platformy Windows pro C++ pro nástroje sestavení v143 (ARM64EC)","description":"Nástroje pro sestavování knihoven Univerzální platformy Windows v jazyce C++, který cílí na emulaci architektury x64 na architektuře ARM64.","category":"Kompilátory, nástroje pro sestavování buildů a moduly runtime"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Support von der C++-UWP (Universelle Windows-Plattform) für v143-Buildtools (ARM64EC)","description":"Tools zum Erstellen von UWP-Bibliotheken (Universelle Windows-Plattform) mit C++ für die x64-Emulation in der ARM64-Architektur.","category":"Compiler, Buildtools und Runtimes"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Compatibilidad con la Plataforma universal de Windows de C++ para las herramientas de compilación de v143 (ARM64EC)","description":"Herramientas para compilar bibliotecas de la Plataforma universal de Windows con emulación x64 destinada a C++ en una arquitectura ARM64.","category":"Compiladores, herramientas de compilación y entornos de ejecución"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Prise en charge de la plateforme Windows universelle en C++ pour Build Tools v143 (ARM64EC)","description":"Outils pour la génération de bibliothèques de plateforme Windows universelle en C++ ciblant l'émulation x64 sur une architecture ARM64.","category":"Compilateurs, outils de génération et runtime"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Supporto della piattaforma UWP (Universal Windows Platform) C++ per gli strumenti della build v143 (ARM64EC)","description":"Strumenti per compilare con C++ librerie della piattaforma UWP (Universal Windows Platform) destinate all'emulazione x64 nell'architettura ARM64.","category":"Compilatori, strumenti di compilazione e runtime"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"v143 ビルド ツールの C++ ユニバーサル Windows プラットフォーム サポート (ARM64EC)","description":"ARM64 アーキテクチャ上の x64 エミュレーションをターゲットにしたユニバーサル Windows プラットフォーム ライブラリを C++ を使用してビルドするためのツール。","category":"コンパイラ、ビルド ツール、およびランタイム"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"v143 빌드 도구용 C++ 유니버설 Windows 플랫폼 지원(ARM64EC)","description":"ARM64 아키텍처에서 C++ 대상 x64 에뮬레이션을 사용하여 유니버설 Windows 플랫폼 애플리케이션을 빌드하는 데 사용되는 도구입니다.","category":"컴파일러, 빌드 도구 및 런타임"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Obsługa narzędzi kompilacji w wersji 143 dla platformy uniwersalnej systemu Windows w języku C++ (ARM64EC)","description":"Narzędzia do kompilowania bibliotek platformy uniwersalnej systemu Windows przy użyciu emulacji języka C++ ukierunkowanego na architekturę x64 w architekturze ARM64.","category":"Kompilatory, narzędzia do kompilacji i środowiska uruchomieniowe"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Suporte à Plataforma Universal do Windows C++ para ferramentas de build v143 (ARM64EC)","description":"Ferramentas para compilar bibliotecas da Plataforma Universal do Windows usando o C++ direcionando à emulação x64 com arquitetura ARM64.","category":"Compiladores, ferramentas de build e tempos de execução"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Поддержка универсальной платформы Windows C++ для Build Tools v143 (ARM64EC)","description":"Средства для сборки библиотек универсальной платформы Windows с использованием C++ для эмуляции x64 в архитектуре ARM64.","category":"Компиляторы, средства сборки и среды выполнения"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"v143 derleme araçları için C++ Evrensel Windows Platformu desteği (ARM64EC)","description":"ARM64 mimarisinde x64 öykünmesini hedefleyen C++ kullanarak Evrensel Windows Platformu kitaplıkları oluşturmaya yönelik araçlar.","category":"Derleyiciler, derleme araçları ve çalışma zamanları"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.29.16.11.ARM","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.MSBuild.ARM.v142":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.Redist.14.Latest":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.Redist.14":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.RuntimeDebug.14":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsof