":"Compiladores, herramientas de compilación y entornos de ejecución"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Prise en charge de C++/CLI pour Build Tools v142 (14.29-16.11)","description":"Outils et frameworks nécessaires pour modifier le code et déboguer les applications C++/CLI à l'aide du .NET Framework.","category":"Compilateurs, outils de génération et runtime"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Supporto C++/CLI per Build Tools v142 (14.29-16.11)","description":"Strumenti e framework necessari per la modifica del codice e il debug di applicazioni C++/CLI con .NET Framework.","category":"Compilatori, strumenti di compilazione e runtime"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"v142 ビルド ツール (14.29-16.11) の C++/CLI サポート","description":".NET Framework を使用して C++/CLI アプリケーションのコード編集やデバッグを行うために必要なツールとフレームワーク。","category":"コンパイラ、ビルド ツール、およびランタイム"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"v142 빌드 도구용 C++/CLI 지원(14.29-16.11)","description":".NET Framework를 사용한 C++/CLI 애플리케이션 디버깅 및 코드 편집을 위해 필요한 도구 및 프레임워크입니다.","category":"컴파일러, 빌드 도구 및 런타임"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Obsługa C++/CLI dla narzędzi kompilacji w wersji 142 (14.29-16.11)","description":"Wymagane narzędzia i platformy na potrzeby edytowania kodu i debugowania aplikacji C++/CLI przy użyciu platformy .NET Framework.","category":"Kompilatory, narzędzia do kompilacji i środowiska uruchomieniowe"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Suporte C++/CLI para ferramentas de compilação v142 (14.29 - 16.11)","description":"As ferramentas e as estruturas necessárias para depurar e editar o código de aplicativos C++/CLI usando o .NET Framework.","category":"Compiladores, ferramentas de build e tempos de execução"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Поддержка C++/CLI для средств сборки версии 142 (14.29-16.11)","description":"Необходимые инструменты и платформы для редактирования кода и отладки приложений на C++ и консольных приложений, использующих платформу .NET Framework.","category":"Компиляторы, средства сборки и среды выполнения"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"v142 derleme araçları (14.29-16.11) için C++/CLI desteği","description":".NET Framework kullanarak C++/CLI uygulamalarında kod düzenleme ve hata ayıklama işlemleri yapmak için gereken araçlar ve çerçeveler.","category":"Derleyiciler, derleme araçları ve çalışma zamanları"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.29.16.11.MFC","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.29.16.11.ATL":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.MFC.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.MFC.MBCS":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.MFC.MBCS.x64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.MFC.Redist.X64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.MFC.Redist.X86":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.MFC.Source":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.MFC.x64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.MFC.x86":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC_-104079356":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Community"]},"Microsoft.VisualCpp.HTMLHelpWorkshop.Msi":"[4.0,5.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ v14.29 (16.11) MFC for v142 build tools (x86 & x64)","description":"Includes headers and libraries for the development of MFC applications including the Multi-byte Character Set (MBCS).","category":"SDKs, libraries, and frameworks"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"适用于 v142 生成工具的 C++ v14.29 (16.11) MFC (x86 和 x64)","description":"包括用于开发 MFC 应用程序的标头和库，包含多字节字符集(MBCS)。","category":"SDK、库和框架"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 v142 建置工具的 C++ v14.29 (16.11) MFC (x86 與 x64)","description":"包含標頭與程式庫 (含多位元組字元集 (MBCS)) 供開發 MFC 應用程式之用。","category":"SDK、程式庫和架構"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"C++ v14.29 (16.11) MFC pro nástroje sestavení v142 (x86 a x64)","description":"Obsahuje hlavičky a knihovny pro vývoj aplikací MFC,