wersji 142 (ARM)","description":"Zawiera nagłówki i biblioteki do opracowywania aplikacji MFC, łącznie z wielobajtowym zestawem znaków (MBCS) przeznaczonym dla architektury ARM.","category":"Zestawy SDK, biblioteki i struktury"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"C++ v14.29 (16.11) MFC para ferramenta de copilação v142 (ARM)","description":"Inclui cabeçalhos e bibliotecas para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos MFC, incluindo o Conjunto de Caracteres Multibyte (MBCS) com direcionamento a ARM.","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"MFC-библиотека C++ версии 14.29 (16.11) для средств сборки версии 142 (ARM)","description":"Включает заголовки и библиотеки для разработки приложений MFC, включая многобайтовую кодировку (MBCS) для нацеливания ARM.","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"v142 derleme araçları (ARM) için C++ v14.29 (16.11) MFC","description":"ARM'yi hedefleyen Çok Baytlı Karakter Kümesi (MBCS) dahil olmak üzere MFC uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik üst bilgileri ve kitaplıkları içerir.","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.29.16.11.MFC.ARM.Spectre","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.29.16.11.ATL.ARM.Spectre":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.MFC.ARM.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.MFC.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.MFC.MBCS.ARM.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.MFC.Redist.ARM.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.MFC.Source":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC_-104079356":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Community"]},"Microsoft.VisualCpp.HTMLHelpWorkshop.Msi":"[4.0,5.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ v14.29 (16.11) MFC for v142 build tools with Spectre Mitigations (ARM)","description":"Includes headers and libraries with Spectre Mitigations for the development of MFC applications including the Multi-byte Character Set (MBCS) targeting ARM.","category":"SDKs, libraries, and frameworks"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"带有 Spectre 缓解措施适用于 v142 生成工具的 C++ v14.29 (16.11) MFC (ARM)","description":"包括带有 Spectre 缓解措施的标头和库，它们用于开发 MFC 应用程序(例如，面向 ARM 的多字节字符集(MBCS))。","category":"SDK、库和框架"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 v142 建置工具且具有 Spectre 風險降低功能的 C++ v14.29 (16.11) MFC (ARM)","description":"包含用於開發 MFC 應用程式的標頭與程式庫及 Spectre 風險降低，包含以 ARM 為目標的多位元組字元集 (MBCS)。","category":"SDK、程式庫和架構"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"C++ v14.29 (16.11) MFC pro nástroje sestavení v142 se zmírněními hrozby Spectre (ARM)","description":"Obsahuje hlavičky a knihovny se zmírněními hrozeb Spectre pro vývoj aplikací MFC, včetně vícebajtové znakové sady (MBCS) s cílením na ARM.","category":"Sady SDK, knihovny a architektury"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++ v14.29-MFC (16.11) für v142-Buildtools mit Spectre-Entschärfungen (ARM)","description":"Umfasst Header und Bibliotheken mit Spectre-Entschärfungen für die Entwicklung von MFC-Anwendungen einschließlich Multibyte-Zeichensatz (MBCS) für ARM.","category":"SDKs, Bibliotheken und Frameworks"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Herramientas de compilación de MFC de C++ v14.29 (16.11) para v142 con mitigaciones de Spectre (ARM)","description":"Incluye encabezados y bibliotecas con mitigaciones de Spectre para el desarrollo de aplicaciones MFC, incluido el juego de caracteres multibyte (MBCS) destinado a ARM.","category":"SDK, bibliotecas y marcos"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"C++ v14.29 (16.11) MFC pour Build Tools v142 avec atténuations Spectre (ARM)","description":"Inclut des en-têtes et des bibliothèques avec atténuations Spectre pour le développement d'applications MFC, notamment le jeu de caractères multioctets (MBCS) ciblant ARM.","category":"SDK, bibliothèques et frameworks"},{"language":"it-it","title":"MFC C++ v14.29 (16.11) per Build Tools v142 con mitigazioni Spectre (ARM)","description":"Include intestazioni e librerie con mitigazioni Spectre per lo sviluppo di applicazioni MFC, incluso il set di caratteri multibyte (MBCS), destinate ad ARM.","category":"SDK, librerie e framework"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Spectre の軽減策を含む v142 ビルド ツール用 C++ v14.29 (16.11) MFC (ARM)","description":"ARM をターゲットにしたマルチ バイト文字セット (MBCS) を含む MFC アプリケーションを開発するための、Spectre の軽減策を含むヘッダーとライブラリが含まれます。","category":"SDK、ライブラリ、およびフレームワーク"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Spectre 완화를 지원하는 v142 빌드 도구용 C++ v14.29(16.11) MFC(ARM)","description":"ARM을 대상으로 하는 MBCS(멀티바이트 문자 집합)를 비롯하여 MFC 애플리케이션 개발에 대해 스펙터 완화를 사용하는 헤더와 라이브러리를 포함합니다.","category":"SDK, 라이브러리 및 프레임워크"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"C++ wer. 14.29 (16.11) MFC dla narzędzi kompilacji w wersji 142 z krokami zaradczymi dla luki Spectre (ARM)","description":"Zawiera nagłówki i biblioteki z krokami zaradczymi dla luki Spectre do opracowywania aplikacji MFC, łącznie z wielobajtowym zestawem znaków (MBCS) przeznaczonym dla architektury ARM.","category":"Zestawy SDK, biblioteki i struktury"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"C++ v14.29 (16.11) MFC para ferramenta de copilação v142 com Mitigações de Spectre (ARM)","description":"Inclui cabeçalhos e bibliotecas com Mitigações de Espectro para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos MFC, incluindo o Conjunto de Caracteres Multibyte (MBCS) com direcionamento a ARM.","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"MFC-библиотека C++ версии 14.29 (16.11) для средств сборки версии 142 с устранением рисков Spectre (ARM)","description":"Включает заголовки и библиотеки с устранением рисков Spectre для разработки приложений MFC, включая многобайтовую кодировку (MBCS) для целевой платформы ARM.","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Spectre Riskini Azaltma ile v142 derleme araçları için C++ v14.29 (16.11) MFC (ARM)","description":"ARM'yi hedefleyen Çok Baytlı Karakter Kümesi (MBCS) dahil olmak üzere MFC uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik Spectre Azaltmalarının bulunduğu üst bilgileri ve kitaplıkları içerir.","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.29.16.11.MFC.ARM64","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.29.16.11.ATL.ARM64":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.MFC.ARM64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.MFC.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.MFC.MBCS.ARM64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.MFC.Redist.ARM64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.MFC.Source":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC_-104079356":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Community"]},"Microsoft.VisualCpp.HTMLHelpWorkshop.Msi":"[4.0,5.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ v14.29 (16.11) MFC for v142 build tools (ARM64)","description":"Includes headers and libraries for the development of MFC applications including the Multi-byte Character Set (MBCS) targeting ARM64.","category":"SDKs, libraries, and frameworks"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"适用于 v142 生成工具的 C++ v14.29 (16.11) MFC (ARM64)","description":"包括用于开发面向 ARM64 的多字节字符集(MBCS)等 MFC 应用程序的标头和库。","category":"SDK、库和框架"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 v142 建置工具的 C++ v14.29 (16.11) MFC (ARM64)","description":"包含用於開發 MFC 應用程式的標頭與程式庫，包含以 ARM64 為目標的多位元組字元集 (MBCS)。","category":"SDK、程式庫和架構"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"C++ v14.29 (16.11) MFC pro nástroje sestavení v142 (ARM64)","description":"Obsahuje hlavičky a knihovny pro vývoj aplikací MFC, včetně vícebajtové znakové sady (MBCS) s cílením na ARM64.","category":"Sady SDK, knihovny 