 cabeçalhos e bibliotecas para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos MFC, incluindo o Conjunto de Caracteres Multibyte (MBCS) com direcionamento a ARM64.","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"C++ v14.30 (17.0) MFC для средств сборки v143 (ARM64) (поддержка прекращена)","description":"Включает заголовки и библиотеки для разработки приложений MFC, включая многобайтовую кодировку (MBCS) для нацеливания ARM64.","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"v143 derleme araçları için C++ v14.30 (17.0) MFC (ARM64) (Destek dışı)","description":"ARM64'ü hedefleyen Çok Baytlı Karakter Kümesi (MBCS) dahil olmak üzere MFC uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik üst bilgileri ve kitaplıkları içerir.","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.30.17.0.MFC.ARM64.Spectre","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"outOfSupport":true,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.30.17.0.ATL.ARM64.Spectre":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.30.17.0.MFC.ARM64.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.30.17.0.MFC.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.30.17.0.MFC.MBCS.ARM64.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.30.17.0.MFC.Redist.ARM64.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.30.17.0.MFC.Source":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC_-104079356":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Community"]},"Microsoft.VisualCpp.HTMLHelpWorkshop.Msi":"[4.0,5.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ v14.30 (17.0) MFC for v143 build tools with Spectre Mitigations (ARM64) (Out of support)","description":"Includes headers and libraries with Spectre mitigations for the development of MFC applications including the Multi-byte Character Set (MBCS) targeting A