ための、Spectre の軽減策を含むヘッダーとライブラリが含まれます。サポート終了: 2024 年 1 月","category":"SDK、ライブラリ、およびフレームワーク"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Spectre 완화가 포함된 v143 빌드 도구용 C++ v14.32(17.2) MFC(ARM64)(지원 중단)","description":"ARM64를 대상으로 하는 MBCS(멀티바이트 문자 집합)를 비롯하여 MFC 애플리케이션 개발을 위한 Spectre 완화 기능이 포함된 헤더와 라이브러리를 포함합니다. 지원 종료일: 2024년 1월","category":"SDK, 라이브러리 및 프레임워크"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Klasa MFC języka C++ w wersji 14.32 (17.2) dla narzędzi kompilacji w wersji 143 z ograniczeniami ryzyka Spectre (ARM64) (zakończono wsparcie)","description":"Zawiera nagłówki i biblioteki ze środkami zaradczymi dla luki Spectre na potrzeby programowania aplikacji MFC, łącznie z wielobajtowym zestawem znaków (MBCS) przeznaczonym dla architektury ARM64. Koniec wsparcia technicznego: styczeń 2024 r.","category":"Zestawy SDK, biblioteki i struktury"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"C++ v14.32 (17.2) MFC para ferramentas de build v143 com mitigação do Spectre (ARM64) (Sem suporte)","description":"Inclui cabeçalhos e bibliotecas com as mitigações do Spectre para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos MFC, incluindo o Conjunto de Caracteres Multibyte (MBCS) direcionado ao ARM64. Fim do suporte: janeiro de 2024","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"MFC-библиотека C++ версии 14.32 (17.2) для средств сборки версии 143 с устранением рисков Spectre (ARM64) (поддержка прекращена)","description":"Включает заголовки и библиотеки с устранением рисков Spectre для разработки приложений MFC, включая многобайтовую кодировку (MBCS) для целевой платформы ARM64. Окончание поддержки: январь 2024 г.","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Spectre Risk Azaltmaları içeren v143 derleme araçları için C++ v14.32 (17.2) MFC (ARM64) (Destek dışı)","description":"ARM64'ü hedefleyen Çok Baytlı Karakter Kümesi (MBCS) dahil olmak üzere MFC uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik Spectre Azaltmalarının bulunduğu üst bilgileri ve kitaplıkları içerir. Destek sonu: Ocak 2024","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.32.17.2.MFC.Spectre","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"outOfSupport":true,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.32.17.2.ATL.Spectre":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.MFC.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.MFC.MBCS.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.MFC.MBCS.x64.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.MFC.Redist.X64.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.MFC.Redist.X86.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.MFC.Source":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.MFC.x64.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.MFC.x86.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC_-104079356":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Community"]},"Microsoft.VisualCpp.HTMLHelpWorkshop.Msi":"[4.0,5.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ v14.32 (17.2) MFC for v143 build tools with Spectre Mitigations (x86 & x64) (Out of support)","description":"Includes headers and libraries with Spectre Mitigations for the development of ATL and MFC applications including the Multi-byte Character Set (MBCS). End of support: January 2024","category":"SDKs, libraries, and frameworks"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"带有 Spectre 缓解措施适用于 v143 生成工具的 C++ v14.32 (17.2) MFC (x86 和 x64)(不受支持)","description":"包括带有 Spectre 缓解措施的标头和库，用于开发包含多字节字符集(MBCS)的 ATL 和 MFC 应用程序。终止支持: 2024 年 1 月","category":"SDK、库和框架"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 v143 組建工具且具有 Spectre 風險降低功能的 C++ v14.32 (17.2) MFC (x86 和 x64) (不再支援)","description":"包含用於開發 MFC 應用程式的標頭與程式庫及 Spectre 風險降低，包含以 ALT 和 ARM 為目標的多位元組字元集 (MBCS)。終止支援: 2024 年 1 月","category":"SDK、程式庫和架構"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"C++ v14.32 (17.2) MFC pro nástroje sestavení v143 se zmírněními hrozby Spectre (x86 a x64) (podpora skončila)","description":"Obsahuje hlavičky a knihovny se zmírněními hrozeb Spectre pro vývoj aplikací ATL a MFC, včetně vícebajtové znakové sady (MBCS). Konec podpory: leden 2024","category":"Sady SDK, knihovny a architektury"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++ v14.32 (17.2) MFC für v143-Buildtools mit Spectre-Entschärfungen (x86 und x64) (Nicht mehr unterstützt)","description":"Umfasst Header und Bibliotheken mit Spectre-Entschärfungen für die Entwicklung von ATL- und MFC-Anwendungen einschließlich Multibyte-Zeichensatz (MBCS). Ende des Supports: Januar 2024","category":"SDKs, Bibliotheken und Frameworks"},{"language":"es-es","title":"C++ v14.32 (17.2) MFC para herramientas de compilación v143 con mitigaciones de Spectre (x86 y x64) (sin soporte técnico)","description":"Incluye encabezados y bibliotecas con mitigaciones de Spectre para el desarrollo de aplicaciones ATL y MFC, incluido el juego de caracteres multibyte (MBCS). Finalización del soporte: enero de 2024","category":"SDK, bibliotecas y marcos"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"C++ v14.32 (17.2) MFC pour les outils de build v143 avec atténuations de Spectre (x86 & x64) (hors support)","description":"Inclut des en-têtes et des bibliothèques avec atténuations Spectre pour le développement d'applications ATL et MFC, notamment le jeu de caractères multioctets (MBCS). Fin du support : janvier 2024","category":"SDK, bibliothèques et frameworks"},{"language":"it-it","title":"MFC C++ v14.32 (17.2) per gli strumenti di compilazione v143 con mitigazioni Spectre (x86 e x64) (Supporto non disponibile)","description":"Include intestazioni e librerie con mitigazioni Spectre per lo sviluppo di applicazioni ATL e MFC, incluso il set di caratteri multibyte (MBCS). Fine del supporto: gennaio 2024","category":"SDK, librerie e framework"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Spectre 軽減策を備えた v143 ビルド ツール (x86 および x64) 用の C++ v14.32 (17.2) MFC (サポート対象外)","description":"マルチ バイト文字セット (MBCS) を含む ATL および MFC アプリケーションを開発するための、Spectre の軽減策を含むヘッダーとライブラリが含まれます。サポート終了: 2024 年 1 月","category":"SDK、ライブラリ、およびフレームワーク"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Spectre 완화가 포함된 v143 빌드 도구용 C++ v14.32(17.2) MFC(x86 및 x64)(지원 중단)","description":"MBCS(멀티바이트 문자 집합)를 비롯하여 ATL 및 MFC 애플리케이션 개발을 위한 Spectre 완화 기능을 사용하는 헤더와 라이브러리를 포함합니다. 지원 종료일: 2024년 1월","category":"SDK, 라이브러리 및 프레임워크"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Klasa MFC języka C++ w wersji 14.32 (17.2) dla narzędzi kompilacji w wersji 143 z ograniczeniami ryzyka luki Spectre (x86 i x64) (koniec wsparcia)","description":"Zawiera nagłówki i biblioteki ze środkami zaradczymi dla luki Spectre na potrzeby programowania aplikacji ATL i MFC, łącznie z wielobajtowym zestawem znaków (MBCS). Koniec wsparcia technicznego: styczeń 2024 r.","category":"Zestawy SDK, biblioteki i struktury"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"C++ v14.32 (17.2) MFC para ferramentas de build v143 com mitigação do Spectre (x86 e x64) (Sem suporte)","description":"Inclui cabeçalhos e bibliotecas com Mitigações do Spectre para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos ATL e MFC, incluindo o Conjunto de Caracteres Multibyte (MBCS). Fim do suporte: janeiro de 2024","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"MFC-библиотека C++ версии 14.32 (17.2) для средств сборки версии 143 с устранением рисков Spectre (x86 и x64) (поддержка прекращена)","description":"Включает заголовки и библиотеки с устранением рисков Spectre для разработки приложений ATL и MFC, включая многобайтовую кодировку (MBCS). Окончание поддержки: январь 2024 г.","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Spectre Risk Azaltmaları içeren v143 derleme araçları için C++ v14.32 (17.2) MFC (x86 ve x64) (Destek dışı)","description":"Çok Baytlı Karakter Kümesi (MBCS) dahil olmak üzere ATL ve MFC uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik Spectre Risk Azaltmalarının bulunduğu üst bilgileri ve kitaplıkları içerir. Destek sonu: Ocak 2024","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.32.17.2.x86.x64","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"outOfSupport":true,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.MSBuild.v170.x64.v143":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.MSBuild.v170.x86.v143":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VS.VC.vcvars.X64.Shortcuts":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VS.VC.vcvars.X86.Shortcuts":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.vcvars":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.Redist.14.Latest":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.Redist.14":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.RuntimeDebug.14":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.CRT.ClickOnce.Msi":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.CRT.Redist.Resources":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.DIA.SDK":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.ASAN.X86":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.CodeAnalysis.Extensions.X64":{"version":"[14.0,18.0)","chip":"x64"},"Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.CodeAnalysis.Extensions.X86":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.CRT.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.CRT.Redist.X64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.CRT.Redist.X64.OneCore.Desktop":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.CRT.Redist.X86":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.CRT.Redist.X86.OneCore.Desktop":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.CRT.Source":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.CRT.X64.Desktop":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.CRT.X64.OneCore.Desktop":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.CRT.X64.Store":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.CRT.X86.Desktop":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.CRT.X86.OneCore.Desktop":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.CRT.X86.Store":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.PGO.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.PGO.X64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.PGO.X86":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.Premium.Tools.HostX86.TargetX64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.Premium.Tools.HostX86.TargetX86":"[14.0,18.0)","Mic