":"SDK, bibliotecas y marcos"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"C++ v14.33 (17.3) MFC pour les outils de build v143 (x86 et x64) (non pris en charge)","description":"Inclut des en-têtes et des bibliothèques pour le développement d'applications MFC, notamment le jeu de caractères multioctets (MBCS).","category":"SDK, bibliothèques et frameworks"},{"language":"it-it","title":"MFC C++ v14.33 (17.3) per strumenti di compilazione v143 (x86 & x64) (Supporto non disponibile)","description":"Include intestazioni e librerie per lo sviluppo di applicazioni MFC, incluso il set di caratteri multibyte (MBCS).","category":"SDK, librerie e framework"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"v143 ビルド ツール (x86 および x64) 用 C++ v14.33 (17.3) MFC (サポート対象外)","description":"マルチ バイト文字セット (MBCS) を含む MFC アプリケーションの開発用ヘッダーとライブラリが含まれます。","category":"SDK、ライブラリ、およびフレームワーク"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"v143 빌드 도구용 C++ v14.33(17.3) MFC(x86 & x64)(지원되지 않음)","description":"MBCS(멀티바이트 문자 집합)를 비롯하여 MFC 애플리케이션 개발에 필요한 헤더와 라이브러리를 포함합니다.","category":"SDK, 라이브러리 및 프레임워크"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Klasy MFC języka C++ w wersji 14.33 (17.3) dla narzędzi kompilacji w wersji 143 (x86 i x64) (brak pomocy technicznej)","description":"Zawiera nagłówki i biblioteki na potrzeby programowania aplikacji MFC, w tym zestaw znaków wielobajtowych (MBCS).","category":"Zestawy SDK, biblioteki i struktury"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"C++ v14.33 (17.3) MFC para ferramentas de compilação v143 (x86 e x64) (sem suporte)","description":"Inclui cabeçalhos e bibliotecas para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos do MFC, incluindo o Conjunto de Caracteres Multibyte (MBCS).","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"C++ v14.33 (17.3) MFC для средств сборки v143 (x86 и x64) (не поддерживается)","description":"Включает заголовки и библиотеки для разработки приложений MFC, включая многобайтовую кодировку (MBCS).","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"v143 derleme araçları için C++ v14.33 (17.3) MFC (x86 ve x64) (Destek dışı)","description":"Çok Baytlı Karakter Kümesi (MBCS) dahil olmak üzere MFC uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik üst bilgileri ve kitaplıkları içerir.","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.33.17.3.MFC.ARM","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"outOfSupport":true,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.33.17.3.ATL.ARM":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.33.17.3.MFC.ARM":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.33.17.3.MFC.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.33.17.3.MFC.MBCS.arm":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.MFC.Redist.ARM":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.33.17.3.MFC.Source":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC_-104079356":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Community"]},"Microsoft.VisualCpp.HTMLHelpWorkshop.Msi":"[4.0,5.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ v14.33 (17.3) MFC for v143 build tools (ARM) (Out of support)","description":"Includes headers and libraries for the development of MFC applications including the Multi-byte Character Set (MBCS) targeting ARM.","category":"SDKs, libraries, and frameworks"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"适用于 v143 生成工具的 C++ v14.33 (17.3) MFC (ARM) (不受支持)","description":"包括用于开发面向 ARM 的多字节字符集(MBCS)等 MFC 应用程序的标头和库。","category":"SDK、库和框架"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 v143 建置工具的 C++ v14.33 (17.3) (ARM) (超出範圍)","description":"包含用於開發 MFC 應用程式的標頭與程式庫，包含以 ARM 為目標的多位元組字元集 (MBCS)。","category":"SDK、程式庫和架構"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"C++ v14.33 (17.3) MFC pro nástroje sestavení v143 (ARM) (podpora skončila)","description":"Obsahuje hlavičky a knihovny pro vývoj aplikací MFC, včetně vícebajtové znakové sady (MBCS) s cílením na ARM.","category":"Sady SDK, knihovny a architektury"},{"la