ловки и библиотеки с устранением рисков Spectre для разработки приложений MFC, включая многобайтовую кодировку (MBCS) для целевой платформы ARM64.","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Spectre Risk Azaltmaları içeren v143 derleme araçları için C++ v14.33 (17.3) MFC (ARM64) (Destek dışı)","description":"ARM64'ü hedefleyen Çok Baytlı Karakter Kümesi (MBCS) dahil olmak üzere MFC uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik Spectre Azaltmalarının bulunduğu üst bilgileri ve kitaplıkları içerir.","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.33.17.3.MFC.Spectre","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"outOfSupport":true,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.33.17.3.ATL.Spectre":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.33.17.3.MFC.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.33.17.3.MFC.MBCS.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.33.17.3.MFC.MBCS.x64.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.MFC.Redist.X64.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.32.17.2.MFC.Redist.X86.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.33.17.3.MFC.Source":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.33.17.3.MFC.x64.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.33.17.3.MFC.x86.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC_-104079356":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Community"]},"Microsoft.VisualCpp.HTMLHelpWorkshop.Msi":"[4.0,5.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ v14.33 (17.3) MFC for v143 build tools with Spectre Mitigations (x86 & x64) (Out of support)","description":"Includes headers and libraries with Spectre Mitigations for the development of ATL and MFC applications including the Multi-byte Character Set (MBCS).","category":"SDKs, libraries, and frameworks"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"带有 Spectre 缓解措施适用于 v143 生成工具的 C++ v14.33 (17.3) MFC (x86 & x64) (不受支持)","description":"包括带有 Spectre 缓解措施的标头和库，用于开发包括多字节字符集(MBCS)的 ATL 和 MFC 应用程序。","category":"SDK、库和框架"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"C++ v14.33 (17.3) MFC for v143 建置工具搭配 Spectre 風險降低 (x86 & x64) (不再支援)","description":"包含用於開發 MFC 應用程式的標頭與程式庫及 Spectre 風險降低，包含以 ALT 和 ARM 為目標的多位元組字元集 (MBCS)。","category":"SDK、程式庫和架構"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"C++ v14.33 (17.3) MFC pro nástroje sestavení v143 se zmírněními hrozby Spectre (x86 & x64) (mimo podporu)","description":"Obsahuje hlavičky a knihovny se zmírněními hrozeb Spectre pro vývoj aplikací ATL a MFC, včetně vícebajtové znakové sady (MBCS).","category":"Sady SDK, knihovny a architektury"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++ v14.33 (17.3) MFC für v143-Buildtools mit Spectre-Entschärfungen (x86 und x64) (Nicht mehr unterstützt)","description":"Umfasst Header und Bibliotheken mit Spectre-Entschärfungen für die Entwicklung von ATL- und MFC-Anwendungen einschließlich Multibyte-Zeichensatz (MBCS).","category":"SDKs, Bibliotheken und Frameworks"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Herramientas de compilación MFC para v143 de C++ v14.33 (17.3) con mitigaciones de Spectre (x86 y x64) (sin soporte técnico)","description":"Incluye encabezados y bibliotecas con mitigaciones de Spectre para el desarrollo de aplicaciones ATL y MFC, incluido el juego de caracteres multibyte (MBCS).","category":"SDK, bibliotecas y marcos"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"C++ v14.33 (17.3) MFC pour les outils de build v143 avec atténuations de Spectre (x86 & x64) (Non pris en charge)","description":"Inclut des en-têtes et des bibliothèques avec atténuations Spectre pour le développement d'applications ATL et MFC, notamment le jeu de caractères multioctets (MBCS).","category":"SDK, bibliothèques et frameworks"},{"language":"it-it","title":"MFC C++ v14.33 (17.3) per gli strumenti di compilazione v143 con mitigazioni Spectre (x86 e x64) (Supporto non disponibile)","description":"Include intestazioni e librerie con mitigazioni Spectre per lo sviluppo di applicazioni ATL e MFC, incluso il set di caratteri multibyte (MBCS).","category":"SDK, librerie e framework"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Spectre 軽減策を備えた v143 ビルド ツール (x86 および x64) 用の C++ v14.33 (17.3)MFC (サポート対象外)","description":"マルチ バイト文字セット (MBCS) を含む ATL および MFC アプリケーションを開発するための、Spectre の軽減策を含むヘッダーとライブラリが含まれます。","category":"SDK、ライブラリ、およびフレームワーク"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"C++ v14.33(17.3) Spectre 완화(x86 & x64)가 포함된 v143 빌드 도구용 MFC(지원되지 않음)","description":"MBCS(멀티바이트 문자 집합)를 비롯하여 ATL 및 MFC 애플리케이션 개발에 대해 Spectre 완화를 사용하는 헤더와 라이브러리를 포함합니다.","category":"SDK, 라이브러리 및 프레임워크"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Klasy MFC języka C++ v14.33 (17.3) dla narzędzi kompilacji v143 z ograniczeniami ryzyka luki Spectre (x86 i x64) (brak pomocy technicznej)","description":"Zawiera nagłówki i biblioteki ze środkami zaradczymi dla luki Spectre na potrzeby programowania aplikacji ATL i MFC, łącznie z wielobajtowym zestawem znaków (MBCS).","category":"Zestawy SDK, biblioteki i struktury"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"C++ v14.33 (17.3) MFC para ferramentas de compilação v143 com Spectre Mitigations (x86 e x64) (sem suporte)","description":"Inclui cabeçalhos e bibliotecas com Mitigações do Spectre para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos ATL e MFC, incluindo o Conjunto de Caracteres Multibyte (MBCS).","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"C++ v14.33 (17.3) MFC для средств сборки v143 с устранением уязвимости Spectre (x86 и x64) (не поддерживается)","description":"Включает заголовки и библиотеки с устранением рисков Spectre для разработки приложений ATL и MFC, включая многобайтовую кодировку (MBCS).","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Spectre Risk Azaltmaları içeren v143 derleme araçları için C++ v14.33 (17.3) MFC (x86 ve x64) (Destek dışı)","description":"Çok Baytlı Karakter Kümesi (MBCS) dahil olmak üzere ATL ve MFC uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik Spe