d":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.35.17.5.CLI.Support","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"outOfSupport":true,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.Net.Component.4.8.SDK":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Net.Component.4.7.2.TargetingPack":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Net.Component.4.6.1.TargetingPack":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Templates.CLR_-104079356":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Templates.CLR","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Community"]},"Microsoft.VC.14.35.17.5.CLI.ARM":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.35.17.5.CLI.ARM64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.35.17.5.CLI.Source":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.35.17.5.CLI.X64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.35.17.5.CLI.X86":"[14.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++/CLI support for v143 build tools (14.35-17.5) (Out of support)","description":"Required tools and frameworks for code editing and debugging C++/CLI applications using the .NET framework.","category":"Compilers, build tools, and runtimes"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"适用于 v143 生成工具的 C++/CLI 支持(14.35-17.5) (不受支持)","description":"使用 .NET Framework 对 C++/CLI 应用程序进行代码编辑和调试所需的工具和框架。","category":"编译器、生成工具和运行时"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"v143 建置工具 (14.35-17.5) 的 C++/CLI 支援 (不再支援)","description":"使用 .NET Framework 進行 C++/CLI 應用程式程式碼編輯與偵錯的必要工具與架構。","category":"編譯器、建置工具和執行階段"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Podpora C++/CLI pro nástroje pro sestavování v143 (14.35-17.5) (podpora skončila)","description":"Požadované nástroje a rozhraní pro úpravy kódu a ladění aplikací C++/CLI pomocí rozhraní .NET Framework.","category":"Kompilátory, nástroje pro sestavování buildů a moduly runtime"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++-/CLI-Unterstützung für v143-Buildtools (14.35-17.5) (Nicht mehr unterstützt)","description":"Erforderliche Tools und Frameworks für die Codebearbeitung und das Debuggen von C++-/CLI-Anwendungen mithilfe von .NET Framework.","category":"Compiler, Buildtools und Laufzeiten"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Compatibilidad de C++/CLI con las herramientas de compilación v143 (14.35-17.5) (sin soporte técnico)","description":"Herramientas y marcos de trabajo necesarios para la edición y depuración de código de aplicaciones C++/CLI con .NET Framework.","category":"Compiladores, herramientas de compilación y entornos de ejecución"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Prise en charge C++/CLI pour les outils de build v143 (14.35-17.5) (Non pris en charge)","description":"Outils et frameworks nécessaires pour modifier le code et déboguer les applications C++/CLI à l'aide du .NET Framework","category":"Compilateurs, outils de génération et runtimes"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Supporto di C++/CLI per gli strumenti di compilazione v143 (14.35-17.5) (supporto non disponibile)","description":"Strumenti e framework necessari per la modifica del codice e il debug di applicazioni C++/CLI con .NET Framework.","category":"Compilatori, strumenti di compilazione e runtime"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"v143 ビルド ツールの C++/CLI サポート (14.35-17.5) (サポート対象外)","description":".NET Framework を使用して C++/CLI アプリケーションのコード編集やデバッグを行うために必要なツールとフレームワーク。","category":"コンパイラ、ビルド ツール、およびランタイム"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"v143 빌드 도구(14.35-17.5)에 대한 C++/CLI 지원(지원 중단)","description":".NET Framework를 사용한 C++/CLI 애플리케이션 디버깅 및 코드 편집을 위해 필요한 도구 및 프레임워크입니다.","category":"컴파일러, 빌드 도구 및 런타임"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Obsługa języka C++/interfejsu wiersza polecenia dla narzędzi kompilacji w wersji 143 (14.35-17.5) (brak pomocy technicznej)","description":"Wymagane narzędzia i platformy na potrzeby edytowania kodu i debugowania aplikacji C++/CLI przy użyciu platformy .NET Framework.","category":"Kompilatory, narzędzia do kompilacji i środowiska uruchomieniowe"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Suporte C++/CLI para ferramentas de compilação v143 (14.35-17.5) (sem suporte)","description":"As ferramentas e as estruturas necessárias para depurar e editar o código de aplicativos C++/CLI usando o .NET Framework.","category":"Compiladores, ferramentas de build e tempos de execução"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Поддержка C++/CLI для средств сборки v143 (14.35–17.5) (поддержка прекращена)","description":"Необходимые инструменты и платформы для редактирования кода и отладки приложений на C++ и консольных приложений, использующих платформу .NET Framework.","category":"Компиляторы, средства сборки и среды выполнения"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"v143 derleme araçları (14.35-17.5) için C++/CLI desteği (Destek dışı)","description":".NET Framework kullanarak C++/CLI uygulamalarında kod düzenleme ve hata ayıklama işlemleri yapmak için gereken araçlar ve çerçeveler.","category":"Derleyiciler, derleme araçları ve çalışma zamanları"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.35.17.5.MFC","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"outOfSupport":true,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.35.17.5.ATL":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.35.17.5.MFC.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.35.17.5.MFC.MBCS":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.35.17.5.MFC.MBCS.x64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.34.17.4.MFC.Redist.X64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.34.17.4.MFC.Redist.X86":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.35.17.5.MFC.Source":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.35.17.5.MFC.x64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.35.17.5.MFC.x86":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC_-104079356":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Community"]},"Microsoft.VisualCpp.HTMLHelpWorkshop.Msi":"[4.0,5.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ v14.35 (17.5) MFC for v143 build tools (x86 & x64) (Out of support)","description":"Includes headers and libraries for the development of MFC applications including the Multi-byte Character Set (MBCS).","category":"SDKs, libraries, and frameworks"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"适用于 v143 生成工具的 C++ v14.35 (17.5) MFC (x86 & x64) (不受支持)","description":"包括用于开发 MFC 应用程序的标头和库，包含多字节字符集(MBCS)。","category":"SDK、库和框架"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"C++ v14.35 (17.5) MFC for v143 建置工具 (x86 & x64) (不再支援)","description":"包含用於開發 MFC 應用程式的標頭與程式庫，包含多位元組字元集 (MBCS)。","category":"SDK、程式庫和架構"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"C++ v14.35 (17.5) MFC pro nástroje sestavení v143 (x86 a x64) (podpora skončila)","description":"Obsahuje hlavičky a knihovny pro vývoj aplikací MFC, včetně vícebajtové znakové sady (MBCS).","category":"Sady SDK, knihovny a architektury"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++ v14.35 (17.5) MFC für v143-Buildtools (x86 und x64) (Nicht mehr unterstützt)","description":"Umfasst Header und Bibliotheken für die Entwicklung von MFC-Anwendungen einschließlich Multibyte-Zeichensatz (MBCS).","category":"SDKs, Bibliotheken und Frameworks"},{"language":"es-es","title":"C++ v14.35 (17.5) MFC para las herramientas de compilación v143 (x86 & x64) (sin soporte técnico)","description":"Incluye encabezados y bibliotecas para el desarrollo de aplicaciones MFC, incluido el juego de caracteres multibyte (MBCS).","category":"SDK, bibliotecas y marcos"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"C++ v14.35 (17.5) MFC pour les outils de build v143 (x86 et x64) (non pris en charge)","description":"Inclut des en-têtes et des bibliothèques pour le développement d'applications MFC, notamment le jeu de caractères multioctets (MBCS).","category":"SDK, bibliothèques et frameworks"},{"language":"it-it","title":"MFC C++ v14.35 (17.5) per gli strumenti di compilazione v143 (x86 e x64) (supporto non disponibile)","description":"Include intestazioni e librerie per lo sviluppo di applicazioni MFC, incluso il set di caratteri multibyte (MBCS).","category":"SDK, librerie e framework"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"v143 ビルド ツール (x86 および x64) 用の C++ v14.35 (17.5) MFC (サポート対象外)","description":"マルチ バイト文字セット (MBCS) を含む MFC アプリケーションの開発用ヘッダーとライブラリが含まれます。","category":"SDK、ライブラリ、およびフレームワーク"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"v143 빌드 도구용 C++ v14.35(17.5) MFC(x86 및 x64)(지원되지 않음)","description":"MBCS(멀티바이트 문자 집합)를 비롯하여 MFC 애플리케이션 개발에 필요한 헤더와 라이브러리를 포함합니다.","category":"SDK, 라이브러리 및 프레임워크"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Klasy MFC języka C++ w wersji 14.35 (17.5) dla narzędzi kompilacji w wersji 143 (x86 i x64) (brak pomocy technicznej)","description":"Zawiera nagłówki i biblioteki na potrzeby programowania aplikacji MFC, w tym zestaw znaków wielobajtowych (MBCS).","category":"Zestawy SDK, biblioteki i struktury"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"C++ v14.35 (17.5) MFC para ferramentas de compilação v143 (x86 e x64) (sem suporte)","description":"Inclui cabeçalhos e bibliotecas para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos do MFC, incluindo o Conjunto de Caracteres Multibyte (MBCS).","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"C++ v14.35 (17.5) MFC для средств сборки v143 (x86 и x64) (поддержка прекращена)","description":"Включает заголовки и библиотеки для разработки приложений MFC, включая многобайтовую кодировку (MBCS).","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"v143 derleme araçları için C++ v14.35 (17.5) MFC (x86 ve x64) (Destek dışı)","description":"Çok Baytlı Karakter Kümesi (MBCS) dahil olmak üzere MFC uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik üst bilgileri ve kitaplıkları içerir.","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.35.17.5.MFC.ARM","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"outOfSupport":true,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.35.17.5.ATL.ARM":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.35.17.5.MFC.ARM":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.35.17.5.MFC.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.35.17.5.MFC.MBCS.arm":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.34.17.4.MFC.Redist