FC, включая многобайтовую кодировку (MBCS) для нацеливания ARM64.","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"v143 derleme araçları için C++ v14.35 (17.5) MFC (ARM64) (Destek dışı)","description":"ARM64'ü hedefleyen Çok Baytlı Karakter Kümesi (MBCS) dahil olmak üzere MFC uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik üst bilgileri ve kitaplıkları içerir.","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.35.17.5.MFC.ARM64.Spectre","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"outOfSupport":true,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.35.17.5.ATL.ARM64.Spectre":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.35.17.5.MFC.ARM64.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.35.17.5.MFC.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.35.17.5.MFC.MBCS.ARM64.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.34.17.4.MFC.Redist.ARM64.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.35.17.5.MFC.Source":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC_-104079356":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Community"]},"Microsoft.VisualCpp.HTMLHelpWorkshop.Msi":"[4.0,5.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ v14.35 (17.5) MFC for v143 build tools with Spectre Mitigations (ARM64) (Out of support)","description":"Includes headers and libraries with Spectre mitigations for the development of MFC applications including the Multi-byte Character Set (MBCS) targeting ARM64.","category":"SDKs, libraries, and frameworks"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"带有 Spectre 缓解措施适用于 v143 生成工具的 C++ v14.35 (17.5) MFC (ARM64) (不受支持)","description":"包括带有 Spectre 缓解措施的标头和库，用于开发包括面向 ARM64 的多字节字符集(MBCS)的 MFC 应用程序。","category":"SDK、库和框架"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"C++ v14.35 (17.5) MFC for v143 建置工具搭配 Spectre 風險降低 (ARM64) (不再支援)","description":"包含用於開發 MFC 應用