oteki języka Visual C++ w wersji 14.38 (wersja 143) programu Visual Studio 17.8 dla architektury x64/x86. Koniec wsparcia technicznego: lipiec 2025 r.","category":"Kompilatory, narzędzia do kompilacji i środowiska uruchomieniowe","keywords":["kompilatory","biblioteka","biblioteki","SDK","x86","x64"]},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Ferramentas de compilação do MSVC v143 - VS 2022 C++ x64/x86 (v14.38-17.8)","description":"Compiladores e Bibliotecas do Visual Studio 17.8 Visual C++ v14.38 (v143) para x64/x86. Fim do suporte: julho de 2025.","category":"Compiladores, ferramentas de build e tempos de execução","keywords":["compiladores","biblioteca","bibliotecas","SDK","x86","x64"]},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"MSVC версии 143 — средства сборки C++ VS 2022 для x64/x86 (версия 14.38–17.8)","description":"Компиляторы и библиотеки Visual Studio 17.8 Visual C++ версии 14.38 (версия 143) для x64/x86. Окончание поддержки: июль 2025 г.","category":"Компиляторы, средства сборки и среды выполнения","keywords":["компиляторы","библиотека","библиотеки","SDK","x86","x64"]},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"MSVC v143 - VS 2022 C++ x64/x86 derleme araçları (v14.38-17.8)","description":"x64/x86 için Visual Studio 17.8 Visual C++ v14.38 (v143) derleyicileri ve kitaplıkları. Destek sonu: Temmuz 2025.","category":"Derleyiciler, derleme araçları ve çalışma zamanları","keywords":["derleyiciler","kitaplık","kitaplıklar","SDK","x86","x64"]}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.38.17.8.x86.x64.Spectre","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.38.17.8.x86.x64":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.38.17.8.ATL.X64.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.38.17.8.ATL.X86.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.38.17.8.CRT.Redist.X64.spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.38.17.8.CRT.Redist.x64.OneCore.Desktop.spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.38.17.8.CRT.Redist.X86.spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Mic