bibliotecas para el desarrollo de aplicaciones MFC, incluido el juego de caracteres de varios bytes (MBCS) destinado a ARM. Fin del soporte técnico: enero de 2026.","category":"SDK, bibliotecas y marcos"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"C++ v14.40 (17.10) MFC pour les outils de build v143 (ARM)","description":"Inclut des en-têtes et des bibliothèques pour le développement d’applications MFC, notamment le jeu de caractères multioctets (MBCS) ciblant ARM. Fin du support : janvier 2026.","category":"SDK, bibliothèques et frameworks"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Strumenti di compilazione C++ v14.40 (17.10) MFC per v143 (ARM)","description":"Include intestazioni e librerie per lo sviluppo di applicazioni MFC, incluso il set di caratteri multibyte (MBCS), destinate ad ARM. Fine del supporto: gennaio 2026.","category":"SDK, librerie e framework"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"v143 ビルド ツール (ARM) 用 C++ v14.40 (17.10) MFC","description":"ARM をターゲットにしたマルチ バイト文字セット (MBCS) を含む MFC アプリケーションの開発用ヘッダーとライブラリが含まれます。サポート終了: 2026 年 1 月。","category":"SDK、ライブラリ、およびフレームワーク"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"C++ v14.40(17.10) v143용 MFC 빌드 도구(ARM)","description":"ARM을 대상으로 하는 MBCS(멀티바이트 문자 집합)를 비롯하여 MFC 애플리케이션 개발을 위한 헤더와 라이브러리를 포함합니다. 지원 종료일: 2026년 1월.","category":"SDK, 라이브러리 및 프레임워크"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Klasy MFC języka C++ w wersji 14.40 (17.10) dla narzędzi kompilacji w wersji 143 (ARM)","description":"Zawiera nagłówki i biblioteki na potrzeby tworzenia aplikacji MFC, łącznie z wielobajtowym zestawem znaków (MBCS) przeznaczonym dla architektury ARM. Koniec wsparcia technicznego: Styczeń 2026 r.","category":"Zestawy SDK, biblioteki i struktury"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"C++ v14.40 (17.10) MFC para ferramentas de compilação v143 (ARM)","description":"Inclui cabeçalhos e bibliotecas para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos MFC, incluindo o Conjunto de Caracteres Multibyte (MBCS) direcionado ao ARM. Fim do suporte: janeiro de 2026.","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"MFC-библиотека C++ версии 14.40 (17.10) для средств сборки версии 143 (ARM)","description":"Включает заголовки и библиотеки для разработки приложений MFC, включая многобайтовую кодировку (MBCS) для целевой платформы ARM. Окончание поддержки: январь 2026 г.","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"v143 derleme araçları (ARM) için C++ v14.40 (17.10) MFC","description":"ARM'yi hedefleyen Çok Baytlı Karakter Kümesi (MBCS) dahil olmak üzere MFC uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik üst bilgileri ve kitaplıkları içerir. Destek sonu: Ocak 2026.","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.40.17.10.MFC.ARM.Spectre","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.40.17.10.ATL.ARM.Spectre":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.40.17.10.MFC.ARM.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.40.17.10.MFC.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.40.17.10.MFC.MBCS.ARM.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.40.17.10.MFC.Redist.ARM.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.40.17.10.MFC.Source":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC_-104079356":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Community"]},"Microsoft.VisualCpp.HTMLHelpWorkshop.Msi":"[4.0,5.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ v14.40 (17.10) MFC for v143 build tools with Spectre Mitigations (ARM)","description":"Includes headers and libraries with Spectre Mitigations for the development of MFC applications including the Multi-byte Character Set (MBCS) targeting ARM. End of support: Jan 2026.","category":"SDKs, libraries, and frameworks"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"带有 Spectre 缓解措施且适用于 v143 生成工具的 C++ v14.40 (17.10) MFC (ARM)","description":"包括用于开发 MFC 应用程序的带有 Spectre 缓解措施的标头和库，其中包括面向 ARM 的多字节字符集(MBCS)。终止支持: 2026 年 1 月。","category":"SDK、库和框架"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 v143 建置工具的 C++ v14.40 (17.10) MFC (Spectre 風險已降低) (ARM)","description":"包含具有 Spectre Mitigations 且用於開發 MFC 應用程式的標頭與程式庫，包含以 ARM 為目標的多位元組字元集 (MBCS)。終止支援: 2026 年 1 月。","category":"SDK、程式庫和架構"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"C++ v14.40 (17.10) MFC pro nástroje sestavení v143 se zmírněními hrozeb Spectre (ARM)","description":"Obsahuje hlavičky a knihovny se zmírněními hrozeb Spectre pro vývoj aplikací MFC, včetně vícebajtové znakové sady (MBCS) s cílením na ARM. Konec podpory: leden 2026.","category":"Sady SDK, knihovny a architektury"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++ v14.40 (17.10) MFC für v143-Buildtools mit Spectre-Entschärfungen (ARM)","description":"Umfasst Header und Bibliotheken mit Spectre-Entschärfungen für die Entwicklung von MFC-Anwendungen einschließlich Multibyte-Zeichensatz (MBCS) für ARM. Ende des Supports: Januar 2026.","category":"SDKs, Bibliotheken und Frameworks"},{"language":"es-es","title":"MFC de C++ v14.40 (17.10) para herramientas de compilación v143 con mitigaciones de Spectre (ARM)","description":"Incluye encabezados y bibliotecas con mitigaciones de Spectre para el desarrollo de aplicaciones MFC, incluido el juego de caracteres de varios bytes (MBCS) destinado a ARM. Fin del soporte técnico: enero de 2026.","category":"SDK, bibliotecas y marcos"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"C++ v14.40 (17.10) MFC pour les outils de génération v143 avec Atténuations Spectre (ARM)","description":"Inclut des en-têtes et des bibliothèques avec atténuations Spectre pour le développement d’applications MFC, notamment le jeu de caractères multioctets (MBCS) ciblant ARM. Fin du support : janvier 2026.","category":"SDK, bibliothèques et frameworks"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Strumenti di compilazione C++ v14.40 (17.10) MFC per v143 con mitigazioni Spectre (ARM)","description":"Include intestazioni e librerie con mitigazioni Spectre per lo sviluppo di applicazioni MFC, incluso il set di caratteri multibyte (MBCS), destinate ad ARM. Fine del supporto: gennaio 2026.","category":"SDK, librerie e framework"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Spectre 軽減策 (ARM) を備えた v143 ビルド ツール用の C++ v14.40 (17.10) MFC","description":"ARM をターゲットにしたマルチ バイト文字セット (MBCS) を含む MFC アプリケーションを開発するための、Spectre の軽減策を含むヘッダーとライブラリが含まれます。サポート終了: 2026 年 1 月。","category":"SDK、ライブラリ、およびフレームワーク"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"C++ v14.40(17.10) Spectre 완화 기능을 사용하는 v143 빌드 도구용 MFC(ARM)","description":"ARM을 대상으로 하는 MBCS(멀티바이트 문자 집합)를 비롯하여 MFC 애플리케이션 개발을 위해 Spectre 완화 기능을 사용하는 헤더와 라이브러리를 포함합니다. 지원 종료일: 2026년 1월.","category":"SDK, 라이브러리 및 프레임워크"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Klasy MFC języka C++ w wersji 14.40 (17.10) dla narzędzi kompilacji w wersji 143 z ograniczeniami ryzyka luki Spectre (ARM)","description":"Zawiera nagłówki i biblioteki z ograniczeniami ryzyka wystąpienia luki w zabezpieczeniach Spectre na potrzeby tworzenia aplikacji MFC, łącznie z wielobajtowym zestawem znaków (MBCS) przeznaczonym dla architektury ARM. Koniec wsparcia technicznego: Styczeń 2026 r.","category":"Zestawy SDK, biblioteki i struktury"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"C++ v14.40 (17.10) MFC para ferramentas de compilação v143 com Mitigações Spectre (ARM)","description":"Inclui cabeçalhos e bibliotecas com Mitigações do Spectre para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos MFC, incluindo o Conjunto de Caracteres Multibyte (MBCS) direcionado ao ARM. Fim do suporte: janeiro de 2026.","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"MFC C++ версии 14.40 (17.10) для средств сборки версии 143 с устранением рисков Spectre (ARM)","description":"Включает заголовки и библиотеки с устранением рисков Spectre для разработки приложений MFC, в том числе многобайтовую кодировку (MBCS) для целевой платформы ARM. Окончание поддержки: январь 2026 г.","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Spectre Risk Azaltmaları (ARM) içeren v143 derleme araçları için C++ v14.40 (17.10) MFC","description":"ARM'yi hedefleyen Çok Baytlı Karakter Kümesi (MBCS) dahil olmak üzere MFC uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik Spectre Risk Azaltmalarının bulunduğu üst bilgileri ve kitaplıkları içerir. Destek sonu: Ocak 2026.","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.40.17.10.MFC.ARM64","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.40.17.10.ATL.ARM64":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.40.17.10.MFC.ARM64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.40.17.10.MFC.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.40.17.10.MFC.MBCS.ARM64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.40.17.10.MFC.Redist.ARM64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.40.17.10.MFC.Source":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC_-104079356":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Community"]},"Microsoft.VisualCpp.HTMLHelpWorkshop.Msi":"[4.0,5.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ v14.40 (17.10) MFC for v143 build tools (ARM64)","description":"Includes headers and libraries for the development of MFC applications including the Multi-byte Character Set (MBCS) targeting ARM64. End of support: Jan 2026.","category":"SDKs, libraries, and frameworks"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"适用于 v143 生成工具的 C++ v14.40 (17.10) MFC (ARM64)","description":"用于开发 MFC 应用程序的标头和库，包括面向 ARM64 的多字节字符集(MBCS)。终止支持: 2026 年 1 月。","category":"SDK、库和框架"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 v143 建置工具的 C++ v14.40 (17.10) MFC (ARM64)","description":"包含用於開發 MFC 應用程式的標頭與程式庫，包含以 ARM64 為目標的多位元組字元集 (MBCS)。終止支援: 2026 年 1 月。","category":"SDK、程式庫和架構"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"C++ v14.40 (17.10) MFC pro nástroje sestavení v143 (ARM64)","description":"Obsahuje hlavičky a knihovny pro vývoj aplikací MFC, včetně vícebajtové 