eting ARM64. End of support: Nov 2024.","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"C++ v14.41 (17.11) MFC for v143 build tools (ARM64)(Out of Support)","description":"Includes headers and libraries for the development of MFC applications including the Multi-byte Character Set (MBCS) targeting ARM64. End of support: Nov 2024.","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.41.17.11.MFC.ARM64.Spectre","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"outOfSupport":true,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.41.17.11.ATL.ARM64.Spectre":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.41.17.11.MFC.ARM64.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.41.17.11.MFC.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.41.17.11.MFC.MBCS.ARM64.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.40.17.10.MFC.Redist.ARM64.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.41.17.11.MFC.Source":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC_-104079356":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Community"]},"Microsoft.VisualCpp.HTMLHelpWorkshop.Msi":"[4.0,5.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ v14.41 (17.11) MFC for v143 build tools with Spectre Mitigations (ARM64)(Out of Support)","description":"Includes headers and libraries with Spectre mitigations for the development of MFC applications including the Multi-byte Character Set (MBCS) targeting ARM64. End of support: Nov 2024.","category":"SDKs, libraries, and frameworks"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"带有 Spectre 缓解措施的适用于 v143 生成工具的 C++ v14.41 (17.11) MFC (ARM64) (不受支持)","description":"包括带有 Spectre 缓解措施的适用于开发 MFC 应用程序的标头和库，包括面向 ARM64 的多字节字符集(MBCS)。终止支持: 2024 年 11 月。","category":"SDK、库和框架"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"具有 Spectre Mitigations (ARM64) 且適用於 v143 組建工具的 C++ v14.41 (17.11) MFC (不再支援)","description":"包含用於開發 MFC 應用程式的標頭與程式庫及 Spectre 風險降低，包含以 ARM64 為目標的多位元組字元集 (MBCS)。終止支援：2024 年 11 月。","category":"SDK、程式庫和架構"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"MFC C++ v14.41 (17.11) pro nástroje sestavení v143 se zmírněními hrozeb Spectre (ARM64)(podpora skončila)","description":"Obsahuje hlavičky a knihovny se zmírněními hrozeb Spectre pro vývoj aplikací MFC, včetně vícebajtové znakové sady (MBCS) s cílením na ARM64. Konec podpory: listopad 2024.","category":"Sady SDK, knihovny a architektury"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++ v14.41 (17.11) MFC für v143-Buildtools mit Spectre-Entschärfungen (ARM64) (Nicht mehr unterstützt)","description":"Umfasst Header und Bibliotheken mit Spectre-Entschärfungen für die Entwicklung von MFC-Anwendungen einschließlich Multibyte-Zeichensatz (MBCS) für ARM64. Ende des Supports: November 2024.","category":"SDKs, Bibliotheken und Frameworks"},{"language":"es-es","title":"C++ v14.41 (17.11) MFC para herramientas de compilación v143 con mitigaciones de Spectre (ARM64) (sin soporte técnico)","description":"Incluye encabezados y bibliotecas con mitigaciones de Spectre para el desarrollo de aplicaciones MFC, incluido el juego de caracteres de varios bytes (MBCS) destinado a ARM64. Finalización del soporte: noviembre de 2024.","category":"SDK, bibliotecas y marcos"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"C++ v14.41 (17.11) MFC pour les outils de build v143 avec atténuations Spectre (ARM64) (sans prise en charge)","description":"Inclut des en-têtes et des bibliothèques avec atténuations Spectre pour le développement d’applications MFC, notamment le jeu de caractères multioctets (MBCS) ciblant ARM64. Fin du support : novembre 2024.","category":"SDK, bibliothèques et frameworks"},{"language":"it-it","title":"MFC C++ v14.41 (17.11) per gli strumenti di compilazione v143 con mitigazioni Spectre (ARM64) (Supporto non più disponibile)","description":"Include intestazioni e librerie con mitigazioni Spectre per lo sviluppo di applicazioni MFC, incluso il set di caratteri multibyte (MBCS), destinate ad ARM64. Fine del supporto: novembre 2024.","category":"SDK, librerie e framework"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"v143 ビルド ツール用 C++ v14.41 (17.11) MFC、Spectre 軽減策を装備 (ARM64) (サポート対象外)","description":"ARM64 をターゲットにしたマルチ バイト文字セット (MBCS) を含む MFC アプリケーションを開発するための、Spectre の軽減策を含むヘッダーとライブラリが含まれます。サポート終了: 2024 年 5 月。","category":"SDK、ライブラリ、およびフレームワーク"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Spectre 완화 기능이 포함된 v143 빌드 도구용 C++ v14.41(17.11) MFC(ARM64)(지원 중단)","description":"ARM64를 대상으로 하는 MBCS(멀티바이트 문자 집합)를 비롯하여 MFC 애플리케이션 개발을 위한 Spectre 완화 기능이 포함된 헤더와 라이브러리를 포함합니다. 지원 종료: 2024년 11월.","category":"SDK, 라이브러리 및 프레임워크"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Biblioteka MFC języka C++ w wersji 14.41 (wersja 17.11) dla narzędzi kompilacji w wersji 143 z ograniczeniami ryzyka wystąpienia luki w zabezpieczeniach Spectre (ARM64) (koniec wsparcia technicznego)","description":"Zawiera nagłówki i biblioteki z ograniczeniami ryzyka wystąpienia luki w zabezpieczeniach Spectre na potrzeby tworzenia aplikacji MFC, łącznie z wielobajtowym zestawem znaków (MBCS) przeznaczonym dla architektury ARM64. Koniec wsparcia technicznego: listopad 2024 r.","category":"Zestawy SDK, biblioteki i struktury"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"MFC do C++ v14.41 (17.11) para ferramentas de build v143 com Mitigações do Spectre (ARM64)(Sem Suporte)","description":"Inclui cabeçalhos e bibliotecas com mitigações do Spectre para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos de MFC, incluindo o Conjunto de Caracteres Multibyte (MBCS) direcionado ao ARM64. Fim do suporte: novembro de 2024.","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"C++ версии 14.41 (17.11) MFC для инструментов сборки версии 143 с Spectre Mitigations (ARM64) (поддержка прекращена)","description":"Включает заголовки и библиотеки с устранением рисков Spectre для разработки приложений MFC, включая многобайтовую кодировку (MBCS) для целевой платформы ARM64. Окончание поддержки: ноябрь 2024 г.","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Spectre Risk Azaltmaları içeren v143 derleme araçları için C++ v14.41 (17.11) MFC (ARM64)(Destek Dışı)","description":"ARM64'ü hedefleyen Çok Baytlı Karakter Kümesi (MBCS) dahil olmak üzere MFC uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik Spectre Azaltmalarının bulunduğu üst bilgileri ve kitaplıkları içerir. Destek sonu: Kasım 2024.","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.41.17.11.MFC.Spectre","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"outOfSupport":true,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.41.17.11.ATL.Spectre":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.41.17.11.MFC.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.41.17.11.MFC.MBCS.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.41.17.11.MFC.MBCS.x64.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.40.17.10.MFC.Redist.X64.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.40.17.10.MFC.Redist.X86.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.41.17.11.MFC.Source":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.41.17.11.MFC.x64.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.41.17.11.MFC.x86.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC_-104079356":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Community"]},"Microsoft.VisualCpp.HTMLHelpWorkshop.Msi":"[4.0,5.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ v14.41 (17.11) MFC for v143 build tools with Spectre Mitigations (x86 & x64)(Out of Support)","description":"Includes headers and libraries with Spectre Mitigations for the development of ATL and MFC applications including the Multi-byte Character Set (MBCS). End of support: Nov 2024.","category":"SDKs, libraries, and frameworks"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"带有 Spectre 缓解措施适用于 v143 生成工具的 C++ v14.41 (17.11) MFC (x86 和 x64)(不受支持)","description":"包括用于开发 ATL 和 MFC 应用程序的带有 Spectre 缓解措施的标头和库，其中包含多字节字符集(MBCS)。终止支持: 2024 年 11 月。","category":"SDK、库和框架"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 v143 建置工具且具有 Spectre 風險降低功能的 C++ v14.41 (17.11) MFC (x86 和 x64)(不再支援)","description":"包含用於開發含有多位元組字元集 (MBCS) 的 ATL 與 MFC 應用程式的標頭和 Spectre 風險降低程式庫。終止支援: 2024 年 11 月。","category":"SDK、程式庫和架構"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"MFC C++ v14.41 (17.11) pro nástroje sestavení v143 se zmírněními hrozeb Spectre (x86 a x64) (podpora skončila)","description":"Obsahuje hlavičky a knihovny se zmírněními hrozeb Spectre pro vývoj aplikací ATL a MFC, včetně vícebajtové znakové sady (MBCS). Konec podpory: listopad 2024.","category":"Sady SDK, knihovny a architektury"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++ v14.41 (17.11) MFC für v143-Buildtools mit Spectre-Entschärfungen (x86 und x64) (Nicht mehr unterstützt)","description":"Umfasst Header und Bibliotheken mit Spectre-Entschärfungen für die Entwicklung von ATL- und MFC-Anwendungen einschließlich Multibyte-Zeichensatz (MBCS). Ende des Supports: November 2024.","category":"SDKs, Bibliotheken und Frameworks"},{"language":"es-es","title":"C++ v14.41 (17.11) MFC para herramientas de compilación v143 con mitigaciones de Spectre (x86 y x64) (sin soporte técnico)","description":"Incluye encabezados y bibliotecas con mitigaciones de Spectre para el desarrollo de aplicaciones ATL y MFC, incluido el juego de caracteres de varios bytes (MBCS). Finalización del soporte: noviembre de 2024.","category":"SDK, bibliotecas y marcos"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"C++ v14.41 (17.11) MFC pour les outils de build v143 avec atténuations de Spectre (x86 et x64) (hors support)","description":"Inclut des en-têtes et des bibliothèques avec atténuations Spectre pour le développement d’applications ATL et MFC, notamment le jeu de caractères multioctets (MBCS). Fin du support : novembre 2024.","category":"SDK, bibliothèques et frameworks"},{"language":"it-it","title":"MFC C++ v14.41 (17.11) per gli strumenti di compilazione v143 con mitigazioni Spectre (x86 e x64) (supporto non più disponibile)","description":"Include intestazioni e librerie con mitigazioni Spectre per lo sviluppo di applicazioni ATL e MFC, incluso il set di caratteri multibyte (MBCS). Fine del supporto: novembre 2024.","category":"SDK, librerie e framework"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Spectre 軽減策を備えた v143 ビルド ツール (x86 および x64) 用の C++ v14.41 (17.11) MFC (サポート対象外)","description":"マルチ バイト文字セット (MBCS) を含む ATL および MFC アプリケーションを開発するための、Spectre の軽減策を含むヘッダーとライブラリが含まれます。サポート終了: 2024 年 11 月。","category":"SDK、ライブラリ、およびフレームワーク"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Spectre 완화 기능이 포함된 v143 빌드 도구용 C++ v14.41(17.11) MFC(x86 및 x64)(지원 중단)","description":"MBCS(멀티바이트 문자 집합)를 비롯하여 ATL 및 MFC 애플리케이션 개발을 위한 Spectre 완화 기능이 포함된 헤더와 라이브러리를 포함합니다. 지원 종료: 2024년 11월.","category":"SDK, 라이브러리 및 프레임워크"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Biblioteka MFC języka C++ w wersji 14.41 (wersja 17.11) dla narzędzi kompilacji w wersji 143 z ograniczeniami ryzyka wystąpienia luki w zabezpieczeniach Spectre (x86 i x64) (koniec wsparcia technicznego)","description":"Zawiera nagłówki i biblioteki z ograniczeniami ryzyka wystąpienia luki w zabezpieczeniach Spectre na potrzeby tworzenia aplikacji ATL i MFC, łącznie z wielobajtowym zestawem znaków (MBCS). Koniec wsparcia technicznego: listopad 2024 r.","category":"Zestawy SDK, biblioteki i struktury"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"C++ v14.41 (17.11) MFC para ferramentas de build v143 com Mitigações de Spectre (x86 e x64)(Sem suporte)","description":"Inclui cabeçalhos e bibliotecas com Mitigações do Spectre para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos de ATL e MFC, incluindo o Conjunto de Caracteres Multibyte (MBCS). Fim do suporte: novembro de 2024.","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"MFC-библиотека C++ версии 14.41 (17.11) для средств сборки версии 143 с устранением рисков Spectre (x86 и x64) (поддержка прекращена)","description":"Включает заголовки и библиотеки с устранением рисков Spectre для разработки приложений ATL и MFC, включая многобайтовую кодировку (MBCS). Окончание поддержки: ноябрь 2024 г.","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Spectre Risk Azaltmaları içeren v143 derleme araçları için C++ v14.41 (17.11) MFC (x86 ve x64)(Destek Dışı)","description":"Çok Baytlı Karakter Kümesi (MBCS) dahil olmak üzere ATL ve MFC uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik Spectre Risk Azaltmalarının bulunduğu üst bilgileri ve kitaplıkları içerir. Destek sonu: Kasım 2024.","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.41.17.11.x86.x64","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"outOfSupport":true,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.MSBuild.v170.x64.v143":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.MSBuild.v170.x86.v143":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VS.VC.vcvars.X64.Shortcuts":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VS.VC.vcvars.X86.Shortcuts":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.vcvars":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.Redist.14.Latest":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.Redist.14":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.RuntimeDebug.14":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.CRT.ClickOnce.Msi":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.CRT.Redist.Resources":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.DIA.SDK":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.41.17.11.ASAN.X86":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.41.17.11.CA.Ext.HostX64.TargetX86":{"version":"[14.0,18.0)","chip":"x64"},"Microsoft.VC.14.41.17.11.CA.Ext.HostX64.TargetX64":{"version":"[14.0,18.0)","chip":"x64"},"Microsoft.VC.14.41.17.11.CA.Ext.HostX86.Targetx86":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.41.17.11.CA.Ext.HostX86.Targetx64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.41.17.11.CA.Ext.HostARM64.Targetx86":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.41.17.11.CA.Ext.HostARM64.Targetx64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.41.17.11.CRT.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.40.17.10.CRT.Redist.X64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.40.17.10.CRT.Redist.X64.OneCore.Desktop":"[14.0,18.0