ími hrozeb Spectre (ARM64)","description":"Obsahuje hlavičky a knihovny se zmírněními hrozeb Spectre pro vývoj aplikací MFC, včetně vícebajtové znakové sady (MBCS) s cílením na ARM64.","category":"Sady SDK, knihovny a architektury"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++ v14.42 (17.12) MFC für v143-Buildtools mit Spectre-Entschärfungen (ARM64)","description":"Umfasst Header und Bibliotheken mit Spectre-Entschärfungen für die Entwicklung von MFC-Anwendungen einschließlich Multibyte-Zeichensatz (MBCS) für ARM64.","category":"SDKs, Bibliotheken und Frameworks"},{"language":"es-es","title":"C++ v14.42 (17.12) MFC para herramientas de compilación v143 con mitigación de Spectre (ARM64)","description":"Incluye encabezados y bibliotecas con mitigaciones de Spectre para el desarrollo de aplicaciones MFC, incluido el juego de caracteres multibyte (MBCS) destinado a ARM64.","category":"SDK, bibliotecas y marcos"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"C++ v14.42 (17.12) MFC pour les outils de construction v143 avec Spectre Mitigations (ARM64)","description":"Inclut des en-têtes et des bibliothèques avec atténuations Spectre pour le développement d'applications MFC, notamment le jeu de caractères multioctets (MBCS) ciblant ARM64.","category":"SDK, bibliothèques et frameworks"},{"language":"it-it","title":"MFC C++ v14.42 (17.12) per strumenti di compilazione v143 con mitigazioni Spectre (ARM64)","description":"Include intestazioni e librerie con mitigazioni Spectre per lo sviluppo di applicazioni MFC, incluso il set di caratteri multibyte (MBCS), destinate ad ARM64.","category":"SDK, librerie e framework"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Spectre 軽減策を備えた v143 ビルド ツール用の C++ v14.42 (17.12) MFC (ARM64)","description":"ARM64 をターゲットにしたマルチ バイト文字セット (MBCS) を含む MFC アプリケーションを開発するための、Spectre の軽減策を含むヘッダーとライブラリが含まれます。","category":"SDK、ライブラリ、およびフレームワーク"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"C++ v14.42 (17.12) Spectre 완화 기능(ARM64)이 포함된 v143 빌드 도구용 MFC","description":"ARM64를 대상으로 하는 MBCS(멀티바이트 문자 집합)를 비롯하여 MFC 애플리케이션 개발에 대해 Spectre 완화를 사용하는 헤더와 라이브러리를 포함합니다.","category":"SDK, 라이브러리 및 프레임워크"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Biblioteka MFC języka C++ w wersji 14.42 (17.12) dla narzędzi kompilacji w wersji 143 z ograniczeniami ryzyka Spectre (ARM64)","description":"Zawiera nagłówki i biblioteki ze środkami zaradczymi dla luki Spectre na potrzeby programowania aplikacji MFC, łącznie z wielobajtowym zestawem znaków (MBCS) przeznaczonym dla architektury ARM64.","category":"Zestawy SDK, biblioteki i struktury"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"C++ v14.42 (17.12) MFC para ferramentas de build v143 com mitigação do Spectre (ARM64)","description":"Inclui cabeçalhos e bibliotecas com Mitigações do Spectre para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos MFC, incluindo o Conjunto de Caracteres Multibyte (MBCS) com direcionamento a ARM64.","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"MFC-библиотека C++ версии 14.42 (17.12) для средств сборки версии 143 с устранением рисков Spectre (ARM64)","description":"Включает заголовки и библиотеки с устранением рисков Spectre для разработки приложений MFC, включая многобайтовую кодировку (MBCS) для целевой платформы ARM64.","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Spectre Risk Azaltma içeren v143 derleme araçları için C++ v14.42 (17.12) MFC (ARM64)","description":"ARM64'ü hedefleyen Çok Baytlı Karakter Kümesi (MBCS) dahil olmak üzere MFC uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik Spectre Azaltmalarının bulunduğu üst bilgileri ve kitaplıkları içerir.","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.42.17.12.MFC.Spectre","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.14.42.17.12.ATL.Spectre":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.42.17.12.MFC.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.42.17.12.MFC.MBCS.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.42.17.12.MFC.MBCS.x64.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Mi