u.","category":"Compilateurs, outils de génération et runtime"},{"language":"it-it","title":"MSVC v140 - VS 2015 C++ Build Tools (v14.00)","description":"Compilatori e librerie C++ di Visual Studio 2015 per lo sviluppo di applicazioni desktop.","category":"Compilatori, strumenti di compilazione e runtime"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"MSVC v140 - VS 2015 C++ ビルド ツール (v14.00)","description":"デスクトップ開発用の Visual Studio 2015 C++ コンパイラとライブラリ。","category":"コンパイラ、ビルド ツール、およびランタイム"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"MSVC v140 - VS 2015 C++ 빌드 도구(v14.00)","description":"데스크톱 개발을 위한 Visual Studio 2015 C++ 컴파일러 및 라이브러리입니다.","category":"컴파일러, 빌드 도구 및 런타임"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"MSVC wersja 140 — VS 2015 — narzędzia kompilacji środowiska C++ (wersja 14.00)","description":"Kompilatory i biblioteki języka Visual Studio 2015 C++ służące do tworzenia aplikacji klasycznych.","category":"Kompilatory, narzędzia do kompilacji i środowiska uruchomieniowe"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"MSVC v140 – ferramentas de build do C++ para VS 2015 (v14.00)","description":"Compiladores e bibliotecas do Visual Studio 2015 C++ para desenvolvimento para área de trabalho.","category":"Compiladores, ferramentas de build e tempos de execução"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"MSVC версии 140 — средства сборки C++ VS 2015 (версия 14.00)","description":"Компиляторы и библиотеки Visual Studio 2015 C++ для разработки классических приложений.","category":"Компиляторы, средства сборки и среды выполнения"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"MSVC v140 - VS 2015 C++ derleme araçları (v14.00)","description":"Masaüstü geliştirme için Visual Studio 2015 C++ derleyicileri ve kitaplıkları.","category":"Derleyiciler, derleme araçları ve çalışma zamanları"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.ASAN","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualCpp.ASAN.X86":"[14.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ AddressSanitizer","description":"AddressSanitizer (ASAN) is a tool for detecting memory errors in C/C++ code. ASAN uses instrumentation to check memory accesses and report any memory safety issues.","category":"Debugging and testing"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"C++ AddressSanitizer","description":"AddressSanitizer (ASAN) 是用于检测 C/C++ 代码中内存错误的工具。ASAN 使用检测来检查内存访问，并报告任何内存安全问题。","category":"调试和测试"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"C++ AddressSanitizer","description":"AddressSanitizer (ASAN) 是用於偵測 C/C++ 程式碼中記憶體錯誤的工具。ASAN 使用檢測設備來檢查記憶體的存取，並會回報所有記憶體安全問題。","category":"偵錯和測試"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"AddressSanitizer pro C++","description":"AddressSanitizer (ASAN) je nástroj pro zjišťování chyb paměti v kódu C/C++. ASAN používá instrumentaci ke kontrole přístupů do paměti a nahlásí jakékoliv problémy s bezpečností paměti.","category":"Ladění a testování"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++ AddressSanitizer","description":"AddressSanitizer (ASAN) ist ein Tool zum Erkennen von Speicherfehlern in C/C++-Code. ASAN nutzt die Instrumentierung, um Speicherzugriffe zu überprüfen und Probleme in Bezug auf die Speichersicherheit zu melden.","category":"Debuggen und Testen"},{"language":"es-es","title":"AddressSanitizer para C++","description":"AddressSanitizer (ASAN) es una herramienta para detectar errores de memoria en el código de C/C++. ASAN usa la instrumentación para comprobar los accesos a la memoria e informar de cualquier problema de seguridad de esta.","category":"Depuración y pruebas"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"AddressSanitizer C++","description":"ASan (AddressSanitizer) est un outil de détection des erreurs de mémoire dans du code C/C++. ASan utilise l'instrumentation pour vérifier les accès à la mémoire et signaler les problèmes de sécurité de la mémoire.","category":"Débogage et tests"},{"language":"it-it","title":"C++ AddressSanitizer","description":"AddressSanitizer (ASan) è uno strumento per il rilevamento degli errori di memoria nel codice C/C++. ASan usa la strumentazione per verificare gli accessi alla memoria e segnala eventuali problemi di sicurezza della memoria.","category":"Debug e test"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"C++ AddressSanitizer","description":"AddressSanitizer (ASAN) は、C/C++ コードでメモリ エラーを検出するためのツールです。ASAN によって、インストルメンテーションを使用してメモリへのアクセスをチェックし、メモリの安全性に関する問題を報告します。","category":"デバッグとテスト"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"C++ AddressSanitizer","description":"ASAN(AddressSanitizer)은 C/C++ 코드에서 메모리 오류를 탐지하는 도구입니다. ASAN은 계측을 사용하여 메모리 액세스를 검사하고 메모리 안전 문제를 보고합니다.","category":"디버깅 및 테스트"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"C++ AddressSanitizer","description":"AddressSanitizer (ASAN) to narzędzie służące do wykrywania błędów pamięci w kodzie języka C/C++. Narzędzie ASAN wykorzystuje instrumentację do sprawdzania dostępu do pamięci i zgłaszania problemów z bezpieczeństwem pamięci.","category":"Debugowanie i testowanie"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"AddressSanitizer do C++","description":"O ASAN (AddressSanitizer) é uma ferramenta para detectar erros de memória no código C/C++. O ASAN usa instrumentação para verificar os acessos de memória e relatar qualquer problema de segurança de memória.","category":"Depuração e testes"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"C++ AddressSanitizer","description":"AddressSanitizer (ASAN) — это средство для обнаружения ошибок памяти в коде C/C++. ASAN использует инструментирование для проверки доступа к памяти и для оповещения о любых проблемах безопасности памяти.","category":"Отладка и тестирование"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"C++ AddressSanitizer","description":"AddressSanitizer (ASAN), C/C++ kodundaki bellek hatalarını algılamaya yönelik bir araçtır. ASAN, bellek erişimlerini denetlemek ve bellek güvenliği sorunlarını bildirmek için izleme kullanır.","category":"Hata ayıklama ve test"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.ATL","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualCpp.ATL.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.ATL.Source":"[1