ith Spectre Mitigations (x86 & x64)","description":"Includes headers and libraries with Spectre Mitigations for the development of ATL and MFC applications including the Multi-byte Character Set (MBCS).","category":"SDKs, libraries, and frameworks"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"带有 Spectre 缓解措施、适用于最新 v143 生成工具的 C++ MFC (x86 和 x64)","description":"包括带有 Spectre 缓解措施的标头和库，它们用于开发多字节字符集(MBCS)等 ATL 和 MFC 应用程序。","category":"SDK、库和框架"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於最新 v143 建置工具且具有 Spectre 風險降低功能的 C++ MFC (x86 & x64)","description":"包含用於開發 ATL 與 MFC 應用程式的標頭與程式庫及 Spectre 風險降低，包含多位元組字元集 (MBCS)。","category":"SDK、程式庫和架構"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"C++ MFC pro nejnovější nástroje pro sestavování v143 se zmírněními hrozby Spectre (x86 a x64)","description":"Obsahuje hlavičky a knihovny se zmírněními hrozeb Spectre pro vývoj aplikací ATL a MFC, včetně vícebajtové znakové sady (MBCS).","category":"Sady SDK, knihovny a architektury"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++-MFC für die neuesten v143-Buildtools mit Spectre-Entschärfungen (x86 & x64)","description":"Umfasst Header und Bibliotheken mit Spectre-Entschärfungen für die Entwicklung von ATL- und MFC-Anwendungen einschließlich Multibyte-Zeichensatz (MBCS).","category":"SDKs, Bibliotheken und Frameworks"},{"language":"es-es","title":"MFC de C++ para las herramientas de compilación v143 más recientes con migraciones de Spectre (x86 y x64)","description":"Incluye encabezados y bibliotecas con mitigaciones de Spectre para el desarrollo de aplicaciones ATL y MFC, incluido el juego de caracteres multibyte (MBCS).","category":"SDK, bibliotecas y marcos"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"C++ MFC pour dernière version de Build Tools v143 avec atténuations de spectre (x86 et x64)","description":"Inclut des en-têtes et des bibliothèques avec atténuations Spectre pour le développement d'applications ATL et MFC, notamment le jeu de caractères multioctets (MBCS).","category":"SDK, bibliothèques et frameworks"},{"language":"it-it","title":"MFC C++ per la versione più recente di Build Tools v143 con mitigazioni Spectre (x86 e x64)","description":"Include intestazioni e librerie con mitigazioni Spectre per lo sviluppo di applicazioni ATL e MFC, incluso il set di caratteri multibyte (MBCS).","category":"SDK, librerie e framework"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Spectre の軽減策を含む、最新の v143 ビルド ツール用 C++ MFC (x86 および x64)","description":"マルチ バイト文字セット (MBCS) を含む ATL および MFC アプリケーションを開発するための、Spectre の軽減策を含むヘッダーとライブラリが含まれます。","category":"SDK、ライブラリ、およびフレームワーク"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"스펙터 완화를 지원하는 최신 v143 빌드 도구용 C++ MFC(x86 및 x64)","description":"MBCS(멀티바이트 문자 집합)를 비롯하여 ATL 및 MFC 애플리케이션 개발에 대해 스펙터 완화를 사용하는 헤더와 라이브러리를 포함합니다.","category":"SDK, 라이브러리 및 프레임워크"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"C++ MFC dla najnowszych narzędzi kompilacji w wersji 143 z krokami zaradczymi dla luki Spectre (x86 i x64)","description":"Zawiera nagłówki i biblioteki z krokami zaradczymi dla luki Spectre do opracowywania aplikacji ATL i MFC, łącznie z wielobajtowym zestawem znaków (MBCS).","category":"Zestawy SDK, biblioteki i struktury"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"C++ MFC para as ferramentas de compilação v143 mais recentes com atenuações de espectros (x86 e x64)","description":"Inclui cabeçalhos e bibliotecas com Mitigações de Espectro para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos ATL e MFC, incluindo o Conjunto de Caracteres Multibyte (MBCS).","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"MFC-библиотека C++ для новейшей версии Build Tools v143 с устранением рисков Spectre (x86 и x64)","description":"Включает заголовки и библиотеки с устранением рисков Spectre для разработки приложений ATL и MFC, включая многобайтовую кодировку (MBCS).","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Spectre Risk Azaltma içeren en yeni v143 derleme araçları için C++ MFC (x86 ve x64)","description":"Çok Baytlı Karakter Kümesi (MBCS) dahil olmak üzere ATL ve MFC uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik Spectre Azaltmalarının bulunduğu üst bilgileri ve kitaplıkları içerir.","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.CLI.Support","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.Net.Component.4.8.SDK":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Net.Component.4.7.2.TargetingPack":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Templates.CLR_-2066987101":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Templates.CLR","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.CommunityX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.EnterpriseX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.ProfessionalX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Community","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional"]},"Microsoft.VisualCpp.CLI.ARM":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.CLI.ARM64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.CLI.Source":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.CLI.X64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.CLI.X86":"[14.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++/CLI support for v143 build tools (Latest)","description":"Required tools and frameworks for code editing and debugging C++/CLI applications using the .NET framework.","category":"Compilers, build tools, and runtimes"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"对 v143 生成工具(最新)的 C++/CLI 支持","description":"使用 .NET 框架对 C++/CLI 应用程序进行代码编辑和调试所需的工具和框架。","category":"编译器、生成工具和运行时"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 v143 建置工具的 C++/CLI 支援 (最新)","description":"使用 .NET Framework 進行 C++/CLI 應用程式程式碼編輯與偵錯的必要工具與架構。","category":"編譯器、建置工具和執行階段"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Podpora C++/CLI pro nástroje pro sestavování v143 (nejnovější)","description":"Požadované nástroje a rozhraní pro úpravy kódu a ladění aplikací C++/CLI pomocí rozhraní .NET Framework","category":"Kompilátory, nástroje pro sestavování buildů a moduly runtime"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++-/CLI-Unterstützung für v143-Buildtools (neueste)","description":"Erforderliche Tools und Frameworks für die Codebearbeitung und das Debuggen von C++-/CLI-Anwendungen mithilfe von .NET Framework.","category":"Compiler, Buildtools und Runtimes"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Compatibilidad con C++/CLI para las herramientas de compilación de v143 (más recientes)","description":"Herramientas y marcos de trabajo necesarios para la edición y depuración de código de aplicaciones C++/CLI con .NET Framework.","category":"Compiladores, herramientas de compilación y entornos de ejecución"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Prise en charge de C++/CLI pour Build Tools v143 (dernière version)","description":"Outils et frameworks nécessaires pour modifier le code et déboguer les applications C++/CLI à l'aide du .NET Framework.","category":"Compilateurs, outils de génération et runtime"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Supporto C++/CLI per Build Tools v143 (più recente)","description":"Strumenti e framework necessari per la modifica del codice e il debug di applicazioni C++/CLI con .NET Framework.","category":"Compilatori, strumenti di compilazione e runtime"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"v143 ビルド ツール用 C++/CLI サポート (最新)","description":".NET Framework を使用して C++/CLI アプリケーションのコード編集やデバッグを行うために必要なツールとフレームワーク。","category":"コンパイラ、ビルド ツール、およびランタイム"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"v143 빌드 도구에 대한 C++/CLI 지원(최신)","description":".NET Framework를 사용한 C++/CLI 애플리케이션 디버깅 및 코드 편집을 위해 필요한 도구 및 프레임워크입니다.","category":"컴파일러, 빌드 도구 및 런타임"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Obsługa C++/CLI dla narzędzi kompilacji w wersji 143 (najnowsza wersja)","description":"Wymagane narzędzia i platformy na potrzeby edytowania kodu i debugowania aplikacji C++/CLI przy użyciu platformy .NET Framework.","category":"Kompilatory, narzędzia do kompilacji i środowiska uruchomieniowe"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Suporte do C++/CLI para ferramentas do build v143 (Mais recente)","description":"As ferramentas e as estruturas necessárias para depurar e editar o código de aplicativos C++/CLI usando o .NET Framework.","category":"Compiladores, ferramentas de build e tempos de execução"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Поддержка C++/CLI для Build Tools v143 (последняя версия)","description":"Необходимые инструменты и платформы для редактирования кода и отладки приложений на C++ и консольных приложений, использующих платформу .NET Framework.","category":"Компиляторы, средства сборки и среды выполнения"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"v143 derleme araçları (En Yeni) için C++/CLI desteği","description":".NET Framework kullanarak C++/CLI uygulamalarında kod düzenleme ve hata ayıklama işlemleri yapmak için gereken araçlar ve çerçeveler.","category":"Derleyiciler, derleme araçları ve çalışma zamanları"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.CMake.Project","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.ExternalBuildFramework":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.CMake.Project_-2066987101":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.CMake.Project","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.CommunityX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.EnterpriseX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.ProfessionalX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Community","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional"]},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.CMake":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.Tools.x86.x64":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.WebToolsExtensions.CMake_-2066987101":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.WebToolsExtensions.CMake","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.CommunityX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.EnterpriseX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.ProfessionalX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Community","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional"]},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.VC.CoreIDE.Reduced_-2066987101":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.VC.CoreID