e":"Recursos principais do C++","description":"Recurso IDE principal necessário para suporte ao Visual C++.","category":"Atividades de desenvolvimento"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Основные компоненты C++","description":"Для поддержки Visual C++ необходим основной компонент IDE.","category":"Действия разработки"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"C++ temel özellikler","description":"Visual C++ desteği için gereken temel IDE özelliği.","category":"Geliştirme etkinlikleri"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.DiagnosticTools","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.PackageGroup.DiagnosticsHub.Platform":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.DiagnosticsHub.CpuSampling":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.DiagnosticsHub.Instrumentation":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.DiagnosticsHub.UserMarks":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Icecap.Collection.Msi":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Icecap.Analysis":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.TestTools.TeamFoundationClient":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.Graphics.Tools":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.Debugger.Core":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.CoreIDE_-845988912":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.CoreIDE","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.EnterpriseX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.ProfessionalX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.CommunityX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Community","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.BuildTools"]},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.Tools.x86.x64_-845988912":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.Tools.x86.x64","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.EnterpriseX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.ProfessionalX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.CommunityX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Community","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.BuildTools"]},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.Community":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.PackageGroup.ClientDiagnostics":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ profiling tools","description":"Performance profiler and debugger-integrated diagnostic tools for C++. Includes CPU Usage, Memory Usage, GPU profiler, and the Graphics Debugger.","category":"Debugging and testing","keywords":["profiling","profiler","diagnostic tools","diagnostics","memory","CPU","performance","graphics","debugging"]},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"C++ 分析工具","description":"适用于 C++ 的性能探查器和集成调试程序的诊断工具。包含 CPU 使用情况、内存使用情况、GPU 探查器以及图形调试器。","category":"调试和测试","keywords":["分析","探查器","诊断工具","诊断","内存","CPU","性能","图形","正在调试"]},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"C++ 分析工具","description":"整合了效能分析工具與偵錯工具的 C++ 診斷工具。包括 CPU 使用率、記憶體使用量、GPU 分析工具及圖形偵錯工具。","category":"偵錯和測試","keywords":["profiling","profiler","診斷工具","diagnostics","memory","CPU","效能","graphics","debugging"]},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Nástroje pro profilaci v C++","description":"Profiler výkonu a diagnostické nástroje integrované v ladicím programu pro C++. Zahrnuje Využití CPU, Využití paměti, profiler GPU a ladicí program grafiky.","category":"Ladění a testování","keywords":["profilace","profiler","diagnostické nástroje","diagnostika","paměť","Procesor","výkon","grafika","ladění"]},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++-Profilerstellungstools","description":"Leistungs-Profiler und in den Debugger integrierte Diagnosetools für C++. Umfasst CPU-Auslastung, Speicherauslastung, GPU-Profilerstellung und den Grafikdebugger.","category":"Debuggen und Testen","keywords":["Profilerstellung","Profiler","Diagnosetools","Diagnose","Arbeitsspeicher","CPU","Leistung","Grafiken","Debuggen"]},{"language":"es-es","title":"Herramientas de generación de perfiles de C++","description":"Generador de perfiles de rendimiento y herramientas de diagnóstico con depurador integrado para C++. Incluyen el uso de la CPU, el uso de memoria, el generador de perfiles GPU y el depurador de gráficos.","category":"Depuración y pruebas","keywords":["generación de perfiles","generador de perfiles","herramientas de diagnóstico","diagnósticos","memoria","CPU","rendimiento","gráficos","depuración"]},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Outils de profilage C++","description":"Profileur de performances et outils de diagnostic intégrés au débogueur pour C++. Inclut des outils pour l'utilisation de l'UC, l'utilisation de la mémoire, le profileur GPU, ainsi que le débogueur graphique.","category":"Débogage et tests","keywords":["profilage","profileur","outils de diagnostic","diagnostics","mémoire","UC","performances","graphismes","débogage"]},{"language":"it-it","title":"Strumenti di profilatura C++","description":"Profiler prestazioni e strumenti di diagnostica integrati nel debugger per C++. Include Utilizzo CPU, Utilizzo memoria, profiler GPU e Debugger grafica.","category":"Debug e test","keywords":["profilatura","profiler","strumenti di diagnostica","diagnostica","memoria","CPU","prestazioni","grafica","debug"]},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"C++ のプロファイル ツール","description":"C++ のためのパフォーマンス プロファイラーおよびデバッガーの統合診断ツール。CPU 使用率、メモリ使用量、GPU プロファイラーおよびグラフィックス デバッガーが含まれます。","category":"デバッグとテスト","keywords":["プロファイル","プロファイラー","診断ツール","診断","メモリ","CPU","パフォーマンス","グラフィックス","デバッグ"]},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"C++ 프로파일링 도구","description":"C++용 성능 프로파일러 및 디버거 통합 진단 도구입니다. CPU 사용량, 메모리 사용량, GPU 프로파일러 및 그래픽 디버거를 포함합니다.","category":"디버깅 및 테스트","keywords":["프로파일링","프로파일러","진단 도구","진단","메모리","CPU","성능","그래픽","디버깅"]},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Narzędzia profilowania dla języka C++","description":"Profiler wydajności i narzędzia diagnostyczne zintegrowane z debugerem dla języka C++. Obejmuje informacje o użyciu procesora i pamięci oraz profilera procesora graficznego wraz z debugerem grafiki.","category":"Debugowanie i testowanie","keywords":["profilowanie","profiler","narzędzia diagnostyczne","diagnostyka","pamięć","CPU","wydajność","grafika","debugowanie"]},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Ferramentas de criação de perfil do C++","description":"Criador de perfil de desempenho e ferramentas de diagnóstico integradas ao depurador para C++. Inclui o uso de CPU, Uso de Memória, criador de perfil de GPU e o Depurador de Gráficos.","category":"Depuração e testes","keywords":["criação de perfil","criador de perfil","ferramentas de diagnóstico","diagnóstico","memória","CPU","desempenho","gráficos","depuração"]},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Средства профилирования C++","description":"Профилировщик производительности и интегрированные в отладчик средства диагностики для C++. Включает загрузку ЦП, использование памяти, профилировщик GPU и отладчик графики.","category":"Отладка и тестирование","keywords":["профилирование","профилировщик","средства диагностики","диагностика","память","ЦП","производительность","графика","отладка"]},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"C++ profil oluşturma araçları","description":"C++ için performans profili oluşturucu ve hata ayıklayıcıyla tümleştirilmiş tanılama araçları. CPU Kullanımı, Bellek Kullanımı, GPU profil oluşturucu ve Grafik Hata Ayıklayıcı araçlarını içerir.","category":"Hata ayıklama ve test","keywords":["profil oluşturma","profil oluşturucu","tanılama araçları","tanılama","bellek","CPU","performans","grafikler","hata ayıklama"]}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.Llvm.Clang","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Llvm.Clang":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ Clang Compiler for Windows (19.1.1)","description":"Clang/LLVM tools providing support for compiling and linking C/C++.","category":"Compilers, build tools, and runtimes"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"适用于 Windows 的 C++ Clang 编译器(19.1.1)","description":"支持编译和链接 C/C++ 的 Clang/LLVM 工具。","category":"编译器、生成工具和运行时"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 Windows 的 C++ Clang 編譯器 (19.1.1)","description":"提供 C/C++ 編譯與連結支援的 Clang/LLVM 工具。","category":"編譯器、建置工具和執行階段"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Kompilátor C++ Clang pro Windows (19.1.1)","description":"Nástroje Clang/LLVM, které poskytují podporu pro kompilaci a propojování C/C++","category":"Kompilátory, nástroje pro sestavování buildů a moduly runtime"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++-Clang-Compiler für Windows (19.1.1)","description":"Clang-/LLVM-Tools, die Unterstützung für die Kompilierung und Verknüpfung von C/C++ bereitstellen.","category":"Compiler, Buildtools und Runtimes"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Compilador Clang de C++ para Windows (19.1.1)","description":"Herramientas de Clang/LLVM que proporcionan compatibilidad para compilar y vincular C/C++.","category":"Compiladores, herramientas de compilación y entornos de ejecución"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Compilateur C++ Clang pour Windows (19.1.1)","description":"Outils Clang/LLVM prenant en charge la compilation et l'édition des liens C/C++.","category":"Compilateurs, outils de génération et runtime"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Compilatore Clang C++ per Windows (19.1.1)","description":"Strumenti Clang/LLVM che forniscono il supporto per la compilazione e il collegamento di C/C++.","category":"Compilatori, strumenti di compilazione e runtime"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Windows 用 C++ Clang コンパイラ (19.1.1)","description":"C/C++ のコンパイルとリンクのサポートを提供する Clang/LLVM ツール。","category":"コンパイラ、ビルド ツール、およびランタイム"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Windows용 C++ Clang 컴파일러(19.1.1)","description":"C/C++ 컴파일 및 링크 지원을 제공하는 Clang/LLVM 도구입니다.","category":"컴파일러, 빌드 도구 및 런타임"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Kompilator C++ Clang dla systemu Windows (19.1.1)","description":"Narzędzia Clang/LLVM zapewniające obsługę kompilowania i konsolidowania kodu C/C++.","category":"Kompilatory, narzędzia do kompilacji i środowiska uruchomieniowe"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Compilador C++ Clang para Windows (19.1.1)","description":"As ferramentas do Clang/LLVM dão suporte para compilar e vincular C/C++.","category":"Compiladores, ferramentas de build e tempos de execução"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Компилятор C++ Clang для Windows (19.1.1)","description":"Инструменты Clang/LLVM, обеспечивающие поддержку компиляции и связывания C/C++.","category":"Компиляторы, средства сборки и среды выполнения"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Windows için C++ Clang Derleyicisi (19.1.1)","description":"C/C++ derleme ve bağlama desteği sağlayan Clang/LLVM araçları.","category":"Derleyiciler, derleme araçları ve çalışma zamanları"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.Llvm.ClangToolset","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.MSBuild.Llvm":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"MSBuild support for LLVM (clang-cl) toolset","description":"Platform toolset providing MSBuild project system support for Clang/LLVM.","category":"Compilers, build tools, and runtimes"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"对 LLVM (clang-cl) 工具集的 MSBuild 支持","description":"提供对 Clang/LLVM 的 MSBuild 项目系统支持的平台工具集。","category":"编译器、生成工具和运行时"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 LLVM (clang-cl) 工具組的 MSBuild 支援","description":"為 Clang/LLVM 提供 MSBuild 專案系統支援的平台工具組。","category":"編譯器、建置工具和執行階段"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Podpora nástroje MSBuild pro sadu nástrojů LLVM (clang-cl)","description":"Sada nástrojů platformy, které poskytují podporu systému projektu MSBuild pro Clang/LLVM","category":"Kompilátory, nástroje pro sestavování buildů a moduly runtime"},{"language":"de-de","title":"MSBuild-Support für LLVM-Toolset (clang-cl)","description":"Plattformtoolset mit MSBuild-Projektsystemunterstützung für Clang/LLVM.","category":"Compiler, Buildtools und Runtimes"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Compatibilidad de MSBuild con el conjunto de herramientas LLVM (clang-cl)","description":"Conjunto de herramientas de la plataforma que proporciona compatibilidad con el sistema de proyectos MSBuild para Clang/LLVM.","category":"Compiladores, herramientas de compilación y entornos de ejecución"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Prise en charge de MSBuild pour l’ensemble d’outils LLVM (clang-cl)","description":"Ensemble d'outils de plateforme prenant en charge le système de projet MSBuild pour Clang/LLVM.","category":"Compilateurs, outils de génération et runtime"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Supporto di MSBuild per il set di strumenti LLVM (clang-cl)","description":"Set di strumenti della piattaforma che forniscono supporto di sistema per i progetti MSBuild per Clang/LLVM.","category":"Compilatori, strumenti di compilazione e runtime"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"LLVM (clang-cl) ツールセットの MSBuild サポート","description":"Clang/LLVM の MSBuild プロジェクト システム サポートを提供するプラットフォーム ツールセット。","category":"コンパイラ、ビルド ツール、およびランタイム"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"LLVM(clang-cl) 도구 집합에 대한 MSBuild 지원","description":"Clang/LLVM에 대한 MSBuild 프로젝트 시스템 지원을 제공하는 플랫폼 도구 세트입니다.","category":"컴파일러, 빌드 도구 및 런타임"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Obsługa programu MSBuild dla zestawu narzędzi maszyny wirtualnej niskiego poziomu (clang-cl)","description":"Zestaw narzędzi platformy zapewniający systemową obsługę projektu MSBuild dla kompilatora Clang/LLVM.","category":"Kompilatory, narzędzia do kompilacji i środowiska uruchomieniowe"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Suporte do MSBuild para o conjunto de ferramentas LLVM (clang-cl)","description":"Conjunto de ferramentas de plataforma que dá suporte ao sistema de projeto MSBuild para Clang/LLVM.","category":"Compiladores, ferramentas de build e tempos de execução"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Поддержка MSBuild для набора инструментов LLVM (clang-cl)","description":"Набор инструментов платформы, предоставляющий поддержку системы проектов MSBuild для Clang/LLVM.","category":"Компиляторы, средства сборки и среды выполнения"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"LLVM (clang-cl) araç takımı için MSBuild desteği","description":"Clang/LLVM için MSBuild projesi sistem desteği sağlayan platform araç takımı.","category":"Derleyiciler, derleme araçları ve çalışma zamanları"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.MFC.ARM","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.ATL.ARM":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.MFC.ARM":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.MFC.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.MFC.MBCS.ARM":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.MFC.Redist.ARM":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.MFC.Source":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC_-2066987101":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.CommunityX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.EnterpriseX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.ProfessionalX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Community","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional"]},"Microsoft.VisualCpp.HTMLHelpWorkshop.Msi":"[4.0,5.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ MFC for latest v143 build tools (ARM)","description":"Includes headers and libraries for the development of MFC applications including the Multi-byte Character Set (MBCS) targeting ARM.","category":"SDKs, libraries, and frameworks"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"适用于最新 v143 生成工具的 C++ MFC (ARM)","description":"包括用于开发面向 ARM 的多字节字符集(MBCS)等 MFC 应用程序的标头和库。","category":"SDK、库和框架"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於最新 v143 建置工具的 C++ MFC (ARM)","description":"包含用於開發 MFC 應用程式的標頭與程式庫，包含以 ARM 為目標的多位元組字元集 (MBCS)。","category":"SDK、程式庫和架構"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"C++ MFC pro nejnovější nástroje pro sestavování v143 (ARM)","description":"Obsahuje hlavičky a knihovny pro vývoj aplikací MFC, včetně vícebajtové znakové sady (MBCS) s cílením na ARM.","category":"Sady SDK, knihovny a architektury"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++-MFC für die neuesten v143-Buildtools (ARM)","description":"Umfasst Header und Bibliotheken für die Entwicklung von MFC-Anwendungen einschließlich Multibyte-Zeichensatz (MBCS) für ARM.","category":"SDKs, Bibliotheken und Frameworks"},{"language":"es-es","title":"MFC de C++ para las herramientas de compilación v143 más recientes (ARM)","description":"Incluye encabezados y bibliotecas para el desarrollo de aplicaciones MFC, incluido el juego de caracteres multibyte (MBCS) destinado a ARM.","category":"SDK, bibliotecas y marcos"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"C++ MFC pour dernière version de Build Tools v143 (ARM)","description":"Inclut des en-têtes et des bibliothèques pour le développement d'applications MFC, notamment le jeu de caractères multioctets (MBCS) ciblant ARM.","category":"SDK, bibliothèques et frameworks"},{"language":"it-it","title":"MFC C++ per la versione più recente di Build Tools v143 (ARM)","description":"Include intestazioni e librerie per lo sviluppo di applicazioni MFC, incluso il set di caratteri multibyte (MBCS), destinate ad ARM.","category":"SDK, librerie e framework"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"最新の v143 ビルド ツール用 C++ MFC (ARM)","description":"ARM をターゲットにしたマルチ バイト文字セット (MBCS) を含む MFC アプリケーションの開発用ヘッダーとライブラリが含まれます。","category":"SDK、ライブラリ、およびフレームワーク"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"최신 v143 빌드 도구용 C++ MFC(ARM)","description":"ARM을 대상으로 하는 MBCS(멀티바이트 문자 집합)를 비롯하여 MFC 애플리케이션 개발에 필요한 헤더와 라이브러리를 포함합니다.","category":"SDK, 라이브러리 및 프레임워크"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"C++ MFC dla najnowszych narzędzi kompilacji w wersji 143 (ARM)","description":"Zawiera nagłówki i biblioteki do opracowywania aplikacji MFC, łącznie z wielobajtowym zestawem znaków (MBCS) przeznaczonym dla architektury ARM.","category":"Zestawy SDK, biblioteki i struktury"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"C++ MFC para as ferramentas de compilação mais recentes v143 (ARM)","description":"Inclui cabeçalhos e bibliotecas para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos MFC, incluindo o Conjunto de Caracteres Multibyte (MBCS) com direcionamento a ARM.","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"MFC-библиотека C++ для новейшей версии Build Tools v143 (ARM)","description":"Включает заголовки и библиотеки для разработки приложений MFC, включая многобайтовую кодировку (MBCS) для нацеливания ARM.","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Son v143 derleme araçları için C++ MFC (ARM)","description":"ARM'yi hedefleyen Çok Baytlı Karakter Kümesi (MBCS) dahil olmak üzere MFC uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik üst bilgileri ve kitaplıkları içerir.","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.MFC.ARM.Spectre","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.ATL.ARM.Spectre":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.MFC.ARM.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.MFC.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.MFC.MBCS.ARM.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.MFC.Redist.ARM.Spectre":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.MFC.Source":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC_-2066987101":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.Ide.MFC","version":"[17.0,18.0)","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.CommunityX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.EnterpriseX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.ProfessionalX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Community","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional"]},"Microsoft.VisualCpp.HTMLHelpWorkshop.Msi":"[4.0,5.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ MFC for latest v143 build tools with Spectre Mitigations (ARM)","description":"Includes headers and libraries with Spectre Mitigations for the development of MFC applications including the Multi-byte Character Set (MBCS) targeting ARM.","category":"SDKs, libraries, and frameworks"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"带有 Spectre 缓解措施适用于最新 v143 生成工具的 C++ MFC (ARM)","description":"包括带有 Spectre 缓解措施的标头和库，它们用于开发 MFC 应用程序(例如，面向 ARM 的多字节字符集(MBCS))。","category":"SDK、库和框架"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於最新 v143 建置工具且具有 Spectre 風險降低功能的 C++ MFC (ARM)","description":"包含用於開發 MFC 應用程式的標頭與程式庫及 Spectre 風險降低，包含以 ARM 為目標的多位元組字元集 (MBCS)。","category":"SDK、程式庫和架構"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"C++ MFC pro nejnovější nástroje pro sestavování v143 se zmírněními hrozby Spectre (ARM)","description":"Obsahuje hlavičky a knihovny se zmírněními hrozeb Spectre pro vývoj aplikací MFC, včetně vícebajtové znakové sady (MBCS) s cílením na ARM.","category":"Sady SDK, knihovny a architektury"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++-MFC für die neuesten v143-Buildtools mit Spectre-Entschärfungen (ARM)","description":"Umfasst Header und Bibliotheken mit Spectre-Entschärfungen für die Entwicklung von MFC-Anwendungen einschließlich Multibyte-Zeichensatz (MBCS) für ARM.","category":"SDKs, Bibliotheken und Frameworks"},{"language":"es-es","title":"MFC de C++ para las herramientas de compilación v143 más recientes con mitigaciones de Spectre (ARM)","description":"Incluye encabezados y bibliotecas con mitigaciones de Spectre para el desarrollo de aplicaciones MFC, incluido el juego de caracteres multibyte (MBCS) destinado a ARM.","category":"SDK, bibliotecas y marcos"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"C++ MFC pour dernière version de Build Tools v143 avec atténuations de spectre (ARM)","description":"Inclut des en-têtes et des bibliothèques avec atténuations Spectre pour le développement d'applications MFC, notamment le jeu de caractères multioctets (MBCS) ciblant ARM.","category":"SDK, bibliothèques et frameworks"},{"language":"it-it","title":"MFC C++ per la versione più recente di Build Tools v143 con mitigazioni Spectre (ARM)","description":"Include intestazioni e librerie con mitigazioni Spectre per lo sviluppo di applicazioni MFC, incluso il set di caratteri multibyte (MBCS), destinate ad ARM.","category":"SDK, librerie e framework"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Spectre の軽減策を含む、最新の v143 ビルド ツール用 C++ MFC (ARM)","description":"ARM をターゲットにしたマルチ バイト文字セット (MBCS) を含む MFC アプリケーションを開発するための、Spectre の軽減策を含むヘッダーとライブラリが含まれます。","category":"SDK、ライブラリ、およびフレームワーク"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"스펙터 완화를 지원하는 최신 v143 빌드 도구용 C++ MFC(ARM)","description":"ARM을 대상으로 하는 MBCS(멀티바이트 문자 집합)를 비롯하여 MFC 애플리케이션 개발에 대해 스펙터 완화를 사용하는 헤더와 라이브러리를 포함합니다.","category":"SDK, 라이브러리 및 프레임워크"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"C++ MFC dla najnowszych narzędzi kompilacji w wersji 143 z krokami zaradczymi dla luki Spectre (ARM)","description":"Zawiera nagłówki i biblioteki z krokami zaradczymi dla luki Spectre do opracowywania aplikacji MFC, łącznie z wielobajtowym zestawem znaków (MBCS) przeznaczonym dla architektury ARM.","category":"Zestawy SDK, biblioteki i struktury"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"C++ MFC para as ferramentas de compilação v143 mais recentes com Mitigações de Espectro (ARM)","description":"Inclui cabeçalhos e bibliotecas com Mitigações de Espectro para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos MFC, incluindo o Conjunto de Caracteres Multibyte (MBCS) com direcionamento a ARM.","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"MFC-библиотека C++ для новейшей версии Build Tools v143 с устранением рисков Spectre (ARM)","description":"Включает заголовки и библиотеки с устранением рисков Spectre для разработки приложений MFC, включая многобайтовую кодировку (MBCS) для целевой платформы ARM.","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Spectre Risk Azaltma içeren en yeni v143 derleme araçları için C++ MFC (ARM)","description":"ARM'yi hedefleyen Çok Baytlı Karakter Kümesi (MBCS) dahil olmak üzere MFC uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik Spectre Azaltmalarının bulunduğu üst bilgileri ve kitaplıkları içerir.","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.MFC.ARM64","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.AT