uild tools with Spectre Mitigations (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"Includes headers and libraries with Spectre mitigations for the development of MFC applications including the Multi-byte Character Set (MBCS) targeting ARM64/ARM64EC.","category":"SDKs, libraries, and frameworks","keywords":["ec","arm64ec"]},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"带有 Spectre 缓解措施、适用于最新 v143 生成工具的 C++ MFC (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"包括带有 Spectre 缓解措施的标头和库，它们用于开发 MFC 应用程序(例如，面向 ARM64/ARM64EC 的多字节字符集[MBCS])。","category":"SDK、库和框架","keywords":["ec","arm64ec"]},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於最新 v143 建置工具且具有 Spectre 風險降低功能的 C++ MFC (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"包含用於開發 MFC 應用程式的標頭與程式庫及 Spectre 風險降低，包含以 ARM64/ARM64EC 為目標的多位元組字元集 (MBCS)。","category":"SDK、程式庫和架構","keywords":["EC","arm64ec"]},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"C++ MFC pro nejnovější nástroje pro sestavování v143 se zmírněními hrozby Spectre (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"Obsahuje hlavičky a knihovny se zmírněními hrozeb Spectre pro vývoj aplikací MFC, včetně vícebajtové znakové sady (MBCS) s cílením na ARM64/ARM64EC.","category":"Sady SDK, knihovny a architektury","keywords":["ec","arm64ec"]},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++ MFC für die neuesten v143-Buildtools mit Spectre-Entschärfungen (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"Enthält Header und Bibliotheken mit Spectre-Entschärfungen für die Entwicklung von MFC-Anwendungen, einschließlich des Multibyte-Zeichensatzes (MBCS) für ARM64/ARM64EC.","category":"SDKs, Bibliotheken und Frameworks","keywords":["EC","ARM64EC"]},{"language":"es-es","title":"MFC de C++ para las herramientas de compilación v143 con mitigaciones de Spectre más recientes (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"Incluye encabezados y bibliotecas con mitigaciones de Spectre para el desarrollo de aplicaciones MFC, incluido el juego de caracteres multibyte (MBCS) destinado a ARM64/ARM64EC.","category":"SDK, bibliotecas y marcos","keywords":["ec","arm64ec"]},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"C++ MFC pour les derniers outils de build v143 avec atténuations spectre (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"Inclut des en-têtes et des bibliothèques avec des atténuations spectre pour le développement d’applications MFC, notamment le jeu de caractères multioctets (MBCS) ciblant ARM64/ARM64EC.","category":"SDK, bibliothèques et frameworks","keywords":["ec","arm64ec"]},{"language":"it-it","title":"MFC C++ per la versione più recente degli strumenti della build v143 con mitigazioni Spectre (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"Include intestazioni e librerie con mitigazioni Spectre per lo sviluppo di applicazioni MFC, incluso il set di caratteri multibyte (MBCS), destinate ad ARM64/ARM64EC.","category":"SDK, librerie e framework","keywords":["EC","arm64ec"]},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Spectre の軽減策を含む、最新の v143 ビルド ツール用 C++ MFC (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"ARM64/ARM64EC をターゲットとするマルチバイト文字セット (MBCS) を含む MFC アプリケーションの開発のための Spectre 軽減策を備えたヘッダーとライブラリが含まれています。","category":"SDK、ライブラリ、およびフレームワーク","keywords":["ec","arm64ec"]},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Spectre 완화를 지원하는 최신 v143 빌드 도구용 C++ MFC(ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"ARM64/ARM64EC를 대상으로 하는 MBCS(멀티바이트 문자 집합)를 비롯하여 MFC 애플리케이션 개발에 대해 Spectre 완화를 지원하는 헤더와 라이브러리를 포함합니다.","category":"SDK, 라이브러리 및 프레임워크","keywords":["ec","arm64ec"]},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"C++ MFC dla najnowszych narzędzi kompilacji w wersji 143 z krokami zaradczymi dla luki Spectre (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"Zawiera nagłówki i biblioteki z krokami zaradczymi dla luki Spectre do programowania aplikacji MFC, łącznie z wielobajtowym zestawem znaków (MBCS) przeznaczonym dla architektury ARM64/ARM64EC.","category":"Zestawy SDK, biblioteki i struktury","keywords":["EC","arm64ec"]},{"language":"pt-br","title":"C++ MFC para as mais recentes ferramentas da build v143 com Spectre Mitigations (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"Inclui cabeçalhos e bibliotecas com mitigações Spectre para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos MFC, incluindo o Conjunto de Caracteres de Vários Bytes (MBCS) direcionado para ARM64/ARM64EC.","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas","keywords":["​ec","arm64ec"]},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"MFC-библиотека C++ для новейших инструментов сборки v143 с устранением рисков Spectre (ARM64/ARM64EC)","description":"Содержит файлы заголовков и библиотеки с устранением рисков Spectre для разработки MFC-приложений, включая многобайтовую кодировку (MBCS), под целевую платформу ARM64/ARM64EC.","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы","keywords":["ec","arm64ec"]},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Spectre Riski Azaltmaları (ARM64/ARM64EC) ile en son v143 derleme araçları için C++ MFC","description":"ARM64/ARM64EC’yi hedefleyen Çok Baytlı Karakter Kümesi (MBCS) dahil olmak üzere MFC uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik Spectre Riski Azaltmalarının bulunduğu üst bilgileri ve kitaplıkları içerir.","category":"SDK'lar, kitaplıklar ve çerçeveler","keywords":["ec","arm64ec"]}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.Modules.ARM64","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualCpp.IFC.arm64":"[14.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ Modules for v143 build tools (ARM64 – experimental)","description":"C++ Module interfaces for the standard libraries that can be imported into code instead of textually including header files.","category":"Compilers, build tools, and runtimes"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"适用于 v143 生成工具的 C++ 模块(ARM64 - 试验性)","description":"用于标准库的 C++ 模块接口，可导入到代码中，而不是按原文包括头文件。","category":"编译器、生成工具和运行时"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 v143 建置工具的 C++ 模組 (ARM64 - 實驗)","description":"可以將標準程式庫的模組介面匯入程式碼，而不是以文字形式納入標頭檔的 C++ 模組介面","category":"編譯器、建置工具和執行階段"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Moduly C++ pro nástroje pro sestavování v143 (ARM64 – experimentální)","description":"Rozhraní modulu C++ pro standardní knihovny, které se dají importovat do kódu místo zahrnutí souborů hlaviček pomocí textu","category":"Kompilátory, nástroje pro sestavování buildů a moduly runtime"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++-Module für v143-Buildtools (ARM64 – experimentell)","description":"C++-Modulschnittstellen für die Standardbibliotheken, die in den Code importiert werden können, statt Headerdateien in Textform einzubeziehen.","category":"Compiler, Buildtools und Laufzeiten"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Módulos de C++ para herramientas de compilación v143 (ARM64 – experimental)","description":"Interfaces de módulo de C++ para las bibliotecas estándar que se pueden importar en el código en lugar de incluir textualmente archivos de encabezado.","category":"Compiladores, herramientas de compilación y entornos de ejecución"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Modules C++ pour les outils de génération v143 (expérimental – ARM64)","description":"Interfaces de module C++ pour les bibliothèques standard qui peuvent être importées dans du code au lieu d'inclure textuellement des fichiers d'en–tête.","category":"Compilateurs, outils de génération et runtimes"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Moduli C++ per Build Tools v143 (ARM64 – sperimentale)","description":"Interfacce dei moduli C++ per le librerie standard che è possibile importare nel codice invece di includere testualmente file di intestazione.","category":"Compilatori, strumenti di compilazione e runtime"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"v143 ビルド ツール用の C++ モジュール (ARM64 – 試験段階)","description":"テキストによってヘッダーファイルを組み込むのではなく、コードにインポートできる標準ライブラリ用の C++ モジュール インターフェイス。","category":"コンパイラ、ビルド ツール、およびランタイム"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"v143 빌드 도구용 C++ 모듈(ARM64 – 실험적)","description":"헤더 파일을 텍스트로 포함하는 대신 코드로 가져올 수 있는 표준 라이브러리용 C++ 모듈 인터페이스","category":"컴파일러, 빌드 도구 및 런타임"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Moduły języka C++ dla narzędzi kompilacji w wersji 143 (ARM64 — eksperymentalne)","description":"Interfejsy modułów języka C++ dla bibliotek standardowych, które można importować do kodu zamiast w formie tekstu, w tym pliki nagłówków.","category":"Kompilatory, narzędzia do kompilacji i środowiska uruchomieniowe"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Módulos C++ para ferramentas de compilação v143 (ARM64 – experimental)","description":"As interfaces do Módulo do C++ das bibliotecas padrão que podem ser importadas no código em vez de incluir arquivos de cabeçalho textualmente.","category":"Compiladores, ferramentas de build e tempos de execução"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Модули C++ для инструментов сборки v143 (ARM64 — экспериментальная версия)","description":"Интерфейсы модулей C++ для стандартных библиотек, которые можно импортировать в код, не включая файлы заголовков в текстовой форме.","category":"Компиляторы, средства сборки и среды выполнения"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"v143 derleme araçları için C++ Modülleri (ARM64 – deneysel)","description":"Üst bilgi dosyalarının metin içeriğini eklemek yerine koda aktarılabilen standart kitaplıkların C++ Modülü arabirimleri.","category":"Derleyiciler, derleme araçları ve çalışma zamanları"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.Modules.x86.x64","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualCpp.IFC.x64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.IFC.x86":"[14.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ Modules for v143 build tools (x64/x86 – experimental)","description":"C++ Module interfaces for the standard libraries that can be imported into code instead of textually including header files.","category":"Compilers, build tools, and runtimes"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"适用于 v143 生成工具的 C++ 模块(x64/x86 - 实验性)","description":"用于标准库的 C++ 模块接口，可导入到代码中，而不是按原文包括头文件。","category":"编译器、生成工具和运行时"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 v143 建置工具的 C++ 模組 (x64/x86 –實驗性)","description":"可以將標準程式庫的模組介面匯入程式碼，而不是以文字形式納入標頭檔的 C++ 模組介面","category":"編譯器、建置工具和執行階段"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Moduly C++ pro nástroje pro sestavování v143 (x64/x86 – experimentální)","description":"Rozhraní modulu C++ pro standardní knihovny, které se dají importovat do kódu místo zahrnutí souborů h