ówków.","category":"Kompilatory, narzędzia do kompilacji i środowiska uruchomieniowe"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Módulos do C++ para ferramentas do build v143 (x86 e x64, experimental)","description":"As interfaces do Módulo do C++ das bibliotecas padrão que podem ser importadas no código em vez de incluir arquivos de cabeçalho textualmente.","category":"Compiladores, ferramentas de build e tempos de execução"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Модули C++ для средств сборки версии 143 (x64 или x86 — экспериментальная версия)","description":"Интерфейсы модулей C++ для стандартных библиотек, которые можно импортировать в код, не включая файлы заголовков в текстовой форме.","category":"Компиляторы, средства сборки и среды выполнения"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"v143 derleme araçları için C++ Modülleri (x64/x86 - deneysel)","description":"Üst bilgi dosyalarının metin içeriğini eklemek yerine koda aktarılabilen standart kitaplıkların C++ Modülü arabirimleri.","category":"Derleyiciler, derleme araçları ve çalışma zamanları"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.Redist.14.Latest","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualCpp.Redist.14.Latest":"[14.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ 2022 Redistributable Update","description":"Latest update for the Visual C++ Redistributable","category":"Compilers, build tools, and runtimes"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"C++ 2022 可再发行程序包更新","description":"Visual C++ 可再发行程序包的最新更新","category":"编译器、生成工具和运行时"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"C++ 2022 可轉散發更新","description":"Visual C++ 可轉散發套件的最新更新","category":"編譯器、建置工具和執行階段"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Distribuovatelná aktualizace pro C++ 2022","description":"Nejnovější aktualizace pro Visual C++ Redistributable","category":"Kompilátory, nástroje pro sestavování buildů a moduly runtime"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++ 2022 Redistributable-Update","description":"Letztes Update für 