pWorkshop.Msi":"[4.0,5.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"C++ MFC for v141 build tools with Spectre Mitigations (x86 & x64)","description":"Includes headers and libraries with Spectre Mitigations for the development of ATL and MFC applications including the Multi-byte Character Set (MBCS).","category":"SDKs, libraries, and frameworks"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"C++ MFC v141 生成工具与 Spectre 缓解 (x86 & x64)","description":"包括带有 Spectre 缓解措施的标头和库，它们用于开发多字节字符集(MBCS)等 ATL 和 MFC 应用程序。","category":"SDK、库和框架"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 v141 建置工具且具有 Spectre 風險降低功能的 C++ MFC (x86 & x64)","description":"包含用於開發 ATL 與 MFC 應用程式的標頭與程式庫及 Spectre 風險降低，包含多位元組字元集 (MBCS)。","category":"SDK、程式庫和架構"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"C++ MFC pro nástroje sestavení v141 se zmírněními hrozby Spectre (x86 a x64)","description":"Obsahuje hlavičky a knihovny se zmírněními hrozeb Spectre pro vývoj aplikací ATL a MFC, včetně vícebajtové znakové sady (MBCS).","category":"Sady SDK, knihovny a architektury"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++ MFC für v141-Buildtools mit Spectre-Entschärfungen (x86 & x64)","description":"Umfasst Header und Bibliotheken mit Spectre-Entschärfungen für die Entwicklung von ATL- und MFC-Anwendungen einschließlich Multibyte-Zeichensatz (MBCS).","category":"SDKs, Bibliotheken und Frameworks"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Herramientas de compilación MFC de C++ para v141 con mitigaciones de Spectre (x86 y x64)","description":"Incluye encabezados y bibliotecas con mitigaciones de Spectre para el desarrollo de aplicaciones ATL y MFC, incluido el juego de caracteres multibyte (MBCS).","category":"SDK, bibliotecas y marcos"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"C++ MFC pour Build Tools v141 avec atténuations de Spectre (x86 et x64)","description":"Inclut des en-têtes et des bibliothèques avec atténuations Spectre pour le développement d'applications ATL et MFC, notamment le jeu de caractères multioctets (MBCS).","category":"SDK, bibliothèques et frameworks"},{"language":"it-it","title":"MFC C++ per Build Tools v141 con mitigazioni Spectre (x86 e x64)","description":"Include intestazioni e librerie con mitigazioni Spectre per lo sviluppo di applicazioni ATL e MFC, incluso il set di caratteri multibyte (MBCS).","category":"SDK, librerie e framework"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Spectre の軽減策を含む v141 ビルド ツール用 C++ MFC (x86 および x64)","description":"マルチ バイト文字セット (MBCS) を含む ATL および MFC アプリケーションを開発するための、Spectre の軽減策を含むヘッダーとライブラリが含まれます。","category":"SDK、ライブラリ、およびフレームワーク"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"스펙터 완화를 지원하는 v141 빌드 도구용 C++ MFC(x86 및 x64)","description":"MBCS(멀티바이트 문자 집합)를 비롯하여 ATL 및 MFC 애플리케이션 개발에 대해 스펙터 완화를 사용하는 헤더와 라이브러리를 포함합니다.","category":"SDK, 라이브러리 및 프레임워크"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"C++ MFC dla narzędzi kompilacji w wersji 141 z krokami zaradczymi dla luki Spectre (x86 i x64)","description":"Zawiera nagłówki i biblioteki z krokami zaradczymi dla luki Spectre do opracowywania aplikacji ATL i MFC, łącznie z wielobajtowym zestawem znaków (MBCS).","category":"Zestawy SDK, biblioteki i struktury"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"MFC do C++ para ferramentas de build v141 com Mitigações de Espectro (x86 e x64)","description":"Inclui cabeçalhos e bibliotecas com Mitigações de Espectro para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos ATL e MFC, incluindo o Conjunto de Caracteres Multibyte (MBCS).","category":"SDKs, bibliotecas e estruturas"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"MFC C++ для средств сборки версии 141 с устранением рисков Spectre (x86 и x64)","description":"Включает заголовки и библиотеки с устранением рисков Spectre для разработки приложений ATL и MFC, включая многобайтовую кодировку (MBCS).","category":"Пакеты SDK, библиотеки и платформы"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Spectre Azaltmaları ile v141 derleme araçları için C++ MFC (x86 ve x64)","description":"Çok Baytlı Karakter Kümesi (MBCS) dahil olmak üzere ATL ve MFC uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik Spectre Azaltmalarının bulunduğu üst bilgileri ve kitaplıkları içerir.","category":"SDK