ription":"Plantillas, host de servicio, cliente de prueba, depurador y menú Agregar referencia de servicio para el desarrollo de proyectos de Windows Communication Foundation.","category":"Actividades de desarrollo","keywords":["WCF"]},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Windows Communication Foundation","description":"Menu Modèles, Hôte de service, Client test, Débogueur et Ajouter une référence de service pour le développement de projets Windows Communication Foundation.","category":"Activités de développement","keywords":["WCF"]},{"language":"it-it","title":"Windows Communication Foundation","description":"Modelli, host servizio, client di test, debugger e menu Aggiungi riferimento al servizio per sviluppare progetti Windows Communication Foundation.","category":"Attività di sviluppo","keywords":["WCF"]},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Windows Communication Foundation","description":"Windows Communication Foundation プロジェクトを開発するためのテンプレート、サービス ホスト、テスト クライアント、デバッガー、および [サービス参照の追加] メニュー ","category":"開発作業","keywords":["WCF"]},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Windows Communication Foundation","description":"Windows Communication Foundation 프로젝트 개발용 템플릿, 서비스 호스트, 테스트 클라이언트, 디버거 및 서비스 참조 추가입니다.","category":"개발 작업","keywords":["WCF"]},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Windows Communication Foundation","description":"Szablony, host usługi, klient testowy, debuger i menu Dodaj odwołanie do usługi na potrzeby opracowywania projektów Windows Communication Foundation.","category":"Działania programistyczne","keywords":["WCF"]},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Windows Communication Foundation","description":"Modelos, Host de Serviço, Cliente de Testes, Depurador e menu Adicionar Referência de Serviço para desenvolver projetos do Windows Communication Foundation.","category":"Atividades de desenvolvimento","keywords":["WCF"]},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Windows Communication Foundation","description":"Шаблоны, узел службы, тестовый клиент, отладчик и меню ''Добавление ссылки на службу'' для разработки проектов на основе Windows Communication Foundation.","category":"Действия разработки","keywords":["WCF"]},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Windows Communication Foundation","description":"Windows Communication Foundation projeleri geliştirmek için Şablonlar, Hizmet Barındırma Ortamı, Test İstemcisi, Hata Ayıklayıcı ve Hizmet Başvurusu Ekleme menüsü.","category":"Geliştirme etkinlikleri","keywords":["WCF"]}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.Web","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.Web":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.NetCore.Component.Web":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Web.Mvc.Common":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Web.Mvc":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.TestTools.Templates.Managed":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.DockerTools":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Templates.CS.EdgeDriverTestCore":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.WebDeploy":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.AppInsights.Tools":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"}},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"ASP.NET and web development prerequisites","description":"Tools for developing ASP.NET and Web applications including IIS Express and SQL Server LocalDB.","category":"Development activities"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"ASP.NET 和 Web 开发先决条件","description":"用于开发 ASP.NET 和 Web 应用程序的工具，包括 IIS Express 和 SQL Server LocalDB。","category":"开发活动"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"ASP.NET 與網頁程式開發必要條件","description":"這些工具可用於開發 ASP.NET 與 Web 應用程式，包括 IIS Express 與 SQL Server LocalDB。","category":"開發活動"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Požadavky pro vývoj pro web a ASP.NET","description":"Nástroje pro vývoj aplikací pro ASP.NET a webových aplikací, včetně služby IIS Express a SQL Server LocalDB","category":"Vývojové aktivity"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Erforderliche Komponenten für