.","category":"Development activities"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"其他项目模板(早期版本)","description":"ASP.NET 网站项目模板。","category":"开发活动"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"其他專案範本 (舊版)","description":"適用於 ASP.NET 網站專案的範本。","category":"開發活動"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Další šablony projektů (předchozí verze)","description":"Šablony pro projekty webů ASP.NET","category":"Vývojové aktivity"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Zusätzliche Projektvorlagen (vorherige Versionen)","description":"Vorlagen für ASP.NET-Websiteprojekte.","category":"Entwicklungsaktivitäten"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Plantillas de proyecto adicionales (versiones anteriores)","description":"Plantillas para proyectos de sitios web de ASP.NET.","category":"Actividades de desarrollo"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Modèles de projet supplémentaires (versions précédentes)","description":"Modèles pour les projets de site web ASP.NET.","category":"Activités de développement"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Modelli di progetto aggiuntivi (versioni precedenti)","description":"Modelli per i progetti di sito Web ASP.NET.","category":"Attività di sviluppo"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"追加のプロジェクト テンプレート (以前のバージョン)","description":"ASP.NET Web サイトのプロジェクト用テンプレート。","category":"開発作業"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"추가 프로젝트 템플릿(이전 버전)","description":"ASP.NET 웹 사이트 프로젝트에 대한 템플릿입니다.","category":"개발 작업"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Dodatkowe szablony projektów (poprzednie wersje)","description":"Szablony dla projektów witryn internetowych na platformie ASP.NET.","category":"Działania programistyczne"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Modelos de projeto adicionais (versões anteriores)","description":"Modelos para projetos de Site do ASP.NET.","category":"Atividades de desenvolvimento"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Дополнительные шаблоны проектов (предыдущие версии)","description":"Шаблоны для проектов веб-сайта ASP.NET.","category":"Действия разработки"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Ek proje şablonları (önceki sürümler)","description":"ASP.NET Web sitesi projeleri için şablonlar.","category":"Geliştirme etkinlikleri"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.ArchitectureTools.Managed","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","productArch":"arm64","isUiGroup":true,"automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Architecture and analysis tools","description":"Includes Code Map, Class Designer, Live Dependency Validation, and Code Clone detection.","category":"Code tools"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"体系结构和分析工具","description":"包含代码图、类设计器、实时依赖项验证和代码克隆检测。","category":"代码工具"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"架構與分析工具","description":"包括 Code Map、類別設計工具、即時相依性驗證及程式碼複製品偵測。","category":"程式碼工具"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Nástroje pro architekturu a analýzu","description":"Zahrnuje mapu kódu, návrháře tříd, ověřování závislostí v reálném čase a detekci klonů kódu.","category":"Nástroje pro kód"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Architektur- und Analysetools","description":"Umfasst Code Map, Klassen-Designer, Live-Abhängigkeitsvalidierung und Codeklonerkennung.","category":"Codetools"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Herramientas de arquitectura y análisis","description":"Incluye detección de mapa de código, diseñador de clases, validación de dependencias en vivo y clon de código.","category":"Herramientas de código"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Outils analyse et architecture","description":"Inclut la carte de code, le Concepteur de classes, la validation de dépendances dynamique et la détection des clones de code.","category":"Outils de code"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Strumenti per architettura e analisi","description":"Include il rilevamento di Mappa del codice, Progettazione classi, Convalida delle dipendenze in tempo reale e Clone di codice.","category":"Strumenti per il codice"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"アーキテクチャと分析ツール","description":"コード マップ、クラス デザイナー、ライブ依存関係検証、コード クローン検出が含まれます。","category":"コード ツール"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"아키텍처 및 분석 도구","descr