et de diagnostic pour la génération d'applications cloud scalables."},{"language":"it-it","title":"Strumenti di Servizi cloud di Azure","description":"Modelli di progetto e strumenti di pubblicazione e diagnostica per la creazione di app per cloud scalabili."},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Azure Cloud Services ツール","description":"スケーラブルなクラウド アプリをビルドするためのプロジェクト テンプレート、公開ツール、および診断ツール。"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Azure Cloud Services 도구","description":"확장 가능한 클라우드 응용 프로그램을 빌드하는 데 사용되는 프로젝트 템플릿, 게시 및 진단 도구입니다."},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Narzędzia usług Azure Cloud Services","description":"Szablony projektów oraz narzędzia do publikowania i diagnostyki umożliwiające tworzenie skalowalnych aplikacji w chmurze."},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Ferramentas dos Serviços de Nuvem do Azure","description":"Modelos de projeto, publicações e ferramentas de diagnósticos para compilar aplicativos escalonáveis na nuvem."},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Средства Облачных служб Azure","description":"Шаблоны проектов, инструменты публикации и диагностики для создания масштабируемых облачных приложений."},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Azure Cloud Services araçları","description":"Ölçeklenebilen bulut uygulamaları oluşturmaya yönelik proje şablonları, yayımlama ve tanılama araçları."}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.Azure.Prerequisites","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.Azure.ClientLibs":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Net.CoreSDK.50":"1.0","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.Common.Azure.Tools":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Templates.CS.ManagedCore":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Templates.VB.ManagedCore":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Component.MSBuild":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.IISExpress":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.NuGet":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Net.ComponentGroup.DevelopmentPrerequisites":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.ConnectedServices":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.TestTools.Managed":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.TestTools.Templates.Managed":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.AzureFunctions":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Azure development prerequisites","description":"The Azure development prerequisites include: Azure libraries for .NET, Common Azure tools, .NET Portable Library Targeting pack, MSBuild, IIS Express, NuGet package manager, .NET Framework development prerequisites, and Cloud Explorer.","category":"Cloud, database, and server"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"Azure 开发必备组件","description":"Azure 开发必备组件包括: Azure libraries for .NET、通用 Azure 工具、.NET 可移植库目标包、MSBuild、IIS Express、NuGet 包管理器、.NET Framework 开发必备组件和 Cloud Explorer。","category":"云、数据库和服务器"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Azure 開發必要條件","description":"Azure 開發必要條件包括: 適用於 .NET 的 Azure 程式庫、常用 Azure 工具、.NET 可攜式程式庫目標套件、MSBuild、IIS Express、NuGet 套件管理員、.NET Framework 開發必要條件及 Cloud Explorer。","category":"雲端、資料庫和伺服器"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Předpoklady pro vývoj pro Azure","description":"Povinné součásti pro vývoj pro Azure zahrnují: knihovny Azure pro .NET, společné nástroje pro Azure, .NET Portable Library Targeting Pack, MSBuild, IIS Express, Správce balíčků NuGet, povinné součásti pro vývoj určený pro rozhraní .NET Framework a Průzkumníka cloudu.","category":"Cloud, databáze a server"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Erforderliche Komponenten für die Azure-Entwicklung","description":"Die erforderlichen Komponenten für die Azure-Entwicklung umfassen: Azure-Bibliotheken für .NET, allgemeine Azure-Tools, das Paket zur Festlegung von Zielversionen für portable .NET-Bibliotheken, MSBuild, IIS Express, den NuGet-Paket-Manager, die erforderlichen Komponenten für die .NET Framework-Entwicklung und den Cloud-Explorer.","category":"Cloud, Datenbank und Server"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Requisitos previos para el desarrollo en Azure","description":"Entre los requisitos previos para el desarrollo en Azure se incluyen las bibliotecas de Azure para .NET, las herramientas comunes de Azure, el paquete de compatibilidad con la biblioteca portátil de .NET, MSBuild, IIS Express, el administrador de paquetes NuGet, los requisitos previos para el desarrollo en .NET Framework y Cloud Explorer.","category":"Nube, base de datos y servidor"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Prérequis pour le développement Azure","description":"Les prérequis pour le développement Azure comprennent : les bibliothèques Azure pour .NET, les outils Azure courants, le pack de ciblage .NET Portable Library, MSBuild, IIS Express, le gestionnaire de packages NuGet, les prérequis pour le développement .NET Framework et Cloud Explorer.","category":"Cloud, base de données et serveur"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Prerequisiti per lo sviluppo per Azure","description":"I prerequisiti per lo sviluppo per Azure includono: librerie di Azure per .NET, strumenti comuni di Azure, Targeting Pack per libreria portabile .NET, MSBuild, IIS Express, Gestione pacchetti NuGet, prerequisiti per lo sviluppo per .NET Framework e Cloud Explorer.","category":"Cloud, database e server"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Azure 開発の前提条件","description":"Azure 開発の前提条件には以下が含まれます: .NET 用 Azure ライブラリ、Common Azure Tools、.NET ポータブル ライブラリ Targeting Pack、MSBuild、IIS Express、NuGet パッケージ マネージャー、.NET Framework 開発の前提条件、および Cloud Explorer。","category":"クラウド、データベース、およびサーバー"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Azure 개발 필수 구성 요소","description":"Azure 개발 필수 조건에는 .NET용 Azure 라이브러리, 공용 Azure 도구, .NET 이식 가능한 라이브러리 타기팅 팩, MSBuild, IIS Express, NuGet 패키지 관리자, .NET Framework 개발 필수 조건 및 클라우드 탐색기가 포함됩니다.","category":"클라우드, 데이터베이스 및 서버"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Wymagania wstępne dotyczące programowania dla platformy Azure","description":"Wymagania wstępne dotyczące programowania platformy Azure obejmują: biblioteki platformy Azure dla platformy .NET, wspólne narzędzia platformy Azure, pakiet .NET Portable Library Targeting Pack, program MSBuild, usługi IIS Express, menedżera pakietów NuGet, wymagania wstępne dotyczące programowania platformy .NET Framework i program Cloud Explorer.","category":"Chmura, baza danych i serwer"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Pré-requisitos de desenvolvimento para Azure","description":"Os pré-requisitos de desenvolvimento do Azure incluem: bibliotecas do Azure para .NET, ferramentas comuns do Azure, pacote de direcionamento da Biblioteca Portátil do .NET, MSBuild, IIS Express, gerente de pacote NuGet, pré-requisitos de desenvolvimento do .NET Framework e Cloud Explorer.","category":"Nuvem, banco de dados e servidor"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Необходимые компоненты для разработки на базе Azure","description":"Необходимые компоненты для разработки на базе Azure: библиотеки Azure для .NET, общие инструменты Azure, пакет нацеливания переносимой библиотеки .NET, MSBuild, IIS Express, диспетчер пакетов NuGet, необходимые компоненты для разработки на базе .NET Framework и Cloud Explorer.","category":"Облако, база данных и сервер"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Azure geliştirme önkoşulları","description":"Azure geliştirme önkoşulları şunları içerir: .NET için Azure kitaplıkları, Ortak Azure Araçları, .NET Taşınabilir Kitaplık Targeting Pack, MSBuild, IIS Express, NuGet paket yöneticisi, .NET Framework geliştirme önkoşulları ve Cloud Explorer.","category":"Bulut, veritabanı ve sunucu"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.Azure.ResourceManager.Tools","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","isUiGroup":true,"automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.Azure.ResourceManager.Tools":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Azure Resource Manager tools","description":"Deployment templates and scripts for creating resources on Azure."},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"Azure 资源管理器工具","description":"用于在 Azure 上创建资源的部署模板和脚本。"},{"language":