e potřebné pro práci s projekty pomocí Clangu","category":"Kompilátory, nástroje pro sestavování buildů a moduly runtime"},{"language":"de-de","title":"C++ Clang-Tools für Windows (19.1.1 – x64/x86)","description":"Plattformtoolset, Clang-Compiler und Tools, die für die Arbeit mit Projekten mit Clang erforderlich sind.","category":"Compiler, Buildtools und Runtimes"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Herramientas de Clang de C++ para Windows (19.1.1 - x64/x86)","description":"Conjunto de herramientas de la plataforma, compilador de Clang y herramientas necesarias para trabajar con los proyectos con Clang.","category":"Compiladores, herramientas de compilación y entornos de ejecución"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Outils Clang C++ pour Windows (19.1.1 – x64/x86)","description":"Ensemble d'outils de plateforme, compilateur Clang et outils nécessaires aux projets basés sur Clang.","category":"Compilateurs, outils de génération et runtime"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Strumenti Clang C++ per Windows (19.1.1 - x64/x86)","description":"Set di strumenti della piattaforma, compilatore Clang e strumenti necessari per lavorare con i progetti con Clang.","category":"Compilatori, strumenti di compilazione e runtime"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Windows 用 C++ Clang ツール (19.1.1 - x64/x86)","description":"プラットフォーム ツールセット、Clang コンパイラ、プロジェクトの処理を Clang で行うために必要なツール。","category":"コンパイラ、ビルド ツール、およびランタイム"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Windows용 C++ Clang 도구(19.1.1 - x64/x86)","description":"Clang을 사용하는 프로젝트 작업에 필요한 플랫폼 도구 세트, Clang 컴파일러 및 도구입니다.","category":"컴파일러, 빌드 도구 및 런타임"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Narzędzia C++ Clang dla systemu Windows (19.1.1 — x64/x86)","description":"Zestaw narzędzi platformy, kompilator Clang i narzędzia potrzebne do pracy z projektami przy użyciu kompilatora Clang.","category":"Kompilatory, narzędzia do kompilacji i środowiska uruchomieniowe"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Ferramentas C++ Clang para Windows (19.1.1 – x64/x86)","description":"Conjunto de ferramentas de plataforma, compilador Clang e ferramentas necessárias para trabalhar com projetos com Clang.","category":"Compiladores, ferramentas de build e tempos de execução"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Инструменты C++ Clang для Windows (19.1.1 — x64/x86)","description":"Набор инструментов платформы, компилятор Clang и средства, необходимые для работы с проектами с использованием Clang.","category":"Компиляторы, средства сборки и среды выполнения"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Windows için C++ Clang araçları (19.1.1 - x64/x86)","description":"Clang kullanan projelerle çalışmak için gereken platform araç takımı, Clang derleyicisi ve araçları.","category":"Derleyiciler, derleme araçları ve çalışma zamanları"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.Sharepoint.WIF","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","isUiGroup":true,"automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.SharePoint.Runtime":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Windows Identity Foundation 3.5","description":"Installs or enables Windows Identity Foundation 3.5 and Microsoft Identity Exensions for existing SharePoint Add-in projects, not required for new projects.","category":"Development activities","keywords":["add-in","SharePoint","web","add","ODT"]},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"Windows Identity Foundation 3.5","description":"为现有 SharePoint 外接程序项目安装或启用 Windows Identity Foundation 3.5 和 Microsoft Identity 扩展。新项目不需要。","category":"开发活动","keywords":["外接程序","SharePoint","Web","添加","ODT"]},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Windows Identity Foundation 3.5","description":"安裝或啟用適用於現有 SharePoint 增益集專案的 Windows Identity Foundation 3.5 和 Microsoft Identity 延伸模組，新專案則不需如此。","category":"開發活動","keywords":["增益集","SharePoint","web","新增","ODT"]},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Windows Identity Foundation 3.5","description":"Nainstaluje nebo povolí Windows Identity Foundation 3.5 a Microsoft Identity Exensions pro existující projekty doplňků pro SharePoint, nevyžaduje se pro nové projekty.","category":"Vývojové aktivity","keywords":["doplněk","SharePoint","web","přidat","ODT"]},{"language":"de-de","title":"Windows Identity Foundation 3.5","description":"Installiert oder aktiviert Windows Identity Foundation 3.5 und Microsoft Identity-Erweiterungen für vorhandene SharePoint-Add-in-Projekte. Für neue Projekte nicht erforderlich.","category":"Entwicklungsaktivitäten","keywords":["Add-In","SharePoint","web","Hinzufügen","ODT"]},{"language":"es-es","title":"Windows Identity Foundation 3.5","description":"Instala o habilita Windows Identity Foundation 3.5 y Microsoft Identity Extensions para los proyectos de complementos de SharePoint existentes. No es necesario para los proyectos nuevos.","category":"Actividades de desarrollo","keywords":["complemento","SharePoint","web","agregar","ODT"]},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Windows Identity Foundation 3.5","description":"Installe ou active Windows Identity Foundation 3.5 et Microsoft Identity Extensions pour les projets de compléments SharePoint existants. Non nécessaire pour les nouveaux projets.","category":"Activités de développement","keywords":["complément","SharePoint","web","ajouter","ODT"]},{"language":"it-it","title":"Windows Identity Foundation 3.5","description":"Installa o abilita Windows Identity Foundation 3.5 e Microsoft Identity Exensions per i progetti esistenti di componente aggiuntivo per SharePoint. Non obbligatorio per i nuovi progetti.","category":"Attività di sviluppo","keywords":["componente aggiuntivo","SharePoint","Web","aggiungi","ODT"]},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Windows Identity Foundation 3.5","description":"既存の SharePoint アドイン プロジェクト用の Windows Identity Foundation 3.5 および Microsoft Identity Extensions をインストールまたは有効にします。新しいプロジェクトには必要ありません。","category":"開発作業","keywords":["アドイン","SharePoint","Web","追加","ODT"]},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Windows Identity Foundation 3.5","description":"기존 SharePoint 추가 기능 프로젝트용 Windows Identity Foundation 