atori, strumenti di compilazione e runtime"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"C++ (v142) ユニバーサル Windows プラットフォーム ツール","description":"C++ を使用してユニバーサル Windows プラットフォーム アプリケーションを作成するためのツール。","category":"コンパイラ、ビルド ツール、およびランタイム"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"C++(v142) 유니버설 Windows 플랫폼 도구","description":"C++을 사용하여 유니버설 Windows 플랫폼 애플리케이션을 빌드하는 데 사용되는 도구입니다.","category":"컴파일러, 빌드 도구 및 런타임"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Narzędzia platformy uniwersalnej systemu Windows dla języka C++ (wersja 142)","description":"Narzędzia do tworzenia aplikacji dla platformy uniwersalnej systemu Windows w języku C++.","category":"Kompilatory, narzędzia do kompilacji i środowiska uruchomieniowe"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Ferramentas da Plataforma Universal do Windows do C++ (v142)","description":"Ferramentas para criar aplicativos da Plataforma Windows Universal usando C++.","category":"Compiladores, ferramentas de build e tempos de execução"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Средства универсальной платформы Windows на C++ (версия 142)","description":"Средства для создания приложений универсальной платформы Windows на языке C++.","category":"Компиляторы, средства сборки и среды выполнения"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"C++ (v142) Evrensel Windows Platformu araçları","description":"C++ kullanarak Evrensel Windows Platformu uygulamaları oluşturmak için araçlar.","category":"Derleyiciler, derleme araçları ve çalışma zamanları"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.UWP.Xamarin","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","isUiGroup":true,"automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.Component.Netfx.Native":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Net.CoreUWP":"[1.0,2.0.0.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.Windows11SDK.22621":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.Core":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.ProTools":"[17.0,18.0)","SQLCommon":"[16.0,18.0)","SQLCommon.Targeted":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.SQL.CLR":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.Graphics":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.AppInsights.Tools":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.DiagnosticTools":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.ClickOnce":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.UWP.Common":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.UWP.Templates":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.TestTools.Templates.UWP":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.TestTools.UWP":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Universal Windows Platform tools for Xamarin","description":"Create applications for Windows 10 with the Universal Windows Platform. Windows 10 apps can run on any Windows 10 device family.","category":"Development activities"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"用于 Xamarin 的通用 Windows 平台工具","description":"使用通用 Windows 平台创建适用于 Windows 10 的应用程序。Windows 10 应用可以在任何 Windows 10 设备系列上运行。","category":"开发活动"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"適用於 Xamarin 的通用 Windows 平台工具","description":"使用通用 Windows 平台建立 Windows 10 的應用程式。Windows 10 應用程式可以在任何的 Windows 10 裝置系列上執行。","category":"開發活動"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Nástroje pro Univerzální platformu Windows pro Xamarin","description":"Pomocí Univerzální platformy Windows můžete vytvářet aplikace pro Windows 10. Aplikace pro Windows 10 se dají spouštět na libovolné řadě zařízení s Windows 10.","category":"Vývojové aktivity"},{"language":"de-de","title":"UWP-Tools für Xamarin","description":"Erstellen Sie Anwendungen für Windows 10 mit der universellen Windows-Plattform. Windows 10-Apps können auf allen Windows 10-Gerätefamilien ausgeführt werden.","category":"Entwicklungsaktivitäten"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Herramientas de la plataforma universal de Windows para Xamarin","description":"Cree aplicaciones para Windows 10 con la Plataforma universal de Windows. Las aplicaciones de Windows 10 se pueden ejecutar en cualquier familia de dispositivos con Windows 10.","category":"Actividades de desarrollo"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Outils de plateforme Windows universelle pour Xamarin","description":"Créez des applications pour Windows 10 avec la plateforme Windows universelle. Les applications Windows 10 peuvent s'exécuter sur toutes les familles d'appareils Windows 10.","category":"Activités de développement"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Strumenti della piattaforma UWP (Universal Windows Platform) per Xamarin","description":"Consente di creare applicazioni per Windows 10 con la piattaforma UWP (Universal Windows Platform). Le app di Windows 10 possono essere eseguite su qualsiasi famiglia di dispositivi Windows 10.","category":"Attività di sviluppo"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Xamarin 用ユニバーサル Windows プラットフォーム ツール","description":"ユニバーサル Windows プラットフォームを使用して Windows 10 用のアプリケーションを作成します。Windows 10 アプリは、すべての Windows 10 デバイス ファミリで実行できます。","category":"開発作業"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Xamarin용 유니버설 Windows 플랫폼 도구","description":"유니버설 Windows 플랫폼을 사용하여 Windows 10용 애플리케이션을 만듭니다. Windows 10 앱은 Windows 10 디바이스 패밀리에서만 실행됩니다.","category":"개발 작업"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Narzędzia platformy uniwersalnej systemu Windows dla oprogramowania Xamarin","description":"Twórz aplikacje dla systemu Windows 10 za pomocą platformy uniwersalnej systemu Windows. Aplikacje systemu Windows 10 można uruchamiać na dowolnych urządzeniach z systemem Windows 10.","category":"Działania programistyczne"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Ferramentas para Xamarin da Plataforma Universal do Windows","description":"Crie aplicativos para Windows 10 com a plataforma Universal do Windows. Aplicativos Windows 10 podem ser executados em qualquer família de dispositivos Windows 10.","category":"Atividades de desenvolvimento"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Средства универсальной платформы Windows для Xamarin","description":"Создавайте приложения для Windows 10 с помощью универсальной платформы Windows. Приложения Windows 10 могут работать в любом семействе устройств Windows 10.","category":"Действия разработки"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Xamarin için Evrensel Windows Platformu araçları","description":"Evrensel Windows Platformu ile Windows 10 için uygulamalar geliştirin. Windows 10 uygulamaları, Windows 10 cihaz ailesindeki tüm cihazlarda çalıştırılabilir.","category":"Geliştirme etkinlikleri"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.VC.Tools.142.x86.x64","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Component","isUiGroup":true,"automaticallyAddedByExtensionPack":false,"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualCpp.Redist.14":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.RuntimeDebug.14":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.CRT.ClickOnce.Msi":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.DIA.SDK":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualCpp.Tools.Core.x86":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.PackageGroup.StaticAnalysis":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.vcvars":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VS.VC.vcvars.X86.Shortcuts":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VS.VC.vcvars.X64.Shortcuts":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.MSBuild.x86.v142":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.VC.MSBuild.x64.v142":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.PGO.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.PGO.x86":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.PGO.x64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.CRT.Headers":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.CRT.source":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.CodeAnalysis.ConcurrencyCheck.X86":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.CodeAnalysis.Extensions.X86":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.CRT.Redist.x86":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.CRT.Redist.x86.OneCore.Desktop":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.CRT.x86.Desktop":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.CRT.x86.OneCore.Desktop":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.CRT.x86.Store":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.premium.Tools.HostX86.TargetX86":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.premium.Tools.HostX86.TargetX64":"[14.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VC.14.29.16.11.Tools.HostX86.TargetX86":"[14.0,18.