,"C#"]},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"Windows 应用 SDK C# 模板","description":"Microsoft Windows 应用 SDK Visual Studio 扩展添加了 C# 项目和项模板，以支持生成 Windows 应用和组件。","category":"编译器、生成工具和运行时","keywords":["WindowsAppSDK","WinUI","WinRT","C#"]},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Windows 應用程式 SDK C# 範本","description":"Microsoft Windows 應用程 SDK 的 Visual Studio 延伸模組新增了 C# 專案與項目範本，支援 Windows 應用程式及元件的建置。","category":"編譯器、建置工具和執行階段","keywords":["WindowsAppSDK","WinUI","WinRT","C#"]},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Šablony C# sady Windows App SDK","description":"Rozšíření Microsoft Windows App SDK Visual Studio přidává šablony projektů a položek C#, které podporují vytváření aplikací a komponent pro Windows.","category":"Kompilátory, nástroje pro sestavování buildů a moduly runtime","keywords":["WindowsAppSDK","WinUI","WinRT","C#"]},{"language":"de-de","title":"Windows App SDK C#-Vorlagen","description":"Die Erweiterung Microsoft Windows App SDK Visual Studio fügt C#-Projekt- und -Elementvorlagen hinzu, um die Erstellung von Windows-Apps und -Komponenten zu unterstützen.","category":"Compiler, Buildtools und Runtimes","keywords":["WindowsAppSDK","WinUI","WinRT","C#"]},{"language":"es-es","title":"Plantillas de C# del SDK de Aplicaciones para Windows","description":"La extensión de Visual Studio del SDK de Aplicaciones para Windows agrega plantillas de proyecto y elemento de C# para admitir la compilación de aplicaciones y componentes de Windows.","category":"Compiladores, herramientas de compilación y entornos de ejecución","keywords":["WindowsAppSDK","WinUI","WinRT","C#"]},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Modèles C# de SDK d’application Windows","description":"L'extension SDK d’application Windows Visual Studio de Microsoft ajoute des modèles de projet et d'élément C# pour prendre en charge la création d'applications et de composants Windows.","category":"Compilateurs, outils de génération et runtime","keywords":["WindowsAppSDK","WinUI","WinRT","C#"]},{"language":"it-it","title":"Modelli C# del SDK pe