ie, programowanie i testowanie rozwiązań do obsługi danych przy użyciu programu SQL Server, usługi Azure Data Lake lub usługi Hadoop.","category":"Inne zestawy narzędzi"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Processamento e armazenamentos de dados","description":"Conecte-se, desenvolva e teste as soluções de dados usando SQL Server, Azure Data Lake ou Hadoop.","category":"Outros conjuntos de ferramentas"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Хранение и обработка данных","description":"Связывание, разработка и тестирование решений по обработке данных с помощью SQL Server, Azure Data Lake и Hadoop.","category":"Другие наборы инструментов"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Veri depolama ve işleme","description":"SQL Server, Azure Data Lake veya Hadoop kullanarak veri çözümlerini bağlayın, geliştirin ve test edin.","category":"Diğer Araç Takımları"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Workload.DataBuildTools","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Workload","icon":{"mimeType":"image/svg+xml","base64":""},"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.SQL.SSDTBuildSku":{"version":"[16.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.Roslyn.LanguageServices":{"version":"[16.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"},"Microsoft.Net.ComponentGroup.TargetingPacks.Common":{"version":"[16.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"}},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Data storage and processing build tools","description":"Build SQL Server Database Projects","category":"Web & Cloud"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"数据存储和处理生成工具","description":"生成 SQL Server 数据库项目","category":"Web 和云"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"資料存放區及處理建置工具","description":"建置 SQL Server 資料庫專案","category":"Web 與雲端"},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Úložiště dat a nástroje pro sestavování zpracování","description":"Sestavení projektů databáze SQL serveru","category":"Web a cloud"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Datenspeicher und Verarbeitungsbuildtools","description":"SQL Server-Datenbankprojekte erstellen","category":"Web und Cloud"},{"