 development with Unity","description":"Create 2D and 3D games with Unity, a powerful cross-platform development environment.","category":"Gaming","keywords":["debug","Game","graphics","Unity"]},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"使用 Unity 的游戏开发","description":"通过 Unity (一个强大的跨平台开发环境)创建 2D 和 3D 游戏。","category":"游戏","keywords":["调试","游戏","图形","Unity"]},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"使用 Unity 進行遊戲開發","description":"使用強大的跨平台開發環境 Unity 建立 2D 與 3D 遊戲。","category":"遊戲","keywords":["偵錯","遊戲","graphics","Unity"]},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Vývoj her pomocí Unity","description":"Umožňuje vytvářet 2D i 3D hry v Unity, což je výkonné multiplatformní vývojové prostředí.","category":"Herní platformy","keywords":["ladit","Hra","grafika","Unity"]},{"language":"de-de","title":"Spieleentwicklung mit Unity","description":"Erstellen Sie 2D- und 3D-Spiele mit Unity, einer leistungsfähigen, plattformübergreifenden Entwicklungsumgebung.","category":"Gaming","keywords":["Debuggen","Spiel","Grafiken","Unity"]},{"language":"es-es","title":"Desarrollo de juego con Unity","description":"Crear juegos 2D y 3D con Unity, un entorno de desarrollo eficaz de varias plataformas.","category":"Juegos","keywords":["depurar","Juego","gráficos","Unity"]},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Développement de jeux avec Unity","description":"Créez des jeux 2D et 3D avec Unity, un puissant environnement de développement multiplateforme.","category":"Jeux","keywords":["déboguer","Jeu","graphismes","Unity"]},{"language":"it-it","title":"Sviluppo di giochi con Unity","description":"Consente di creare giochi 2D e 3D con Unity, un potente ambiente di sviluppo multipiattaforma.","category":"Giochi","keywords":["debug","Gioco","grafica","Unity"]},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Unity によるゲーム開発","description":"高機能なクロスプラットフォーム開発環境である Unity を使用して 2D と 3D のゲームを作成します。","category":"ゲーム","keywords":["デバッグ","ゲーム","グラフィックス","Unity"]},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Unity를 사용한 게임 개발","description":"강력한 플랫폼 간 개발 환경인 Unity로 2D 및 3D 게임을 만듭니다.","cate