 & Mobile"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"使用 C++ 的桌面开发","description":"使用所选工具(包括 MSVC、Clang、CMake 或 MSBuild)生成适用于 Windows 的现代 C++ 应用。","category":"桌面应用和移动应用"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"使用 C++ 的桌面開發","description":"使用您選擇的工具 (包括 MSVC、Clang、CMake 或 MSBuild)，建置適用於 Windows 的新式 C++ 應用程式。","category":"傳統型與行動裝置 "},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Vývoj desktopových aplikací pomocí C++","description":"Umožní vám sestavovat moderní aplikace v C++ pro Windows pomocí nástrojů, které zvolíte, včetně těchto: MSVC, Clang, CMak nebo MSBuild.","category":"Desktopové a mobilní platformy"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Desktopentwicklung mit C++","description":"Erstellen Sie moderne C++-Apps für Windows mithilfe von Tools Ihrer Wahl, darunter z. B. MSVC, Clang, CMake oder MSBuild.","category":"Desktop- und Mobilgeräte"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Desarrollo para el escritorio con C++","description":"Cree aplicaciones modernas de C++ para Windows con las herramientas que prefiera, como MSVC, Clang, CMake o MSBuild.","category":"Móviles y de escritorio"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Développement Desktop en C++","description":"Générez des applications C++ modernes pour Windows à l'aide des outils de votre choix, notamment MSVC, Clang, CMake ou MSBuild.","category":"Bureau et mobile"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Sviluppo di applicazioni desktop con C++","description":"Consente di creare app C++ moderne per Windows usando gli strumenti preferiti, inclusi MSVC, Clang, CMake o MSBuild.","category":"Desktop e dispositivi mobili"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"C++ によるデスクトップ開発","description":"MSVC、Clang、CMake、MSBuild など、選択したツールを使用して、Windows 用の最新の C++ アプリをビルドします。","category":"デスクトップとモバイル"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"C++를 사용한 데스크톱 개발","description":"MSVC, Clang, CMake 또는 MSBuild 등 선택한 도구를 사용하여 Windows용 최신 C++ 앱을 빌드합니다.","category":"데스크톱 및 모바일"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Programowanie aplikacji klasycznych w języku C++","description":"Kompiluj nowoczesne aplikacje C++ dla systemu Windows przy użyciu wybranych przez siebie narzędzi, takich jak MSVC, Clang, CMAKE lub MSBuild.","category":"Komputery i urządzenia przenośne"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Desenvolvimento para desktop com C++","description":"Crie aplicativos C++ modernos para Windows usando as ferramentas de sua escolha, incluindo MSVC, Clang, CMake ou MSBuild.","category":"Área de trabalho e Dispositivos móveis"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Разработка классических приложений на C++","description":"Создавайте современные приложения C++ для Windows с использованием любых удобных инструментов, включая MSVC, Clang, CMake или MSBuild.","category":"Классические и мобильные приложения"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"C++ ile masaüstü geliştirme","description":"Tercih ettiğiniz MSVC, Clang, CMake veya MSBuild gibi bir aracı kullanarak Windows için modern C++ uygulamaları oluşturun.","category":"Masaüstü ve Mobil"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Workload.NativeDesktop","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Workload","productArch":"x64","icon":{"mimeType":"image/svg+xml","base64":""},"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.Tools.x86.x64":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.ATL":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.ATLMFC":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Optional"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.Modules.x86.x64":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Optional"},"Component.Incredibuild":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Optional"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.NativeDesktop.Core":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.CppBuildInsights":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.Debugger.JustInTime":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.DiagnosticTools":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.CMake.Project":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"},"Mic