"projectSubType":"Windows Universal","selects":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.UWP.Xamarin"]}],"localizedResources":[{"templateId":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Breadcrumb.Xamarin.UWPSupport","projectTypeDisplayName":"Visual C#","projectSubTypeDisplayName":"Windows Universal","language":"en-us","title":"Install Windows Universal tools for C# development","description":"Tools for developing Windows Universal C# apps are available. Click OK to install."},{"templateId":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Breadcrumb.Xamarin.UWPSupport","projectTypeDisplayName":"Visual C#","projectSubTypeDisplayName":"Windows 通用","language":"en-us","title":"安装用于 C# 开发的 Windows 通用工具","description":"提供了用于开发 Windows 通用 C# 应用的工具。单击“确定”安装。"},{"templateId":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Breadcrumb.Xamarin.UWPSupport","projectTypeDisplayName":"Visual C#","projectSubTypeDisplayName":"Windows 通用","language":"zh-tw","title":"安裝適用於 C# 開發的 Windows 通用工具","description":"用於部署 Windows 通用 C# 應用程式的工具已可供使用。按一下 [確定] 即可安裝。"},{"templateId":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Breadcrumb.Xamarin.UWPSupport","projectTypeDisplayName":"Visual C#","projectSubTypeDisplayName":"Univerzální aplikace pro Windows","language":"cs-cz","title":"Nainstalovat nástroje pro vývoj univerzálních aplikací pro Windows v C#","description":"K dispozici jsou nástroje pro vývoj univerzálních aplikací pro Windows v C#. Kliknutím na OK je nainstalujte."},{"templateId":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Breadcrumb.Xamarin.UWPSupport","projectTypeDisplayName":"Visual C#","projectSubTypeDisplayName":"Universelles Windows","language":"de-de","title":"Windows Universal-Tools für die C#-Entwicklung installieren","description":"Tools für die Entwicklung universeller Windows C#-Apps sind verfügbar. Klicken Sie zum Installieren auf OK."},{"templateId":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Breadcrumb.Xamarin.UWPSupport","projectTypeDisplayName":"Visual C#","projectSubTypeDisplayName":"Windows Universal","language":"es-es","title":"Instalar las herramientas de la plataforma universal de Windows para el desarrollo con C#","description":"Hay disponibles herramientas para desarrollar aplicaciones de la plataforma universal de Windows con C#. Haga clic en Aceptar para instalarlas."},{"templateId":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Breadcrumb.Xamarin.UWPSupport","projectTypeDisplayName":"Visual C#","projectSubTypeDisplayName":"Windows Universel","language":"fr-fr","title":"Installer les outils Windows universels pour développer en C#","description":"Les outils de développement d'applications universelles Windows en C# sont disponibles. Cliquez sur OK pour effectuer l'installation."},{"templateId":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Breadcrumb.Xamarin.UWPSupport","projectTypeDisplayName":"Visual C#","projectSubTypeDisplayName":"Windows universale","language":"it-it","title":"Installare gli strumenti Windows universali per lo sviluppo C#","description":"Gli strumenti per sviluppare app C# Windows universali sono disponibili. Fare clic su OK per installarli."},{"templateId":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Breadcrumb.Xamarin.UWPSupport","projectTypeDisplayName":"Visual C#","projectSubTypeDisplayName":"Windows ユニバーサル","language":"ja-jp","title":"C# 開発用の Windows ユニバーサル ツールをインストールする","description":"Windows ユニバーサル C# アプリを開発するためのツールを利用できます。インストールするには、[OK] をクリックしてください。"},{"templateId":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Breadcrumb.Xamarin.UWPSupport","projectTypeDisplayName":"Visual C#","projectSubTypeDisplayName":"Windows 유니버설","language":"ko-kr","title":"C# 개발용 Windows 유니버설 도구 설치","description":"Windows 유니버설 C# 앱 개발 도구를 사용할 수 있습니다. 설치하려면 [확인]을 클릭합니다."},{"templateId":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Breadcrumb.Xamarin.UWPSupport","projectTypeDisplayName":"Visual C#","projectSubTypeDisplayName":"Platforma uniwersalna systemu Windows","language":"pl-pl","title":"Zainstaluj narzędzia uniwersalne systemu Windows do programowania w języku C#","description":"Dostępne są narzędzia do tworzenia aplikacji uniwersalnych systemu Windows w języku C#. Kliknij przycisk OK, aby zainstalować."},{"templateId":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Breadcrumb.Xamarin.UWPSupport","projectTypeDisplayName":"Visual C#","projectSubTypeDisplayName":"Universal do Windows","language":"pt-br","title":"Instale as ferramentas Universais do Windows para desenvolvimento em C#","description":"Ferramentas para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos Universais do Windows em C# estão disponíveis. Clique em OK para instalar."},{"templateId":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Breadcrumb.Xamarin.UWPSupport","projectTypeDisplayName":"Visual C#","projectSubTypeDisplayName":"Универсальное приложение для Windows","language":"ru-ru","title":"Установить универсальные инструменты Windows для разработчиков C#","description":"Доступны средства для разработки универсальных приложений для Windows на C#. Чтобы установить их, нажмите кнопку ''ОК''."},{"templateId":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Breadcrumb.Xamarin.UWPSupport","projectTypeDisplayName":"Visual C#","projectSubTypeDisplayName":"Windows Evrensel","language":"tr-tr","title":"C# geliştirme için Windows Evrensel araçlarını yükle","description":"Windows Evrensel C# uygulamaları geliştirmeye yönelik araçlar kullanıma sunuldu. Yüklemek için Tamam'a tıklayın."}]},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":".NET Multi-platform App UI development","description":"Build Android, iOS, Windows, and Mac apps from a single codebase using C# with .NET MAUI.","category":"Desktop & Mobile"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":".NET Multi-platform App UI 开发","description":"使用 C# 和 .NET MAUI 从单个基本代码库生成 Android、iOS、Windows 和 Mac 应用。","category":"桌面应用和移动应用"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"NET Multi-Platform App UI 開發","description":"使用 C# 與 .NET MAUI，從單一程式碼基底建置 Android、iOS、Windows 和 Mac 應用程式。","category":"傳統型與行動裝置 "},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Vývoj .NET Multi-Platform App UI","description":"Vytvářejte aplikace pro Android, iOS, Windows a Mac z jediné kódové báze pomocí jazyka C# s .NET MAUI.","category":"Desktopové a mobilní platformy"},{"language":"de-de","title":".NET Multi-Platform App UI-Entwicklung","description":"Erstellen Sie Android-, iOS-, Windows- und Mac-Apps aus einer einzigen Codebasis mithilfe von C# mit .NET MAUI.","category":"Desktop- und Mobilgeräte"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Desarrollo de la interfaz de usuario de aplicaciones multiplataforma de .NET","description":"Cree aplicaciones de Android, iOS, Windows y Mac desde un único código base con C# mediante .NET MAUI.","category":"Móviles y de escritorio"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Développement .NET Multi-Platform App UI","description":"Créez des applications Android, iOS, Windows et Mac à partir d'une base de code unique en utilisant C# avec .NET MAUI.","category":"Bureau et mobile"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Sviluppo dell'interfaccia utente di app .NET multipiattaforma","description":"Consente di creare app Android, iOS, Windows e Mac da una singola codebase usando C# con .NET MAUI.","category":"Desktop e dispositivi mobili"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":".NET マルチプラットフォーム アプリの UI 開発","description":"C# と .NET MAUI を使用して、単一のコードベースから Android、iOS、Windows、Mac アプリをビルドします。","category":"デスクトップとモバイル"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":".NET Multi-Platform App UI 개발","description":".NET MAUI와 함께 C#을 사용하여 단일 코드베이스에서 Android, iOS, Windows 및 Mac용 앱을 빌드합니다.","category":"데스크톱 및 모바일"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Programowanie .NET Multi-Platform App UI","description":"Kompiluj aplikacje dla systemów Android, iOS, Windows i Mac z jednej bazy kodu za pomocą języka C# z poziomu platformy .NET MAUI.","category":"Komputery i urządzenia przenośne"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Desenvolvimento de .NET Multi-Platform App UI","description":"Crie aplicativos Android, iOS, Windows e Mac a partir de uma única base de código usando C# com .NET MAUI.","category":"Área de trabalho e Dispositivos móveis"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Разработка с помощью .NET Multi-Platform App UI","description":"Создавайте приложения Android, iOS, Windows и Mac из общей базы кода на языке C# с помощью .NET MAUI.","category":"Классические и мобильные приложения"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":".NET Multi-platform App UI geliştirmesi","description":".NET MAUI ile C# kullanarak tek bir kod temelinden Android, iOS, Windows ve Mac uygulamaları oluşturun.","category":"Masaüstü ve Mobil"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Workload.NetWeb","version":"17.13.35730.67","type":"Workload","productArch":"arm64","icon":{"mimeType":"image/svg+xml","base64":""},"dependencies":{"Microsoft.Net.ComponentGroup.DevelopmentPrerequisites":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.Web":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.KeychainCredentialHelper":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Net.ComponentGroup.4.8.DeveloperTools":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.AspNet_341893570":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.AspNet","version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.ProfessionalX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.EnterpriseX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise"]},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.Web.CloudTools":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.IntelliTrace.FrontEnd_1779377902":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.IntelliTrace.FrontEnd","version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.EnterpriseX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise"]},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.DiagnosticTools":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.EntityFramework":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.LiveUnitTesting_1779377902":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.LiveUnitTesting","version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.EnterpriseX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise"]},"Component.Microsoft.VisualStudio.LiveShare.2022":{"version":"","type":"Recommended"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.WslDebugging":{"vers