 Docker 支持的容器生成 Web 应用程序。","longDescription":"使用 ASP.NET Core、ASP.NET 和基于标准的 Web 技术(包括 HTML、JavaScript、CSS 和 JSON)构建 Web 应用程序。还包含用于实现应用程序容器化的工具，包括 Docker 支持。","category":"Web 和云","keywords":["html","CSS","Javascript/JS","JS","Web","网站","网站","WebAPI","Web API","MVC","Razor","Web Forms","网页","aspx","cshtml","vbhtml","ASP","核心",".NET","Typescript","样式表","Azure","Bower","Npm","Aspire"]},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"ASP.NET 與網頁程式開發","description":"使用 ASP.NET Core、ASP.NET、HTML/JavaScript 及容器 (包括 Docker 支援) 建立 Web 應用程式。","longDescription":"使用 ASP.NET、 ASP.NET Core 及符合標準的網路技術 (包括 HTML、JavaScript、CSS 及 JSON) 建置 Web 應用程式， 並包含應用程式容器化的工具，包括 Docker 支援。","category":"Web 與雲端","keywords":["HTML","CSS","Javascript/JS","JS","Web","網站","網站","WebAPI","Web API","MVC","Razor","Web Forms","Web Pages","aspx","cshtml","vbhtml","ASP","核心",".NET","Typescript","樣式表","Azure","Bower","Npm","Aspire"]},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Vývoj pro ASP.NET a web","description":"Umožňuje sestavovat webové aplikace pomocí technologií ASP.NET Core, ASP.NET, HTML/JavaScript a Containers včetně podpory Dockeru.","longDescription":"Umožňuje sestavovat webové aplikace pomocí technologií ASP.NET Core a ASP.NET a standardních webových technologií, jako jsou HTML, JavaScript, CSS a JSON. Obsahuje také nástroje pro uzavření aplikace do kontejneru včetně podpory Dockeru.","category":"Web a cloud","keywords":["HTML","CSS","Javascript/JS","JS","Web","Web","Web","WebAPI","Webové rozhraní API","MVC","Razor","Web Forms","Webové stránky","aspx","cshtml","vbhtml","ASP","Jádro",".NET","TypeScript","Šablona stylů","Azure","Bower","Npm","Aspire"]},{"language":"de-de","title":"ASP.NET und Webentwicklung","description":"Hiermit erstellen Sie Webanwendungen mit ASP.NET Core, ASP.NET, HTML/JavaScript und Containern, einschließlich Unterstützung für Docker.","longDescription":"Hiermit erstellen Sie Webanwendungen mit ASP.NET Core, ASP.NET und standardbasierten Webtechnologien wie z. B. HTML, JavaScript, CSS und JSON. Ebenfalls enthalten sind Tools für die Umstellung Ihrer Anwendung auf Container, einschließlich Unterstützung für Docker.","category":"Web und Cloud","keywords":["HTML","CSS","Javascript/JS","JS","Web","Website","Website","WebAPI","Web-API","MVC","Razor","Web Forms","Web Pages","aspx","cshtml","vbhtml","ASP","Kern",".NET","Typescript","Stylesheet","Azure","Bower","npm","Aspire"]},{"language":"es-es","title":"Desarrollo de ASP.NET y web","description":"Compila aplicaciones web con ASP.NET Core, ASP.NET, HTML/JavaScript y contenedores, e incluye compatibilidad con Docker.","longDescription":"Compila aplicaciones web mediante ASP.NET, ASP.NET Core y tecnologías web basadas en estándares, como HTML, JavaScript, CSS y JSON. Cuenta también con herramientas para incluir la aplicación en contenedores, además de ofrecer compatibilidad con Docker.","category":"Web y nube","keywords":["HTML","CSS","Javascript/JS","JS","Web","WebSite","Sitio web","WebAPI","API web","MVC","Razor","Formularios Web Forms","Web Pages","aspx","cshtml","vbhtml","ASP","Principal",".NET","Typescript","Hoja de estilos","Azure","Bower","Npm","Aspire"]},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Développement web et ASP.NET","description":"Générez des applications web en utilisant ASP.NET Core, ASP.NET, HTML/JavaScript ainsi que des conteneurs prenant notamment en charge Docker.","longDescription":"Générez des applications web en utilisant ASP.NET Core, ASP.NET ainsi que des technologies web basées sur des standards tels que HTML, JavaScript, CSS et JSON. Comprend également des outils pour conteneuriser votre application en incluant notamment la prise en charge de Docker.","category":"Web et cloud","keywords":["HTML","CSS","Javascript/JS","JS","Web","Siteweb","Site web","WebAPI","API web","MVC","Razor","Web Forms","Pages web","aspx","cshtml","vbhtml","ASP","Principal",".NET","TypeScript","Feuille de style","Azure","Bower","Npm","Aspire"]},{"language":"it-it","title":"Sviluppo ASP.NET e Web","description":"Consente di creare applicazioni Web con ASP.NET Core, ASP.NET, HTML/JavaScript e contenitori, tra cui il supporto Docker.","longDescription":"Consente di creare applicazioni Web con ASP.NET Core, ASP.NET e tecnologie Web basate su standard, tra cui HTML, JavaScript, CSS e JSON. Include anche gli strumenti per inserire l'applicazione in un contenitore, tra cui il supporto Docker.","category":"Web e cloud","keywords":["HTML","CSS","JavaScript/HTML","JS","Web","Sito Web","Sito Web","WebAPI","API Web","MVC","Razor","Web Forms","Pagine Web","aspx","cshtml","vbhtml","ASP","Base",".NET","TypeScript","Foglio di stile","Azure","Bower","Npm","Aspirare"]},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"ASP.NET と Web 開発","description":"ASP.NET Core、ASP.NET、HTML/JavaScript、コンテナー (Docker サポートなど) を使用して、Web アプリケーションをビルドします。","longDescription":"ASP.NET Core、ASP.NET、標準ベースの Web テクノロジ (HTML、JavaScript、CSS、JSON など) を使用して、Web アプリケーションをビルドします。また、Docker のサポートを含め、アプリケーションをコンテナー化するツールも含まれます。","category":"Web & クラウド","keywords":["HTML","CSS","Javascript/JS","JS","Web","Web サイト","Web サイト","WebAPI","Web API","MVC","Razor","Web Forms","Web ページ","aspx","cshtml","vbhtml","ASP","コア",".NET","TypeScript","スタイルシート","Azure","Bower","Npm","Aspire"]},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"ASP.NET 및 웹 개발","description":"Docker 지원이 포함된 ASP.NET Core, ASP.NET, HTML/JavaScript 및 컨테이너를 사용하여 웹 애플리케이션을 빌드합니다.","longDescription":"ASP.NET Core, ASP.NET 및 HTML, JavaScript, CSS, JSON 등의 표준 기반 웹 기술을 사용하여 웹 애플리케이션을 빌드합니다. Docker 지원을 비롯하여, 애플리케이션을 컨테이너화하기 위한 도구도 포함됩니다.","category":"웹 및 클라우드","keywords":["HTML","CSS","Javascript/JS","JS","웹","웹 사이트","웹 사이트","WebAPI","Web API","MVC","Razor","Web Forms","웹 페이지","aspx","cshtml","vbhtml","ASP","코어",".NET","Typescript","스타일시트","Azure","Bower","npm","Aspire"]},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Opracowywanie zawartości dla platformy ASP.NET i sieci Web","description":"Twórz aplikacje internetowe dla wielu platform przy użyciu technologii ASP.NET Core, ASP.NET, HTML/JavaScript i kontenerów, włącznie z obsługą platformy Docker.","longDescription":"Twórz aplikacje internetowe za pomocą platformy ASP.NET Core, ASP.NET i technologii internetowych opartych na standardach, w tym HTML, JavaScript, CSS i JSON. Zawiera także narzędzia służące do umieszczania aplikacji w kontenerze, włącznie z obsługą platformy Docker.","category":"Sieć Web i chmura","keywords":["HTML","CSS","Javascript/JS","JS","Sieć Web","Witryna sieci Web","Witryna sieci Web","Interfejs API sieci Web","Interfejs API sieci Web","MVC","Razor","Web Forms","Strony sieci Web","aspx","cshtml","vbhtml","ASP","Rdzeń",".NET","Typescript","Arkusz stylów","Azure","Bower","Npm","Aspire"]},{"language":"pt-br","title":"ASP.NET e desenvolvimento Web","description":"Crie aplicativos Web usando ASP.NET Core, ASP.NET, HTML/JavaScript e Contêineres, incluindo suporte a Docker.","longDescription":"Crie aplicativos Web usando ASP.NET Core, ASP.NET e tecnologias Web baseadas em padrões, incluindo HTML, JavaScript, CSS e JSON. Inclui também ferramentas para colocar o seu aplicativo em contêineres, incluindo suporte a Docker.","category":"Web e Nuvem","keywords":["HTML","CSS","Javascript/JS","JS","Web","Site","Site","WebAPI","API Web","MVC","Razor","Web Forms","Páginas da Web","aspx","cshtml","vbhtml","ASP","Core",".NET","Typescript","Folha de estilos","Azure","Bower","Npm","Aspire"]},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"ASP.NET и разработка веб-приложений","description":"Создание веб-приложений с использованием ASP.NET Core, ASP.NET, HTML/JavaScript и контейнеров, включая поддержку Docker.","longDescription":"Создание веб-приложений с использованием ASP.NET Core, ASP.NET и стандартных веб-технологий, включая HTML, JavaScript, CSS и JSON. Также содержит инструменты для создания контейнерных приложений, включая поддержку Docker.","category":"Веб-разработка и облако","keywords":["HTML","CSS","Javascript/JS","JS","Веб","Веб-сайт","Веб-сайт","Веб-API","Веб-API","MVC","Razor","Веб-формы","Веб-страницы","aspx","cshtml","vbhtml","ASP","Core",".NET","Typescript","Таблица стилей","Azure","Bower","Npm","Aspire"]},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"ASP.NET ve web geliştirme","description":"Docker desteği dahil olmak üzere ASP.NET Core, ASP.NET, HTML/JavaScript ve Kapsayıcıları kullanarak web uygulamaları derleyin.","longDescription":"ASP.NET Core ve ASP.NET'in yanı sıra HTML, JavaScript, CSS ve JSON gibi standartlara dayalı web teknolojilerini kullanarak web uygulamaları derleyin. Ayrıca Docker desteği dahil olmak üzere uygulamanızı kapsayıcılı hale getirmek için kullanılan araçlar içerir.","category":"Web ve Bulut","keywords":["HTML","CSS","Javascript/JS","JS","Web","WebSite","Web Sitesi","WebAPI","Web API'si","MVC","Razor","Web Forms","Web Pages","aspx","cshtml","vbhtml","ASP","Çekirdek",".NET","Typescript","Stil sayfası","Azure","Bower","Npm","Aspire"]}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Workload.NetWeb","version":"17.13.35730.67","type":"Workload","productArch":"x64","icon":{"mimeType":"image/svg+xml","base64":""},"dependencies":{"Microsoft.Net.ComponentGroup.DevelopmentPrerequisites":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.Web":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.KeychainCredentialHelper":"[16.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Net.ComponentGroup.4.8.DeveloperTools":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.AspNet_341893570":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.AspNet","version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.ProfessionalX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Professional","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.EnterpriseX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise"]},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.Web.CloudTools":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.IntelliTrace.FrontEnd_1779377902":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.IntelliTrace.FrontEnd","version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.EnterpriseX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise"]},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Componen