ols of your choice, including MSVC, Clang, CMake, or MSBuild.","category":"Desktop & Mobile"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"使用 C++ 的桌面开发","description":"使用所选工具(包括 MSVC、Clang、CMake 或 MSBuild)生成适用于 Windows 的现代 C++ 应用。","category":"桌面应用和移动应用"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"使用 C++ 的桌面開發","description":"使用您選擇的工具 (包括 MSVC、Clang、CMake 或 MSBuild)，建置適用於 Windows 的新式 C++ 應用程式。","category":"傳統型與行動裝置 "},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Vývoj desktopových aplikací pomocí C++","description":"Umožní vám sestavovat moderní aplikace v C++ pro Windows pomocí nástrojů, které zvolíte, včetně těchto: MSVC, Clang, CMak nebo MSBuild.","category":"Desktopové a mobilní platformy"},{"language":"de-de","title":"Desktopentwicklung mit C++","description":"Erstellen Sie moderne C++-Apps für Windows mithilfe von Tools Ihrer Wahl, darunter z. B. MSVC, Clang, CMake oder MSBuild.","category":"Desktop- und Mobilgeräte"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Desarrollo para el escritorio con C++","description":"Cree aplicaciones modernas de C++ para Windows con las herramientas que prefiera, como MSVC, Clang, CMake o MSBuild.","category":"Móviles y de escritorio"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Développement Desktop en C++","description":"Générez des applications C++ modernes pour Windows à l'aide des outils de votre choix, notamment MSVC, Clang, CMake ou MSBuild.","category":"Bureau et mobile"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Sviluppo di applicazioni desktop con C++","description":"Consente di creare app C++ moderne per Windows usando gli strumenti preferiti, inclusi MSVC, Clang, CMake o MSBuild.","category":"Desktop e dispositivi mobili"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"C++ によるデスクトップ開発","description":"MSVC、Clang、CMake、MSBuild など、選択したツールを使用して、Windows 用の最新の C++ アプリをビルドします。","category":"デスクトップとモバイル"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"C++를 사용한 데스크톱 개발","description":"MSVC, Clang, CMake 또는 MSBuild 등 선택한 도구를 사용하여 Windows용 최신 C++ 앱을 빌드합니다.","category":"데스크톱 및 모바일"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Programowanie aplikacji klasycznych w języku C++","description":"Kompiluj nowoczesne aplikacje C++ dla systemu Windows przy użyciu wybranych przez siebie narzędzi, takich jak MSVC, Clang, CMAKE lub MSBuild.","category":"Komputery i urządzenia przenośne"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Desenvolvimento para desktop com C++","description":"Crie aplicativos C++ modernos para Windows usando as ferramentas de sua escolha, incluindo MSVC, Clang, CMake ou MSBuild.","category":"Área de trabalho e Dispositivos móveis"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Разработка классических приложений на C++","description":"Создавайте современные приложения C++ для Windows с использованием любых удобных инструментов, включая MSVC, Clang, CMake или MSBuild.","category":"Классические и мобильные приложения"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"C++ ile masaüstü geliştirme","description":"Tercih ettiğiniz MSVC, Clang, CMake veya MSBuild gibi bir aracı kullanarak Windows için modern C++ uygulamaları oluşturun.","category":"Masaüstü ve Mobil"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Workload.VisualStudioExtension","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Workload","icon":{"mimeType":"image/svg+xml","base64":""},"dependencies":{"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VSSDK":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.VisualStudioExtension.Prerequisites":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.DiagnosticTools":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.IntelliCode":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.IntelliTrace.FrontEnd_1779377902":{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.IntelliTrace.FrontEnd","version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended","when":["Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.EnterpriseX86","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Product.Enterprise"]},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.TextTemplating":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"},"Microsoft.Component.CodeAnalysis.SDK":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"},"Component.VisualStudio.GitHub.Copilot":{"version":"","type":"Recommended"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.AppInsights.Tools":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Optional"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.DslTools":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Optional"}},"projectClassifiers":[{"id":"bf4b574b-f331-34ed-9327-6279d93b631a","extension":"csproj","factoryGuid":"{FAE04EC0-301F-11D3-BF4B-00C04F79EFBC}","matcherData":[{"type":"Property","capabilityType":"TypeGuid","projectPropertyId":"ProjectTypeGuids","regExMatchSource":"{82b43b9b-a64c-4715-b499-d71e9ca2bd60}"}],"matcherId":"MSBuild.Generic","appliesTo":"TypeGuid","priority":100},{"id":"e3ec01ba-9d72-309c-876b-3b504beab5f6","extension":"vbproj","factoryGuid":"{F184B08F-C81C-45F6-A57F-5ABD9991F28F}","matcherData":[{"type":"Property","capabilityType":"TypeGuid","projectPropertyId":"ProjectTypeGuids","regExMatchSource":"{82b43b9b-a64c-4715-b499-d71e9ca2bd60}"}],"matcherId":"MSBuild.Generic","appliesTo":"TypeGuid","priority":100}],"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":"Visual Studio extension development","description":"Create add-ons and extensions for Visual Studio, including new commands, code analyzers and tool windows.","longDescription":"Begin extending Visual Studio with the help of the Visual Studio SDK. Use the development tools and templates to build extensions and publish to the Marketplace.","category":"Other Toolsets","keywords":["extensibility","extend","plugin","add-on"]},{"language":"zh-cn","title":"Visual Studio 扩展开发","description":"为 Visual Studio 创建加载项和扩展，包括新命令、代码分析器和工具窗口。","longDescription":"在 Visual Studio SDK 的帮助下开始扩展 Visual Studio。使用开发工具和模板来生成扩展并发布到 Marketplace 上。","category":"其他工具集","keywords":["扩展性","扩展","插件","加载项"]},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"Visual Studio 擴充功能開發","description":"建立適用於 Visual Studio 的增益集與擴充功能，包括新的命令、程式碼分析器與工具視窗。","longDescription":"透過 Visual Studio SDK 的協助，開始擴充 Visual Studio。使用開發工具與範本建置擴充功能，並發佈至 Marketplace。","category":"其他工具組","keywords":["擴充性","擴充","外掛程式","附加元件"]},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Vývoj rozšíření sady Visual Studio","description":"Umožňuje vytvářet doplňky a rozšíření pro Visual Studio, včetně nových příkazů, analyzátorů kódu a panelů nástrojů.","longDescription":"Začněte rozšiřovat sadu Visual Studio pomocí sady Visual Studio SDK. S použitím vývojových nástrojů a šablon vytvořte rozšíření a publikujte je na webu Marketplace.","category":"Další sady nástrojů","keywords":["rozšiřitelnost","rozšíření","modul plug-in","doplněk"]},{"language":"de-de","title":"Visual Studio-Extensionentwicklung","description":"Erstellen Sie Add-Ons und Extensions für Visual Studio, z. B. neue Befehle, Codeanalysetools und Toolfenster.","longDescription":"Beginnen Sie mithilfe des Visual Studio SDK, Visual Studio zu erweitern. Verwenden Sie die Entwicklungstools und Vorlagen, um Extensions zu erstellen und diese in Marketplace zu veröffentlichen.","category":"Andere Toolsets","keywords":["Erweiterbarkeit","erweitern","Plug-In","Add-On"]},{"language":"es-es","title":"Desarrollo de extensiones de Visual Studio","description":"Cree complementos y extensiones para Visual Studio, incluidos nuevos comandos, analizadores de código y ventanas de herramientas.","longDescription":"Comience a ampliar Visual Studio con ayuda de Visual Studio SDK. Use las plantillas y herramientas de desarrollo para compilar extensiones y publicarlas en Marketplace.","category":"Otros conjuntos de herramientas","keywords":["extensibilidad","extender","complemento","complemento"]},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Développement d'extension Visual Studio","description":"Créez des composants additionnels et des extensions pour Visual Studio, notamment de nouvelles commandes, des analyseurs de code et des fenêtres Outil.","longDescription":"Commencez à étendre Visual Studio à l'aide du SDK Visual Studio. Utilisez les outils de développement et les modèles pour générer des extensions et les publier sur Marketplace.","category":"Autres ensembles d'outils","keywords":["extensibilité","étendre","plug-in","composant additionnel"]},{"language":"it-it","title":"Sviluppo di estensioni di Visual Studio","description":"Consente di creare componenti aggiuntivi ed estensioni per Visual Studio, includi nuovi comandi, analizzatori del codice e finestre degli strumenti.","longDescription":"Per iniziare a estendere Visual Studio, è possibile usare Visual Studio SDK. Gli strumenti di sviluppo e i modelli disponibili consentono di compilare estensioni e pubblicarle nel Marketplace.","category":"Altri set di strumenti","keywords":["estendibilità","estendere","plug-in","componente aggiuntivo"]},{"language":"ja-jp","title":"Visual Studio 拡張機能の開発","description":"Visual Studio 用のアドオンや拡張機能 (新しいコマンド、コード アナライザー、ツール ウィンドウを含みます) を作成します。","longDescription":"Visual Studio SDK のヘルプを使用して Visual Studio の拡張を開始します。開発ツールとテンプレートを使用して、拡張機能を構築し、Marketplace に公開します。","category":"他のツールセット","keywords":["拡張性","拡張","プラグイン","アドオン"]},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"Visual Studio 확장 개발","description":"새 명령, 코드 분석기 및 도구 창을 포함하여 Visual Studio용 추가 기능 및 확장 기능을 만듭니다.","longDescription":"Visual Studio SDK를 사용하여 Visual Studio 확장을 시작하세요. 개발 도구 및 템플릿을 사용하여 확장을 빌드하고 Marketplace에 게시하세요.","category":"기타 도구 집합","keywords":["확장성","확장","플러그 인","추가 기능"]},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Programowanie rozszerzeń programu Visual Studio","description":"Twórz dodatki i rozszerzenia dla programu Visual Studio, w tym nowe polecenia, analizatory kodu i okna narzędzi.","longDescription":"Rozpocznij rozszerzanie programu Visual Studio przy pomocy zestawu SDK programu Visual Studio. Użyj narzędzi i szablonów programistycznych, aby tworzyć rozszerzenia i publikować je w portalu Marketplace.","category":"Inne zestawy narzędzi","keywords":["rozszerzalność","rozszerz","wtyczka","dodatek"]},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Desenvolvimento de extensão do Visual Studio","description":"Crie suplementos e extensões para Visual Studio, incluindo novos comandos, analisadores de código e janelas de ferramentas.","longDescription":"Comece a ampliar o Visual Studio com a ajuda do SDK do Visual Studio. Use os modelos e as ferramentas de desenvolvimento para criar extensões e publicar no Marketplace.","category":"Outros conjuntos de ferramentas","keywords":["extensibilidade","estender","plug-in","complemento"]},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Разработка расширений Visual Studio","description":"Создавайте надстройки и расширения для Visual Studio, включая новые команды, анализаторы кода и окна инструментов.","longDescription":"Начните расширение Visual Studio с помощью пакета SDK для Visual Studio. Используйте средства и шаблоны разработки для создания расширений и их публикации в Marketplace.","category":"Другие наборы инструментов","keywords":["расширяемость","расширить","подключаемый модуль","надстройка"]},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Visual Studio Uzantısı geliştirme","description":"Visual Studio için yeni komutlar, kod çözümleyicileri ve araç pencereleri gibi eklenti ve uzantılar oluşturun.","longDescription":"Visual Studio SDK'sının yardımıyla Visual Studio'yu genişletmeye başlayın. Uzantılar oluşturmak ve Market'te yayımlamak için geliştirme araçlarını ve şablonları kullanın.","category":"Diğer Araç Takımları","keywords":["genişletilebilirlik","genişlet","eklenti","eklenti"]}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Workload.VisualStudioExtensionBuildTools","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Workload","icon":{"mimeType":"image/svg+xml","base64":""},"dependencies":{"Component.Dotfuscator":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Optional"},"Microsoft.Component.VC.Runtime.OSSupport":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Optional"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.ATL":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Optional"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.ATLMFC":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Optional"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.Tools.x86.x64":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Optional"},"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VSSDKBuildTools":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.VisualStudioExtensionBuildTools.Prerequisites":"[17.0,18.0)"},"localiz