めの MSBuild タスクとターゲット。","category":"Web & クラウド"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":"웹 개발 빌드 도구","description":"웹 애플리케이션을 빌드하기 위한 MSBuild 작업 및 대상입니다.","category":"웹 및 클라우드"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Narzędzia kompilacji do opracowywania zawartości sieci Web","description":"Zadania i elementy docelowe programu MSBuild służące do tworzenia aplikacji internetowych.","category":"Sieć Web i chmura"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Ferramentas de build de desenvolvimento Web","description":"Tarefas e destinos MSBuild para criação de aplicativos Web.","category":"Web e Nuvem"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Веб-инструменты сборки и разработки","description":"Задачи и целевые объекты MSBuild для сборки веб-приложений.","category":"Веб-разработка и облако"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":"Web geliştirme derleme araçları","description":"Web uygulamaları oluşturmaya yönelik MSBuild görevleri ve hedefleri.","category":"Web ve Bulut"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Workload.XamarinBuildTools","version":"17.13.35710.127","type":"Workload","icon":{"mimeType":"image/svg+xml","base64":""},"dependencies":{"Component.Android.SDK.MAUI":{"version":"[17.0,18.0)","type":"Recommended"},"Component.OpenJDK":"[17.0,18.0)","Xamarin.VisualStudio.Apple.Sdk":"[4.6,18.0)","Xamarin.Android.Sdk":"[7.1,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.ComponentGroup.UWP.BuildTools":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Component.MSBuild":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.NuGet.BuildTools":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Net.Component.4.8.SDK":"[17.0,18.0)","Microsoft.Net.Cumulative.TargetingPack.Resources":"4.6.0.0","Microsoft.Net.Component.4.6.1.TargetingPack":"[17.0,18.0)","android":"[30.0,99.0)","ios":"[15.0,99.0)","maccatalyst":"[15.0,99.0)","maui.blazor":"[6.0,99.0)","maui.windows":"[6.0,99.0)"},"localizedResources":[{"language":"en-us","title":".NET Multi-platform App UI development","description":"Build Android, iOS, Windows, and Mac apps from a single codebase using C# with .NET MAUI.","category":"Desktop & Mobile"},{"language":"zh-cn","title":".NET Multi-platform App UI 开发","description":"使用 C# 和 .NET MAUI 从单个基本代码库生成 Android、iOS、Windows 和 Mac 应用。","category":"桌面应用和移动应用"},{"language":"zh-tw","title":"NET Multi-Platform App UI 開發","description":"使用 C# 與 .NET MAUI，從單一程式碼基底建置 Android、iOS、Windows 和 Mac 應用程式。","category":"傳統型與行動裝置 "},{"language":"cs-cz","title":"Vývoj .NET Multi-Platform App UI","description":"Vytvářejte aplikace pro Android, iOS, Windows a Mac z jediné kódové báze pomocí jazyka C# s .NET MAUI.","category":"Desktopové a mobilní platformy"},{"language":"de-de","title":".NET Multi-Platform App UI-Entwicklung","description":"Erstellen Sie Android-, iOS-, Windows- und Mac-Apps aus einer einzigen Codebasis mithilfe von C# mit .NET MAUI.","category":"Desktop- und Mobilgeräte"},{"language":"es-es","title":"Desarrollo de la interfaz de usuario de aplicaciones multiplataforma de .NET","description":"Cree aplicaciones de Android, iOS, Windows y Mac desde un único código base con C# mediante .NET MAUI.","category":"Móviles y de escritorio"},{"language":"fr-fr","title":"Développement .NET Multi-Platform App UI","description":"Créez des applications Android, iOS, Windows et Mac à partir d'une base de code unique en utilisant C# avec .NET MAUI.","category":"Bureau et mobile"},{"language":"it-it","title":"Sviluppo dell'interfaccia utente di app .NET multipiattaforma","description":"Consente di creare app Android, iOS, Windows e Mac da una singola codebase usando C# con .NET MAUI.","category":"Desktop e dispositivi mobili"},{"language":"ja-jp","title":".NET マルチプラットフォーム アプリの UI 開発","description":"C# と .NET MAUI を使用して、単一のコードベースから Android、iOS、Windows、Mac アプリをビルドします。","category":"デスクトップとモバイル"},{"language":"ko-kr","title":".NET Multi-Platform App UI 개발","description":".NET MAUI와 함께 C#을 사용하여 단일 코드베이스에서 Android, iOS, Windows 및 Mac용 앱을 빌드합니다.","category":"데스크톱 및 모바일"},{"language":"pl-pl","title":"Programowanie .NET Multi-Platform App UI","description":"Kompiluj aplikacje dla systemów Android, iOS, Windows i Mac z jednej bazy kodu za pomocą języka C# z poziomu platformy .NET MAUI.","category":"Komputery i urządzenia przenośne"},{"language":"pt-br","title":"Desenvolvimento de .NET Multi-Platform App UI","description":"Crie aplicativos Android, iOS, Windows e Mac a partir de uma única base de código usando C# com .NET MAUI.","category":"Área de trabalho e Dispositivos móveis"},{"language":"ru-ru","title":"Разработка с помощью .NET Multi-Platform App UI","description":"Создавайте приложения Android, iOS, Windows и Mac из общей базы кода на языке C# с помощью .NET MAUI.","category":"Классические и мобильные приложения"},{"language":"tr-tr","title":".NET Multi-platform App UI geliştirmesi","description":".NET MAUI ile C# kullanarak tek bir kod temelinden Android, iOS, Windows ve Mac uygulamaları oluşturun.","category":"Masaüstü ve Mobil"}]},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.WslDebugging","version":"17.13.20241122.1","type":"Vsix","productArch":"neutral","payloads":[{"fileName":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.WslDebugging.vsix","sha256":"21a2248f46b7e5fc45596878ba10f1bb3da62da5ab126b4f1891ef8f64120a5d","size":1779386,"url":"https://download.visualstudio.microsoft.com/download/pr/8aee8923-4fac-42c5-8975-d763d3b9cd85/21a2248f46b7e5fc45596878ba10f1bb3da62da5ab126b4f1891ef8f64120a5d/Microsoft.VisualStudio.WslDebugging.vsix","signer":{"$ref":"1"}}],"vsixId":"82e81c51-04b7-4681-91bb-87b6cf7c516b","extensionDir":"[installdir]\\Common7\\IDE\\Extensions\\i3bu2fun.rq0","installSizes":{"targetDrive":3909212}},{"id":"Microsoft.VisualStudio.Xamarin.Forms","version":"17.13.0","type":"Vsix","payloads":[{"fileName":"Xamarin.Templates.17.13.0.vsix","sha256":"203f8eec1d8d5f13dd23bdfac39987c2c6db841fe73e54e74319880d9da14b35","size":2526268,"url":"https://download.visualstudio.microsoft.com/download/pr/db62ee69-f8f3-4b5d-99e1-08373b9e1695/203f8eec1d8d5f13dd23bdfac39987c2c6db841fe73e54e74319880d9da14b35/Xamarin.Templates.17.13.0.vsix","signer":{"$ref":"1"}}],"vsixId":"Xamarin.Templates","extensionDir